s"],"de":["Dokumentations-Governance-Framework","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Dokumentationsaufgaben","Echtzeit-Zusammenarbeit","Verfolgung von Änderungen und Versionen"],"pt":["Governança de documentação","Desenvolvimento assistido por IA","Melhoria da eficiência","Colaboração em equipe","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Управление документацией","Разработка с помощью ИИ","Повышение эффективности","Сотрудничество в команде","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["حوكمة الوثائق","التنمية المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الفعالية","التعاون الفريق","التكامل مع أدوات التنمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能开发助手","如何使用devtrail-new","devtrail-new安装指南","devtrail-new替代品","devtrail-new与其他工具的比较","AI辅助开发工具","代码管理最佳实践","文档管理工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","devtrail-newの使い方","devtrail-newのインストールガイド","devtrail-newの代替","devtrail-newと他のツールの比較","AIエージェントによる開発ツール","コード管理のベストプラクティス","ドキュメント管理ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","devtrail-new 사용법","devtrail-new 설치 가이드","devtrail-new 대체품","devtrail-new와 다른 도구의 비교","AI 에이전트가 개발을 지원하는 도구","코드 관리의 베스트 프랙티스","문서 관리 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI","desarrollo asistido por IA","marco de gobernanza de documentación","devtrail-new alternativa","cómo usar devtrail-new","instalación de devtrail-new","guía de configuración de devtrail-new"],"fr":["outils d''IA","développement assisté par l''IA","cadre de gouvernance de la documentation","devtrail-new alternative","comment utiliser devtrail-new","installation de devtrail-new","guide de configuration de devtrail-new"],"de":["KI-Tools","AI-gestützte Entwicklung","Dokumentations-Governance-Framework","devtrail-new Alternative","wie man devtrail-new verwendet","Installation von devtrail-new","Konfigurationsanleitung für devtrail-new"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento assistido por ia","governança de documentação","devtrail-new alternative","devtrail-new vs competitor","instalar devtrail-new","guia de configuração devtrail-new"],"ru":["ии агенты","разработка с помощью ии","управление документацией","devtrail-new альтернатива","devtrail-new vs конкурент","установить devtrail-new","руководство по настройке devtrail-new"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التنمية المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","حوكمة الوثائق","بديل devtrail-new","devtrail-new مقابل المنافس","تثبيت devtrail-new","دليل إعداد devtrail-new"]}},"owner":"Enigmora","repo":"devtrail","repoPath":"Enigmora/devtrail","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.893Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"devtrail-new","description":"Create DevTrail documentation. Analyzes context to suggest document type or accepts explicit type parameter. Always confirms before creating.","bodyPreview":"# DevTrail New Skill\n\nCreate DevTrail documentation based on recent changes.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen invoked, follow these steps:\n\n### 1. Check for Parameters\n\nIf the user specified a document type (e.g., `/devtrail-new ailog`), skip to step 4 using that type.\n\nValid types: `ailog`, `aidec`, `adr`, `eth`, `req`, `tes`, `inc`, `tde`\n\n### 2. Analyze Context\n\nGather information about recent changes:\n\n```bash\n# Get current date\ndate +%Y-%m-%d\n\n# Get modified files (staged and unstaged)\ngit status --p","body":"# DevTrail New Skill\n\nCreate DevTrail documentation based on recent changes.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen invoked, follow these steps:\n\n### 1. Check for Parameters\n\nIf the user specified a document type (e.g., `/devtrail-new ailog`), skip to step 4 using that type.\n\nValid types: `ailog`, `aidec`, `adr`, `eth`, `req`, `tes`, `inc`, `tde`\n\n### 2. Analyze Context\n\nGather information about recent changes:\n\n```bash\n# Get current date\ndate +%Y-%m-%d\n\n# Get modified files (staged and unstaged)\ngit status --porcelain\n\n# Get recent changes summary\ngit diff --stat HEAD~1 2>/dev/null || git diff --stat\n\n# Count lines changed\ngit diff --numstat HEAD~1 2>/dev/null || git diff --numstat\n```\n\n### 3. Classify and Suggest Type\n\nBased on the analysis, suggest a document type:\n\n| Pattern | Suggested Type |\n|---------|---------------|\n| New code in `src/`, `lib/`, `app/` (>10 lines) | AILOG |\n| Multiple implementation alternatives discussed | AIDEC |\n| Structural/architectural changes, new modules | ADR |\n| Files with `auth`, `user`, `privacy`, `gdpr` | ETH (draft) |\n| Test files (`*.test.*`, `*.spec.*`) | TES |\n| Bug fixes, hotfixes | INC |\n| `TODO`, `FIXME`, `HACK` comments added | TDE |\n| Requirements or spec files | REQ |\n\n### 4. Confirm with User\n\n**Always display this confirmation before creating:**\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║  DevTrail New                                                    ║\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\n║                                                                   ║\n║  📊 Analysis:                                                     ║\n║     • Files modified: [N]                                         ║\n║     • Lines changed: [+X / -Y]                                    ║\n║     • Area: [detected area or \"general\"]                          ║\n║                                                                   ║\n║  🎯 Suggested type: [TYPE] ([Full Name])                          ║\n║     Reason: [Brief explanation]                                   ║\n║                                                                   ║\n║  📝 Proposed filename:                                            ║\n║     [TYPE]-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN-[description].md                        ║\n║                                                                   ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nConfirm creation? [Y/n/other type]:\n```\n\nWait for user confirmation before proceeding.\n\n### 5. Check Language Configuration\n\nRead `.devtrail/config.yml` to determine language:\n\n```yaml\nlanguage: en  # or es\n```\n\nUse template path based on language:\n- `en` (default): `.devtrail/templates/TEMPLATE-[TYPE].md`\n- `es`: `.devtrail/templates/i18n/es/TEMPLATE-[TYPE].md`\n\n### 6. Generate Document ID\n\nDetermine the next sequence number:\n\n```bash\n# Find existing documents of this type for today\nls .devtrail/*/[TYPE]-$(date +%Y-%m-%d)-*.md 2>/dev/null | wc -l\n```\n\nID format: `[TYPE]-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN`\n\n### 7. Load Template and Create Document\n\n1. Read the appropriate template\n2. Replace placeholders:\n   - `YYYY-MM-DD` → Current date\n   - `NNN` → Sequence number (001, 002, etc.)\n   - `[agent-name-v1.0]` → `gemini-cli-v1.0`\n3. Fill in context from git analysis\n4. Save to correct location:\n\n| Type | Location |\n|------|----------|\n| AILOG | `.devtrail/07-ai-audit/agent-logs/` |\n| AIDEC | `.devtrail/07-ai-audit/decisions/` |\n| ETH | `.devtrail/07-ai-audit/ethical-reviews/` |\n| ADR | `.devtrail/02-design/decisions/` |\n| REQ | `.devtrail/01-requirements/` |\n| TES | `.devtrail/04-testing/` |\n| INC | `.devtrail/05-operations/incidents/` |\n| TDE | `.devtrail/06-evolution/technical-debt/` |\n\n### 8. Report Result\n\nAfter creation, display:\n\n```\n✅ DevTrail document created:\n   .devtrail/[path]/[TYPE]-YYYY-MM-DD-NNN-description.md\n\n   Review required: [yes/no]\n   Risk level: [low/medium/high/critical]\n```\n\n## Document Type Reference\n\n| Type | Full Name | Purpose |\n|------|-----------|---------|\n| `ailog` | AI Action Log | Record what the AI agent did |\n| `aidec` | AI Decision | Document a technical decision with alternatives |\n| `adr` | Architecture Decision Record | Major architectural decisions |\n| `eth` | Ethical Review | Privacy, bias, responsible AI concerns |\n| `req` | Requirement | System requirements |\n| `tes` | Test Plan | Test strategies and plans |\n| `inc` | Incident Post-mortem | Incident analysis |\n| `tde` | Technical Debt | Identified technical debt |\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n1. **No git repository**: Inform user that git is required for context analysis\n2. **No changes detected**: Ask user to describe what to document\n3. **User declines**: Acknowledge and exit gracefully\n4. **Invalid type parameter**: Show valid types and ask again\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:55:07.891Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated documentation generation for AI-assisted development projects.","zh":"适用于需要自动化文档生成的 AI-assisted 开发项目的开发代理","ja":"AI-assisted 開発プロジェクトで自動化された文書を生産する必要がある開発エージェントに最適","ko":"AI-assisted 개발 프로젝트에서 자동화된 문서 생성이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan generar documentación automatizada para proyectos de desarrollo asistidos por AI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une génération de documentation automatique pour les projets de développement assistés par l''IA.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsbots, die eine automatisierte Dokumentenerstellung für von KI unterstützte Entwicklungsprojekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de geração automática de documentação para projetos de desenvolvimento assistidos por IA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация документации для проектов разработки с помощью ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء التي تحتاج إلى توليد وثائق أوتوماتيكي لمشاريع التطوير المدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive DevTrail documentation based on recent changes, utilizing git status and date analysis, and supporting various document types such as ailog, aidec, and adr.","zh":"通过 git 状态和日期分析支持多种文档类型（ailog、aidec、adr），使代理能够创建基于最近更改的综合 DevTrail 文档","ja":"最近の変更を分析するために git 状態と日付情報を利用し、多種のドキュメント タイプ (ailog、aidec、adr) をサポートすることで、エージェントが包括的な DevTrail ドキュメントを作成できるようにする","ko":"git 상태와 날짜 분석을 통해 다양한 문서 유형 (ailog, aidec, adr)을 지원하여 최근 변경 사항에 기반한 전체 DevTrail 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear una documentación de DevTrail integral basada en los cambios recientes, utilizando el estado de git y el análisis de fechas, y admitiendo varios tipos de documentos como ailog, aidec y adr.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une documentation DevTrail complète basée sur les changements récents, en utilisant l''état de git et l''analyse des dates, et en prenant en charge divers types de documents tels que ailog, aidec et adr.","de":"Ermächtigt die Bots, eine umfassende DevTrail-Dokumentation auf Basis der jüngsten Änderungen zu erstellen, unter Verwendung von git-Status und Datum-Analyse und unterstützt verschiedene Dokumenttypen wie ailog, aidec und adr.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar documentação DevTrail abrangente com base em alterações recentes, utilizando o status do git e análise de datas, e suportando vários tipos de documentos, como ailog, aidec e adr.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать полную документацию DevTrail на основе недавних изменений, используя статус git и анализ дат, и поддерживая различные типы документов, такие как ailog, aidec и adr.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء توثيق شامل لبرنامج DevTrail على أساس التغييرات الأخيرة، باستخدام حالة git وتحليل التواريخ، ودعم أنواع مختلفة من المستندات مثل ailog و aidec و adr."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating documentation updates after code changes","Generating DevTrail documentation for specific document types","Analyzing recent changes using git status and date information"],"zh":["自动更新代码更改后的文档","为特定文档类型生成 DevTrail 文档","使用 git 状态和日期信息分析最近的更改"],"ja":["コード変更後の文書を自動更新する","特定のドキュメント タイプの DevTrail ドキュメントを生成する","git 状態と日付情報を使用して最近の変更を分析する"],"ko":["코드 변경 후 문서를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","특정 문서 유형의 DevTrail 문서를 생성하는 것","git 상태 및 날짜 정보를 사용하여 최근 변경 사항을 분석하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de documentación después de los cambios de código","Generar documentación de DevTrail para tipos de documentos específicos","Analizar los cambios recientes utilizando el estado de git y la información de fecha"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de documentation après les changements de code","Générer la documentation DevTrail pour des types de documents spécifiques","Analyser les changements récents en utilisant l''état de git et les informations de date"],"de":["Automatisieren von Dokumenten-Updates nach Code-Änderungen","Erstellen von DevTrail-Dokumentation für bestimmte Dokumenttypen","Analysieren der jüngsten Änderungen unter Verwendung von git-Status und Datum-Informationen"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de documentação após alterações de código","Gerar documentação DevTrail para tipos de documentos específicos","Analizar alterações recentes usando o status do git e informações de data"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления документации после изменений кода","Генерировать документацию DevTrail для определенных типов документов","Анализировать недавние изменения, используя статус git и информацию о дате"],"ar":["تأتمة تحديثات الوثائق بعد تغييرات في الكود","إنشاء توثيق لبرنامج DevTrail لأنواع محددة من المستندات","تحليل التغييرات الأخيرة باستخدام حالة git ومعلومات التاريخ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git installation and configuration","Limited to specific document types (ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc, tde)"],"zh":["需要 git 安装和配置","仅限于特定的文档类型 (ailog、aidec、adr、eth、req、tes、inc、tde)"],"ja":["git のインストールと設定が必要","特定のドキュメント タイプ (ailog、aidec、adr、eth、req、tes、inc、tde) しかサポートしない"],"ko":["git 설치 및 구성이 필요","특정 문서 유형 (ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc, tde)만 지원"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de git","Limitado a tipos de documentos específicos (ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc, tde)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de git","Limité à des types de documents spécifiques (ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc, tde)"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von git","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Dokumenttypen (ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc, tde)"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do git","Limitado a tipos de documentos específicos (ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc, tde)"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки git","Ограничен определенным типом документов (ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc, tde)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين git","محدود بنوع معين من المستندات (ailog, aidec, adr, eth, req, tes, inc, tde)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9a189daa7d951cfb4cd7da4f48b564d80c9424e148e553ac497ec0dbd7dda624","qualityScore":46}');
