,"Documentación técnica para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Explications détaillées de la technique d''Explications Calibrées","Mise en œuvre de CE dans les projets d''IA","Analyse de données avec des outils de pointe","Intégration avec des frameworks d''IA populaires","Documentation technique pour les développeurs"],"de":["Detaillierte Erklärungen der Technik der Kalibrierten Erklärungen","Implementierung von CE in KI-Projekten","Datenanalyse mit hochmodernen Tools","Integration mit beliebten KI-Frameworks","Technische Dokumentation für Entwickler"],"pt":["Métodos de explicações calibradas","Ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","Repositório de código aberto","Integração com Node.js e Python","CLI para facilidade de uso","Documentação detalhada"],"ru":["Методы каллиброванных объяснений","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","Репозиторий с открытым исходным кодом","Интеграция с Node.js и Python","CLI для простоты использования","Дetailed документация"],"ar":["أساليب توضيحات متكيفة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","مستودع الكود المفتوح","التكامل مع Node.js و Python","CLI لسهولة الاستخدام","توثيق مفصل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 ce-plugin-audit","什么是 Calibrated Explanations (CE)","ce-plugin-audit 替代品","ce-plugin-audit 与其他工具的比较","ce-plugin-audit 安装","ce-plugin-audit 设置指南","AI 工具","代码审计","代码优化"],"ja":["ce-plugin-audit の使用方法","Calibrated Explanations (CE) とは","ce-plugin-audit の代替","ce-plugin-audit と他のツールの比較","ce-plugin-audit のインストール","ce-plugin-audit の設定ガイド","AI エージェント","コード監査","コード最適化"],"ko":["ce-plugin-audit 사용 방법","Calibrated Explanations (CE)란","ce-plugin-audit 대체","ce-plugin-audit와 다른 도구 비교","ce-plugin-audit 설치","ce-plugin-audit 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","코드 감사","코드 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de ia","calibrated explanations","ce-plugin-audit","desarrollo de ia","explicaciones calibradas","ia tools","ce-plugin-audit alternativa","cómo usar ce-plugin-audit"],"fr":["outils d''ia","explications calibrées","ce-plugin-audit","développement d''ia","explications calibrées","ia outils","ce-plugin-audit alternative","comment utiliser ce-plugin-audit"],"de":["ki-tools","kalibrierte erklärungen","ce-plugin-audit","ki-entwicklung","kalibrierte erklärungen","ki-tools","ce-plugin-audit alternative","wie man ce-plugin-audit verwendet"],"pt":["como usar ce-plugin-audit","o que é explicações calibradas","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","ce-plugin-audit vs outros plugins","instalar ce-plugin-audit","guia de configuração ce-plugin-audit","alternativas ao ce-plugin-audit"],"ru":["как использовать ce-plugin-audit","что такое каллиброванные объяснения","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","ce-plugin-audit vs другие плагины","установить ce-plugin-audit","руководство по настройке ce-plugin-audit","альтернативы ce-plugin-audit"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ce-plugin-audit","ما هي التوضيحات المتكيفة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","ce-plugin-audit مقابل برامج أخرى","تثبيت ce-plugin-audit","دليل إعداد ce-plugin-audit","بدائل لبرنامج ce-plugin-audit"]}},"owner":"Moffran","repo":"calibrated_explanations","repoPath":"Moffran/calibrated_explanations","stars":74,"forks":12,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T12:26:27Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ce-plugin-audit","description":">","bodyPreview":"# CE Plugin Audit\n\nYou are auditing a plugin''s conformance with the CE plugin contract.\nRun through each audit dimension below and produce a structured report.\n\n---\n\n## Audit Dimension 1 — `plugin_meta` (ADR-006)\n\nRun `validate_plugin_meta(plugin.plugin_meta)` and check:\n\n| Field | Required | Correct type | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `schema_version` | ✅ | `int` | Must be `1` for current contract |\n| `name` | ✅ | non-empty `str` | Recommend reverse-DNS |\n| `version` | ✅ | non-empty `str` | Sema","body":"# CE Plugin Audit\n\nYou are auditing a plugin''s conformance with the CE plugin contract.\nRun through each audit dimension below and produce a structured report.\n\n---\n\n## Audit Dimension 1 — `plugin_meta` (ADR-006)\n\nRun `validate_plugin_meta(plugin.plugin_meta)` and check:\n\n| Field | Required | Correct type | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `schema_version` | ✅ | `int` | Must be `1` for current contract |\n| `name` | ✅ | non-empty `str` | Recommend reverse-DNS |\n| `version` | ✅ | non-empty `str` | Semantic version |\n| `provider` | ✅ | non-empty `str` | Author/org attribution |\n| `capabilities` | ✅ | non-empty `list[str]` | Each tag non-empty |\n| `trusted` | optional | `bool` | Built-ins set `True`; third-party `False` |\n| `data_modalities` | optional (ADR-033) | `tuple[str, ...]` | Normalised lowercase; validated taxonomy |\n| `plugin_api_version` | optional (ADR-033) | `\"MAJOR.MINOR\"` str | Default `\"1.0\"` |\n\n```python\nfrom calibrated_explanations.plugins.base import validate_plugin_meta\nvalidate_plugin_meta(plugin.plugin_meta)   # raises ValidationError on non-conformance\n```\n\n---\n\n## Audit Dimension 2 — Capability tags (ADR-015)\n\nEach capability tag must match a defined CE capability:\n\n| Expected tag | Plugin type |\n|---|---|\n| `\"interval:classification\"` | Classification calibrator |\n| `\"interval:regression\"` | Regression calibrator |\n| `\"explanation:factual\"`, `\"explanation:alternative\"`, `\"explanation:fast\"` | Explanation |\n| `\"plot:legacy\"`, `\"plot:plotspec\"` | Plot |\n\n**Red flag:** Plugin lists no capability tags, or lists tags it doesn''t implement.\n\n---\n\n## Audit Dimension 3 — Interval calibrator protocol (ADR-013)\n\nIf `\"interval:classification\"` or `\"interval:regression\"` in capabilities:\n\n```python\n# Required: predict_proba must match VennAbers surface exactly\ndef predict_proba(\n    self, x, *, output_interval: bool = False, classes=None, bins=None\n) -> np.ndarray: ...\n# Shapes: (n_samples, n_classes) when output_interval=False\n#         (n_samples, n_classes, 3) when output_interval=True (predict, low, high)\n\ndef is_multiclass(self) -> bool: ...\ndef is_mondrian(self) -> bool: ...\n```\n\nFor regression (`\"interval:regression\"`), additional surface required:\n```python\ndef predict_probability(self, x) -> np.ndarray: ...  # shape (n_samples, 2): (low, high)\ndef predict_uncertainty(self, x) -> np.ndarray: ...  # shape (n_samples, 2): (width, confidence)\ndef pre_fit_for_probabilistic(self, x, y) -> None: ...\ndef compute_proba_cal(self, x, y, *, weights=None) -> np.ndarray: ...\ndef insert_calibration(self, x, y, *, warm_start: bool = False) -> None: ...\n```\n\n**Critical:** `predict_proba` must delegate to VennAbers/IntervalRegressor reference logic\nto preserve calibration guarantees (ADR-021). A plugin that replaces the probability\nmaths wholesale is non-conformant.\n\n**Context immutability:** The plugin must NOT mutate fields in the\n`IntervalCalibratorContext` passed to `create()`.\n\n---\n\n## Audit Dimension 4 — ADR-001: Core / plugin boundary\n\n**FAIL if** the plugin imports anything from `calibrated_explanations.core.*`\nthat is not a protocol, dataclass, or exception:\n\n```python\n# OK — passive types\nfrom calibrated_explanations.core.exceptions import ValidationError\n\n# NOT OK — implementation details\nfrom calibrated_explanations.core.calibrated_explainer import CalibratedExplainer  # red flag\n```\n\nCheck with:\n```bash\ngrep -r \"from calibrated_explanations.core\" src/your_plugin/\n```\n\n---\n\n## Audit Dimension 5 — Fallback visibility (mandatory copilot-instructions.md §7)\n\nAll fallback decisions inside the plugin must be visible:\n```python\nimport warnings, logging\n_LOGGER = logging.getLogger(\"calibrated_explanations.plugins.<name>\")\n\n# BAD — silent fallback\nif something_failed:\n    use_legacy_path()\n\n# GOOD — visible fallback\nif something_failed:\n    msg = \"MyPlugin: <reason>. Falling back to legacy path.\"\n    _LOGGER.info(msg)\n    warnings.warn(msg, UserWarning, stacklevel=2)\n    use_legacy_path()\n```\n\n---\n\n## Audit Dimension 6 — Lazy imports (source-code.instructions.md)\n\nHeavy optional dependencies must be imported lazily:\n```python\n# BAD\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt   # top-level in a module reachable from package root\n\n# GOOD\ndef render(self, ...):\n    import matplotlib.pyplot as plt  # inside function body\n```\n\n---\n\n## Audit Dimension 7 — ADR-033 modality contract (if applicable)\n\nIf the plugin targets a non-tabular modality (`\"image\"`, `\"audio\"`, `\"text\"`,\n`\"timeseries\"`, `\"multimodal\"`, or `\"x-<vendor>-<name>\"`):\n\n- `data_modalities` must be present in `plugin_meta`.\n- Modality strings must be in the canonical taxonomy or use the `x-<vendor>-<name>` namespace.\n- Aliases (`\"vision\" → \"image\"`, `\"time_series\" → \"timeseries\"`) are acceptable inputs but\n  are normalised to canonical form by the registry.\n- `plugin_api_version` must be present; major-version mismatch causes a registry rejection.\n\n---\n\n## Report Template\n\n```\nPlugin Audit Report: <plugin name>\n===================================\nplugin_meta validation:        PASS / FAIL\n  details: <fieldname: issue>\n\nCapability tags:               PASS / FAIL / N_A\n  declared: [...]\n  implemented: [...]\n\nInterval protocol (ADR-013):   PASS / FAIL / N_A\n  predict_proba shape:         PASS / FAIL\n  context immutability:        PASS / FAIL\n  delegates to reference:      YES / NO\n\nADR-001 core boundary:         PASS / FAIL\n  violations: <list>\n\nFallback visibility:           PASS / FAIL\n  missing warn():              <method names>\n\nLazy imports:                  PASS / FAIL\n  eager heavy imports:         <list>\n\nADR-033 modality (if used):    PASS / FAIL / N_A\n  data_modalities:             <value>\n  plugin_api_version:          <value>\n\nOverall:   CONFORMANT / NON-CONFORMANT (N issues)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Evaluation Checklist\n\n- [ ] `validate_plugin_meta()` called and passes.\n- [ ] All declared capabilities have corresponding implementations.\n- [ ] Context not mutated in `create()`.\n- [ ] `predict_proba` delegates to VennAbers / IntervalRegressor for probability maths.\n- [ ] No imports of `core/` implementation details.\n- [ ] Every fallback emits `warnings.warn + _LOGGER.info`.\n- [ ] No eager top-level imports of matplotlib/pandas/joblib.\n- [ ] ADR-033 metadata present if non-tabular modality targeted.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:15:22.127Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Compliance Agents needing advanced plugin auditing capabilities with Calibrated Explanations (CE) plugin contract.","zh":"非常适合需要高级插件审计能力的合规代理，特别是需要使用校准解释（Calibrated Explanations，CE）插件合约的场景。","ja":"コンプライアンスエージェントが高度なプラグイン監査機能を必要とする場合に最適です。具体的には、Calibrated Explanations（CE）プラグイン契約を使用する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 플러그인 감사를 위한 컴플라이언스 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 Calibrated Explanations(CE) 플러그인 계약을 사용하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de cumplimiento que necesitan capacidades de auditoría de plugins avanzadas con el contrato de plugin de Explicaciones Calibradas (CE).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conformité nécessitant des capacités d''audit de plug-in avancées avec le contrat de plug-in d''Explications Calibrées (CE).","de":"Perfekt für Compliance-Agents, die erweiterte Plugin-Überprüfungsfunktionen mit dem Calibrated Explanations (CE)-Plugin-Vertrag benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conformidade que precisam de capacidades de auditoria de plug-in avançadas com o contrato de plug-in de Explicações Calibradas (CE).","ru":"Идеально для агентов соответствия, которым необходимы расширенные возможности аудита плагинов с контрактом плагина Калиброванных Объяснений (CE).","ar":"مثالي لعميل الامتثال الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تدقيق إضافة متقدمة مع عقد إضافة الشروحات المعايرة (CE)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate plugin metadata using the `validate_plugin_meta` function, ensuring conformance with the CE plugin contract, including schema version, name, and version checks, leveraging non-empty strings and integer types.","zh":"赋予代理验证插件元数据的能力，使用 `validate_plugin_meta` 函数来确保遵守 CE 插件合约，包括模式版本、名称、版本检查，利用非空字符串和整数类型。","ja":"エージェントにプラグインメタデータを検証する機能を与え、`validate_plugin_meta` 関数を使用して CE プラグイン契約への準拠を確保します。スキーマバージョン、名前、バージョンのチェックを実行し、空でない文字列および整数型を活用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 플러그인 메타데이터를 검증할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 `validate_plugin_meta` 함수를 사용하여 CE 플러그인 계약을 준수하게 하고, 스키마 버전, 이름, 버전 체크를 수행하며, 비어 있지 않은 문자열과 정수 타입을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar los metadatos del plugin utilizando la función `validate_plugin_meta`, garantizando la conformidad con el contrato de plugin CE, incluyendo comprobaciones de versión de esquema, nombre y versión, utilizando cadenas no vacías y tipos de enteros.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider les métadonnées du plug-in en utilisant la fonction `validate_plugin_meta`, garantissant la conformité avec le contrat de plug-in CE, y compris les vérifications de version de schéma, de nom et de version, en utilisant des chaînes non vides et des types entiers.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Metadaten des Plugins mit der Funktion `validate_plugin_meta` zu validieren, um die Konformität mit dem CE-Plugin-Vertrag sicherzustellen, einschließlich Schema-Version-, Name- und Versionsprüfungen, unter Verwendung nicht leerer Zeichenfolgen und ganzer Zahlen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar os metadados do plug-in usando a função `validate_plugin_meta`, garantindo a conformidade com o contrato do plug-in CE, incluindo verificações de versão do esquema, nome e versão, aproveitando strings não vazias e tipos de inteiros.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверить метаданные плагина с помощью функции `validate_plugin_meta`, обеспечивая соответствие контракту плагина CE, включая проверки версии схемы, имени и версии, используя непустые строки и целочисленные типы.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على التحقق من بيانات التعريف الإضافية باستخدام الدالة `validate_plugin_meta` ، مما يضمن الامتثال لعقد إضافة CE ، بما في ذلك فحص إصدار مخطط البيانات واسم الإصدار ، واستخدام سلاسل غير فارغة وأنواع الأعداد الصحيحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing plugin metadata for schema version compliance","Validating plugin names and versions against the CE contract","Generating structured reports for plugin audit dimensions"],"zh":["审计插件元数据以确保模式版本合规","验证插件名称和版本是否符合 CE 合约","生成结构化报告以审计插件维度"],"ja":["プラグインメタデータを監査してスキーマバージョンの準拠を確保する","プラグイン名とバージョンを CE 契約と比較して検証する","プラグイン監査の要素について構造化レポートを生成する"],"ko":["플러그인 메타데이터를 감사하여 스키마 버전 준수를 확인하는 경우","플러그인 이름과 버전을 CE 계약과 비교하여 검증하는 경우","플러그인 감사 차원에 대한 구조화된 보고서를 생성하는 경우"],"es":["Auditoría de metadatos de plugin para la conformidad con la versión del esquema","Validación de nombres y versiones de plugin contra el contrato CE","Generación de informes estructurados para dimensiones de auditoría de plugin"],"fr":["Audit des métadonnées du plug-in pour la conformité de la version du schéma","Validation des noms et des versions de plug-in par rapport au contrat CE","Génération de rapports structurés pour les dimensions d''audit de plug-in"],"de":["Überprüfung der Metadaten des Plugins auf Schema-Version-Konformität","Validierung von Plugin-Namen und -Versionen gegen den CE-Vertrag","Erstellung strukturierter Berichte für Plugin-Überprüfungsdimensionen"],"pt":["Auditoria de metadados de plug-in para conformidade de versão do esquema","Validação de nomes e versões de plug-in contra o contrato CE","Geração de relatórios estruturados para dimensões de auditoria de plug-in"],"ru":["Аудит метаданных плагина для соответствия версии схемы","Проверка имен и версий плагина против контракта CE","Генерация структурированных отчетов для измерений аудита плагина"],"ar":["تدقيق بيانات التعريف الإضافية لامتثال إصدار مخطط البيانات","التحقق من أسماء وإصدارات الإضافات مقابل عقد CE","توليد تقارير منظمّة لأبعاد تدقيق الإضافة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires implementation of the Calibrated Explanations (CE) plugin contract","Limited to plugins with a `plugin_meta` field","Schema version must be `1` for current contract compliance"],"zh":["需要实现 Calibrated Explanations（CE）插件合约","仅限于具有 `plugin_meta` 字段的插件","模式版本必须为 `1` 才能遵守当前合约"],"ja":["Calibrated Explanations（CE）プラグイン契約を実装する必要がある","『plugin_meta』フィールドを持つプラグインに限定される","スキーマバージョンは `1` でなければ現在の契約に準拠しない"],"ko":["Calibrated Explanations(CE) 플러그인 계약을 구현해야 함","『plugin_meta』 필드를 갖는 플러그인에만 제한됨","스키마 버전은 `1` 이어야 현재 계약을 준수함"],"es":["Requiere la implementación del contrato de plugin de Explicaciones Calibradas (CE)","Limitado a plugins con un campo `plugin_meta`","La versión del esquema debe ser `1` para la conformidad con el contrato actual"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre du contrat de plug-in d''Explications Calibrées (CE)","Limité aux plug-ins avec un champ `plugin_meta`","La version du schéma doit être `1` pour la conformité avec le contrat actuel"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung des Calibrated Explanations (CE)-Plugin-Vertrags","Begrenzt auf Plugins mit einem Feld `plugin_meta`","Die Schema-Version muss `1` sein, um die Konformität mit dem aktuellen Vertrag sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Requer implementação do contrato de plug-in de Explicações Calibradas (CE)","Limitado a plug-ins com um campo `plugin_meta`","A versão do esquema deve ser `1` para conformidade com o contrato atual"],"ru":["Требует реализации контракта плагина Калиброванных Объяснений (CE)","Ограничен плагинами с полем `plugin_meta`","Версия схемы должна быть `1` для соответствия текущему контракту"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ عقد إضافة الشروحات المعايرة (CE)","محدود بالإضافات التي تحتوي على حقل `plugin_meta`","يجب أن يكون إصدار مخطط البيانات `1` لامتثال العقد الحالي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"63796e934d48c3f0abb1d18c2ef5845f06e6146aef1091b10a2ce81dfad91094","qualityScore":45}');
