aja","Personalizable para necesidades específicas"],"fr":["Mailles configurables pour les agents d''IA","Comportement reproductible","Guides et steering pour les agents","Compatibilité avec Claude Code SDK","Fonctionne en arrière-plan pendant que vous travaillez","Personnalisable pour les besoins spécifiques"],"de":["Konfigurierbare Netze für KI-Agenten","Reproduzierbares Verhalten","Leitfäden und Steering für Agenten","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code SDK","Funktioniert im Hintergrund während der Arbeit","Anpassbar für spezifische Anforderungen"],"pt":["Comportamentos de IA reprodutíveis","Direção e guias configuráveis","Integração com Claude Code SDK","Trabalha em segundo plano","Agente de IA configurável"],"ru":["Воспроизводимое поведение ИИ","Настраиваемое управление и ограничения","Интеграция с Claude Code SDK","Работает в фоновом режиме","Настраиваемый агент ИИ"],"ar":["سلوكيات ذكاء اصطناعي قابلة للتكرار","توجيه ومرشدين قابلة للتكوين","التكامل مع Claude Code SDK","يعمل في الخلفية","وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي قابلة للتكوين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体","Mesh Builder","可重复的AI行为","Claude Code SDK","AI开发工具","如何使用Mesh Builder","Mesh Builder教程","AIエージェントの代替","Mesh Builder安装"],"ja":["AIエージェント","メッシュビルダー","再現可能なAIの動作","Claude Code SDK","AI開発ツール","メッシュビルダーの使い方","メッシュビルダーのチュートリアル","AIエージェントの代替","メッシュビルダーのインストール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Mesh Builder","재현 가능한 AI 동작","Claude Code SDK","AI 개발 도구","Mesh Builder 사용법","Mesh Builder 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트의 대체","Mesh Builder 설치"],"es":["cómo usar Mesh Builder","qué es un agente de IA","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","Mesh Builder vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de Mesh Builder","guía de configuración de Mesh Builder","desarrollo de agentes de IA con Mesh Builder"," Mesh Builder para aplicaciones de IA","beneficios de usar Mesh Builder"],"fr":["comment utiliser Mesh Builder","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","Mesh Builder vs autres agents d''IA","installation de Mesh Builder","guide de configuration de Mesh Builder","développement d''agents d''IA avec Mesh Builder","Mesh Builder pour les applications d''IA","avantages de l''utilisation de Mesh Builder"],"de":["wie man Mesh Builder verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Mesh Builder vs andere KI-Agenten","Installation von Mesh Builder","Konfigurationsanleitung für Mesh Builder","Entwicklung von KI-Agenten mit Mesh Builder","Mesh Builder für KI-Anwendungen","Vorteile der Verwendung von Mesh Builder"],"pt":["como usar agente de IA","o que é agente de IA","ferramentas de agente de IA","Mesh Builder alternativa","instalar Mesh Builder","guia de configuração do Mesh Builder"," Claude Code SDK"],"ru":["как использовать агент ИИ","что такое агент ИИ","инструменты агента ИИ","Mesh Builder альтернатива","установить Mesh Builder","руководство по настройке Mesh Builder"," Claude Code SDK"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بناء الشبكة بديل","تثبيت بناء الشبكة","دليل إعداد بناء الشبكة"," Claude Code SDK"]}},"owner":"eighteyes","repo":"tx","repoPath":"eighteyes/tx","stars":9,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-10T18:53:40Z","topics":["agentic","ai","claude-code"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mesh-builder","description":"Build TX V4 meshes - agent configs, prompts, routing. Use for new meshes, agent roles, or multi-agent workflows. Triggers - mesh, routing, agents, multi-agent, config.yaml","bodyPreview":"# Mesh Builder\n\nBuild meshes (agent workflows) for TX V4.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Test prompt output before deploying\ntx prompt <mesh> <agent>              # View built prompt with injected protocol\ntx prompt narrative-engine narrator   # Example\ntx prompt dev --raw                   # Raw output, no metadata\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n| Topic | Location |\n|-------|----------|\n| Config fields | `docs/mesh-config.md` |\n| FSM (state tracking) | `.ai/docs/mesh-fsm-config.md` |\n| Available meshes | `","body":"# Mesh Builder\n\nBuild meshes (agent workflows) for TX V4.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Test prompt output before deploying\ntx prompt <mesh> <agent>              # View built prompt with injected protocol\ntx prompt narrative-engine narrator   # Example\ntx prompt dev --raw                   # Raw output, no metadata\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n| Topic | Location |\n|-------|----------|\n| Config fields | `docs/mesh-config.md` |\n| FSM (state tracking) | `.ai/docs/mesh-fsm-config.md` |\n| Available meshes | `docs/meshes.md` |\n| Message format | `docs/message-format.md` |\n\n## Minimal Config\n\n```yaml\nmesh: example\ndescription: \"What this mesh does\"\n\nagents:\n  - name: worker\n    model: sonnet       # opus | sonnet | haiku\n    prompt: prompt.md\n\nentry_point: worker\n```\n\n## Writing Prompts\n\nFocus on **workflow only**.\n\n### System Auto-Injects (DO NOT WRITE IN PROMPTS):\n- ❌ Message protocol (frontmatter schema, message types, paths format)\n- ❌ Routing instructions (how to write messages to other agents)\n- ❌ Rearmatter format (success_signal, grade, confidence fields)\n- ❌ Workspace structure and paths (auto-injected from config.yaml)\n- ❌ Message file naming conventions\n- ❌ Tool availability and usage instructions (system provides)\n\n### Write ONLY:\n- ✅ Agent role and mandate\n- ✅ Workflow steps (what to do, when)\n- ✅ Decision trees and logic\n- ✅ Domain-specific guidance\n- ✅ Quality gates and success criteria\n\n```markdown\n# {Agent Name}\n\nYou are the {role} agent.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Read incoming task\n2. {Work steps}\n3. Signal completion when finished\n```\n\n## Multi-Agent Routing\n\n```yaml\nrouting:\n  agent-a:\n    complete:\n      agent-b: \"Handoff reason\"\n    blocked:\n      core: \"Need intervention\"\n```\n\nSee `docs/mesh-config.md` for full routing reference.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n**Automatic Session persistence**: `continuation: true` or `continuation: [agent1, agent2]`\n\n**MCP tools only**: `toolRestriction: mcp-only`\n\n**Quality evaluation**: `graded: true` or `graded: [checklist, rubric]`\n\n**FSM state tracking**: `fsm:` block for system-managed state variables and logic. Only use if needed, linear workflows generally don''t need fsm.\n\n**Parallel execution**: `ensemble: { type: parallel }` for FSM states - See `docs/mesh-fsm-config.md` \"Ensemble States\" section\n\n**CRITICAL - FSM Entry Routing**: Entry agents in FSM ensemble meshes MUST fan out to ALL ensemble workers. FSM observes these messages to track state, but explicit routing triggers the workers.\n```yaml\nrouting:\n  entry:\n    complete:\n      worker-1: \"Spawn worker 1\"  # ✅ CORRECT - Fan out to all workers\n      worker-2: \"Spawn worker 2\"\n      worker-3: \"Spawn worker 3\"\n      # core: \"...\"                # ❌ WRONG - Workers never spawn!\n```\n\n**Original task injection**: `injectOriginalMessage: true` - Injects original task into downstream agents\n\n**Design documentation**: `playbook_notes:` - Embed architectural rationale in config (replaces separate READMEs)\n\n**Self-assessment metadata**: `rearmatter:` - Agent outputs self-assessment fields (grade, confidence, status) for FSM routing decisions\n\n**Lifecycle hooks**: Auto-commit, brain insights, quality gates\n\n```yaml\nlifecycle:\n  post:\n    - commit:auto    # Auto-commit changes\n    - brain-update   # Document insights\n```\n\nAvailable hooks: `worktree:create`, `commit:auto`, `brain-update`, `quality:*`. See `docs/mesh-config.md`.\n\n## FSM (State Tracking)\n\nAdd `fsm:` block to track state and provide context to agents.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: If you use FSM, you must also define `routing:` configuration. Routes can exist without FSM, but FSM cannot exist without routes.\n\n**Sequential workflow:**\n```yaml\nfsm:\n  initial: init\n\n  context:\n    turn: 0\n    workspace: null\n\n  states:\n    init:\n      agents: [coordinator]\n      entry:\n        set:\n          turn: \"$((turn + 1))\"\n          workspace: \"/path/to/turn-$turn\"\n      exit:\n        default: awaiting_work\n\n    awaiting_work:\n      agents: [worker]\n      exit:\n        when:\n          - condition: signal == \"PASS\"\n            target: complete\n        default: awaiting_work\n\n  scripts: {}\n```\n\n**Parallel workflow (ensemble):**\n```yaml\nrouting:\n  # Ensemble agents need explicit routing\n  rev-1:\n    complete:\n      synthesizer: \"Review 1 complete\"\n  rev-2:\n    complete:\n      synthesizer: \"Review 2 complete\"\n  rev-3:\n    complete:\n      synthesizer: \"Review 3 complete\"\n\nfsm:\n  initial: parallel_review\n\n  states:\n    parallel_review:\n      ensemble:\n        type: parallel          # Required: type inside ensemble block\n        agents: [rev-1, rev-2, rev-3]\n        aggregation: concat\n      exit:\n        set:\n          results: \"$ENSEMBLE_OUTPUT\"\n        default: synthesize\n\n  scripts: {}\n```\n\n**Agents receive injected context:**\n```markdown\n## FSM Context\nstate: awaiting_work\nturn: 5\nworkspace: /path/to/turn-5\n```\n\nSee `docs/mesh-fsm-config.md` for:\n- Exit-based routing (when/run/default)\n- Ensemble states (parallel execution)\n- Self-loops and iteration tracking\n- Gates and validation\n\n## Documentation\n\n**`playbook_notes` in config.yaml** (for maintainers)\n- Design rationale and architectural decisions\n- WHY the mesh is built this way\n- Alignment with methodologies/patterns\n- Not injected into prompts\n\n**Example:**\n```yaml\nplaybook_notes: |\n  This mesh implements the Ralph pattern from ClaytonFarr/ralph-playbook.\n  Uses layered quality refinement: haiku drafts, sonnet reviews, opus finalizes.\n```\n\n## Debugging\n\n```bash\ntx status    # Workers, queue\ntx msg       # Message viewer\ntx spy       # Real-time activity\ntx logs      # System logs\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:35:19.529Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing reproducible behavior with configurable agent meshes and steering capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要可复制行为的AI代理，并且具有可配置的代理网格和导航能力。","ja":"再現可能な動作が必要なAIエージェントに最適で、構成可能なエージェントメッシュとステアリング機能を備えています。","ko":"재현 가능한 행동이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 구성 가능한 에이전트 메시와 스티어링 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan un comportamiento reprodensible con mallas de agentes configurables y capacidades de dirección.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant un comportement reproductible avec des maillages d''agent configurables et des capacités de direction.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die reproduzierbares Verhalten mit konfigurierbaren Agent-Netzen und Lenkfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de comportamento reprodutível com malhas de agente configuráveis e capacidades de direção.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым требуется воспроизводимое поведение с настраиваемыми сетками агентов и возможностями управления.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى سلوك قابل للتكرار مع شبكات وكيل قابلة للتكوين وقدرات التوجيه."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build meshes for TX V4 using the Claude Code SDK, enabling reproducible AI behavior with injected protocol and state tracking via FSM, and providing raw output options for advanced debugging.","zh":"使得代理能够使用Claude Code SDK为TX V4构建网格，实现可复制的AI行为，并通过FSM注入协议和状态跟踪，提供高级调试的原始输出选项。","ja":"Claude Code SDKを使用してTX V4用のメッシュを構築し、FSMを介したプロトコルの注入とステートトラッキングにより再現可能なAIの動作を可能にし、さらに高度なデバッグ用の生の出力オプションを提供します。","ko":"Claude Code SDK를 사용하여 TX V4용 메시를 구축하고, FSM을 통해 프로토콜을 삽입하고 상태를 추적하여 재현 가능한 AI 동작을 가능하게 하며, 고급 디버깅을 위한 원시 출력 옵션을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir maillages para TX V4 utilizando el SDK Claude Code, lo que permite un comportamiento de IA reprodensible con protocolo inyectado y seguimiento de estado a través de FSM, y proporciona opciones de salida brutas para depuración avanzada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des maillages pour TX V4 en utilisant le SDK Claude Code, ce qui permet un comportement IA reproductible avec un protocole injecté et un suivi d''état via FSM, et fournit des options de sortie brutes pour un débogage avancé.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Netze für TX V4 mit dem Claude Code SDK zu erstellen, was ein reproduzierbares KI-Verhalten mit injiziertem Protokoll und Zustandverfolgung über FSM ermöglicht und bietet Rohausgabemöglichkeiten für erweitertes Debugging.","pt":"Habilita agentes a construir malhas para TX V4 usando o Claude Code SDK, permitindo comportamento de IA reprodutível com protocolo injetado e rastreamento de estado via FSM, e fornecendo opções de saída bruta para depuração avançada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сетки для TX V4 с помощью Claude Code SDK, что позволяет обеспечить воспроизводимое поведение ИИ с помощью внедренного протокола и отслеживания состояния через FSM, и предоставляет варианты необработанного вывода для расширенной отладки.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على بناء الشبكات من أجل TX V4 باستخدام Claude Code SDK، مما يسمح بسلوك قابل للتكرار للذكاء الاصطناعي مع بروتوكول حقن وتتبع الحالة عبر FSM، وتوفير خيارات الإخراج الخام للتصحيح المتقدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Building meshes for agent workflows with customizable config fields","Testing prompt output with injected protocol before deploying","Debugging agent behavior using raw output options and narrative-engine examples"],"zh":["构建具有可定制配置字段的代理工作流的网格","在部署之前使用注入的协议测试提示输出","使用原始输出选项和叙事引擎示例调试代理行为"],"ja":["カスタム可能なコンフィグフィールドを備えたエージェントワークフローのメッシュを構築する","デプロイ前に注入されたプロトコルでプロンプト出力をテストする","生の出力オプションとナラティブエンジンの例を使用してエージェントの動作をデバッグする"],"ko":["사용자 지정 가능한 구성 필드를 갖춘 에이전트 워크플로우의 메시를 구축하는 것","배포하기 전에 삽입된 프로토콜로 프롬프트 출력을 테스트하는 것","원시 출력 옵션과 내레이티브 엔진 예제를 사용하여 에이전트 동작을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Construir maillages para flujos de trabajo de agentes con campos de configuración personalizables","Probar la salida de la invitación con protocolo inyectado antes de implementar","Depurar el comportamiento del agente con opciones de salida brutas y ejemplos de motor de narrativa"],"fr":["Construire des maillages pour les flux de travail d''agent avec des champs de configuration personnalisables","Tester la sortie de l''invite avec un protocole injecté avant de déployer","Déboguer le comportement de l''agent avec des options de sortie brutes et des exemples de moteur de narration"],"de":["Netze für Agent-Workflows mit anpassbaren Konfigurationsfeldern erstellen","Ausgabe der Aufforderung mit injiziertem Protokoll testen, bevor sie bereitgestellt wird","Verhalten des Agents mit Rohausgabemöglichkeiten und Erzählmaschinen-Beispielen debuggen"],"pt":["Construção de malhas para fluxos de trabalho de agentes com campos de configuração personalizáveis","Testar saída de prompt com protocolo injetado antes da implantação","Depurar comportamento de agente usando opções de saída bruta e exemplos de motor de narrativa"],"ru":["Создание сеток для рабочих процессов агентов с настраиваемыми полями конфигурации","Тестирование вывода подсказки с внедренным протоколом перед развертыванием","Отладка поведения агента с помощью необработанных вариантов вывода и примеров движка повествования"],"ar":["بناء الشبكات لتدفقات العمل للوكلاء مع حقول تكوين قابلة للتعديل","اختبار الإخراج العرضي مع بروتوكول حقن قبل النشر","تصحيح سلوك الوكيل باستخدام خيارات الإخراج الخام وأمثلة محرك السرد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code SDK","Specific to TX V4","Needs understanding of FSM for state tracking"],"zh":["需要Claude Code SDK","特定于TX V4","需要了解FSM以进行状态跟踪"],"ja":["Claude Code SDKが必要","TX V4に特有","ステートトラッキングのためにFSMの理解が必要"],"ko":["Claude Code SDK가 필요","TX V4에 특정","상태 추적을 위해 FSM에 대한 이해가 필요"],"es":["Requiere Claude Code SDK","Específico para TX V4","Necesita comprensión de FSM para seguimiento de estado"],"fr":["Nécessite le SDK Claude Code","Spécifique à TX V4","Nécessite une compréhension de FSM pour le suivi d''état"],"de":["Benötigt Claude Code SDK","Spezifisch für TX V4","Benötigt Verständnis von FSM für Zustandverfolgung"],"pt":["Requer Claude Code SDK","Específico para TX V4","Necessita compreensão de FSM para rastreamento de estado"],"ru":["Требует Claude Code SDK","Конкретно для TX V4","Требует понимания FSM для отслеживания состояния"],"ar":["يتطلب Claude Code SDK","محدد لTX V4","يحتاج إلى فهم FSM لتتبع الحالة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c6dfb1e821ddd349e49a0a28a3b2fd95f74aadde18609d8fc5a255ae89b19569","qualityScore":45}');
