ジェクトに注力しています","ko":"openspec-continue-change는 01星球의 11번째 대규모 프로젝트로 스마트 커뮤니티 프로젝트에 중점을 두고 있습니다","es":"El proyecto openspec-continue-change es una iniciativa de comunidad inteligente para desarrolladores","fr":"Le projet openspec-continue-change est une initiative de communauté intelligente pour les développeurs","de":"Das Projekt openspec-continue-change ist eine Initiative für intelligente Gemeinden für Entwickler","pt":"O openspec-continue-change é um projeto de comunidade inteligente que visa criar soluções inovadoras","ru":"ИИ Агент openspec-continue-change - это проект умного сообщества, направленный на создание инновационных решений","ar":"openspec-continue-change هو مشروع مجتمع ذكي يهدف إلى خلق حلول مبتكرة","en":"01星球的第11次大项目。智慧社区项目。"},"definition":{"en":"01星球的第11次大项目。智慧社区项目。"},"features":{"zh":["支持智慧社区项目的开发","集成AI技术提高项目效率","提供智能化解决方案","实现项目的自动化管理","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["スマートコミュニティプロジェクトの開発をサポート","AI技術を統合してプロジェクトの効率を向上させる","スマートなソリューションを提供","プロジェクトの自動化管理を実現","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["스마트 커뮤니티 프로젝트의 개발을 지원","AI 기술을 통합하여 프로젝트의 효율을 향상시킵니다","스마트한 솔루션을 제공","프로젝트의 자동화 관리를 실현","여러 가지 프로그래밍 언어를 지원"],"es":["Proyecto de comunidad inteligente","Utiliza agentes de AI","Desarrollado para desarrolladores","Incluye características de cambio y continuación","Permite la creación de comunidades inteligentes"],"fr":["Projet de communauté intelligente","Utilise des agents d''IA","Développé pour les développeurs","Inclut des fonctionnalités de changement et de continuation","Permet la création de communautés intelligentes"],"de":["Projekt für intelligente Gemeinden","Verwendet KI-Agents","Entwickelt für Entwickler","Enthält Funktionen für Änderung und Fortsetzung","Ermöglicht die Erstellung intelligenter Gemeinden"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de soluções inovadoras","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Criação de comunidades inteligentes","Suporte a desenvolvedores","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento personalizadas"],"ru":["Разработка инновационных решений","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Создание умных сообществ","Поддержка разработчиков","Пользовательские инструменты для разработки"],"ar":["تنمية حلول مبتكرة","التكامل مع تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء مجتمعات ذكية","دعم المطورين","أدوات التطوير المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","openspec-continue-change","智慧社区项目","如何使用openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change安装","openspec-continue-change教程"],"ja":["AIエージェント","openspec-continue-change","スマートコミュニティプロジェクト","openspec-continue-changeの使い方","openspec-continue-changeのインストール","openspec-continue-changeのチュートリアル"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","openspec-continue-change","스마트 커뮤니티 프로젝트","openspec-continue-change 사용법","openspec-continue-change 설치","openspec-continue-change 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo utilizar openspec-continue-change","qué es un agente de AI","alternativas a openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change vs otros proyectos","instalación de openspec-continue-change","guía de configuración de openspec-continue-change","desarrollo de comunidades inteligentes"],"fr":["comment utiliser openspec-continue-change","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","alternatives à openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change vs autres projets","installation d''openspec-continue-change","guide de configuration d''openspec-continue-change","développement de communautés intelligentes"],"de":["wie man openspec-continue-change verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","alternativen zu openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change vs andere projekte","installation von openspec-continue-change","einrichtungsanleitung für openspec-continue-change","entwicklung intelligenter gemeinden"],"pt":["como usar openspec-continue-change","o que é openspec-continue-change","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas para openspec-continue-change","instalação do openspec-continue-change","guia de configuração do openspec-continue-change","desenvolvimento de soluções inovadoras com IA"],"ru":["как использовать openspec-continue-change","что такое openspec-continue-change","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернативы для openspec-continue-change","установка openspec-continue-change","руководство по настройке openspec-continue-change","разработка инновационных решений с ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام openspec-continue-change","ما هو openspec-continue-change","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديلات ل openspec-continue-change","تثبيت openspec-continue-change","دليل إعداد openspec-continue-change","تنمية حلول مبتكرة بالذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"ruan-cat","repo":"11comm","repoPath":"ruan-cat/11comm","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T13:36:52Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ***\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ***\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ***\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T13:15:34.298Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing seamless project continuation and change management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝项目继续和变更管理功能的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがプロジェクトを無停滞で継続的に進め、変更管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 프로젝트를 무중단으로 계속 진행하고 변경 관리 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una continuación de proyecto sin interrupciones y capacidades de gestión de cambios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''une continuation de projet sans interruption et de capacités de gestion de changements.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine nahtlose Projektfortführung und Änderungsmanagementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de continuação de projeto sem interrupções e capacidades de gerenciamento de alterações.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима бесперебойная продолжение проекта и возможности управления изменениями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية الذين يحتاجون إلى استمرار مشروع بدون انقطاع و قدرات إدارة التغييرات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to continue working on changes by creating the next artifact, utilizing the `openspec list --json` command for retrieving available changes and the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, all while handling change name inference and ambiguity resolution through conversation context analysis.","zh":"使代理能够通过创建下一个工件继续处理更改，使用 `openspec list --json` 命令检索可用更改，并使用 AskUserQuestion 工具进行用户选择，同时通过对话上下文分析处理更改名称推断和歧义解决。","ja":"エージェントが変更を続けるために次のアーティファクトを作成できるようにし、`openspec list --json` コマンドを使用して利用可能な変更を取得し、AskUserQuestion ツールを使用してユーザー選択を行い、会話のコンテキスト分析を通じて変更名の推論と曖昧さ解決を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 다음 아티팩트를 생성하여 변경을 계속 처리할 수 있도록 하며, `openspec list --json` 명령을 사용하여 사용 가능한 변경을 검색하고 AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 사용자 선택을 수행하며, 대화 문脈 분석을 통해 변경 이름 추론 및 모호성 해결을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a seguir trabajando en cambios creando el próximo artefacto, utilizando el comando `openspec list --json` para recuperar cambios disponibles y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección del usuario, todo mientras se maneja la inferencia del nombre de cambio y la resolución de ambigüedad a través del análisis del contexto de conversación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de continuer à travailler sur les changements en créant le prochain artefact, en utilisant la commande `openspec list --json` pour récupérer les changements disponibles et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de l''utilisateur, tout en gérant l''inférence du nom de changement et la résolution d''ambiguïté via l''analyse du contexte de conversation.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, weiter an Änderungen zu arbeiten, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen, das `openspec list --json`-Kommando verwenden, um verfügbare Änderungen abzurufen, und das AskUserQuestion-Tool für die Benutzerauswahl, während die Änderungsnameinferenz und die Auflösung von Mehrdeutigkeiten durch die Konversationskontextanalyse gehandhabt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes continuem trabalhando nas alterações, criando o próximo artefato, utilizando o comando `openspec list --json` para recuperar as alterações disponíveis e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção de usuário, lidando com a inferência do nome da alteração e resolução de ambiguidade por meio da análise do contexto da conversa.","ru":"Позволяет агентам продолжать работать над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт, используя команду `openspec list --json` для получения доступных изменений и инструмент AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, обрабатывая вывод имени изменения и разрешение двусмысленностей посредством анализа контекста разговора.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات من خلال إنشاء الملف القادم، باستخدام الأمر `openspec list --json` لاسترجاع التغييرات المتاحة و أداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار المستخدم، معالجة استنتاج اسم التغيير وحل الغموض من خلال تحليل سياق المحادثة."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing unfinished project changes","Managing multiple project artifacts","Resolving change name ambiguity through user prompts"],"zh":["继续未完成的项目更改","管理多个项目工件","通过用户提示解决更改名称模糊性"],"ja":["未完了のプロジェクト変更の続行","複数のプロジェクトアーティファクトの管理","ユーザープロンプトを通じて変更名の曖昧さを解決"],"ko":["미완료 프로젝트 변경의 계속","여러 프로젝트 아티팩트의 관리","사용자 프롬프트를 통해 변경 이름 모호성 해결"],"es":["Continuar cambios de proyecto incompletos","Gestionar múltiples artefactos de proyecto","Resolver ambigüedad de nombre de cambio a través de solicitudes de usuario"],"fr":["Continuer les changements de projet incomplets","Gérer plusieurs artefacts de projet","Résoudre l''ambiguïté du nom de changement via des invites de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Unvollendete Projekänderungen fortsetzen","Mehrere Projektartefakte verwalten","Änderungsname-Mehrdeutigkeit durch Benutzereingaben auflösen"],"pt":["Continuação de alterações de projeto não concluídas","Gerenciamento de vários artefatos de projeto","Resolução de ambiguidade de nome de alteração por meio de prompts de usuário"],"ru":["Продолжение незавершенных изменений проекта","Управление несколькими артефактами проекта","Разрешение двусмысленностей имени изменения с помощью подсказок пользователя"],"ar":["استمرار التغييرات غير المكتملة للمشروع","إدارة ملفات المشروع المتعددة","حل الغموض في اسم التغيير من خلال إشارات المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `openspec` command-line tool access","Dependent on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 changes for user selection"],"zh":["需要 `openspec` 命令行工具访问","依赖于会话上下文进行更改名称推断","仅限于前 3 个更改用于用户选择"],"ja":["`openspec` コマンドラインツールへのアクセスが必要","会話のコンテキストに依存して変更名の推論を行う","ユーザー選択には最初の 3 つの変更のみに限定"],"ko":["`openspec` 명령줄 툴 액세스가 필요","대화 문脈에 의존하여 변경 이름 추론","사용자 선택에는 최상위 3개 변경만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la herramienta de línea de comandos `openspec`","Dependiente del contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre de cambio","Limitado a los 3 primeros cambios para la selección del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à l''outil de ligne de commande `openspec`","Dépend du contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom de changement","Limité aux 3 premiers changements pour la sélection de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das `openspec`-Kommandozeilen-Tool","Abhängig vom Konversationskontext für die Änderungsnameinferenz","Begrenzt auf die ersten 3 Änderungen für die Benutzerauswahl"],"pt":["Exige acesso à ferramenta de linha de comando `openspec`","Depende do contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Limitado às 3 principais alterações para seleção de usuário"],"ru":["Требует доступа к инструменту командной строки `openspec`","Зависит от контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен до 3 лучших изменений для выбора пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أداة سطر الأوامر `openspec`","يعتمد على سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","محدود إلى 3 تغييرات رئيسية لاختيار المستخدم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d0fbc067936de6bea93e611b962d6fa0fd58bcd47b1fe8ee529fa0c97c1afd9d","qualityScore":45}');
