e-process"},"description":{"zh":"该服务使用Spring Boot和Kotlin，结合Zeebe进行流程编排，实现自动化流程","ja":"このサービスはSpring BootとKotlinを使用し、Zeebeを組み込んでプロセスオーケストレーションを実現","ko":"이 서비스는 Spring Boot와 Kotlin을 사용하여 Zeebe를 활용한 프로세스 오케스트레이션을 구현","es":"El servicio de ejemplo utiliza Spring Boot y Kotlin para la automatización de procesos con zeebe.","fr":"Le service exemple utilise Spring Boot et Kotlin pour l''automatisation de processus avec zeebe.","de":"Der Beispiel-Service verwendet Spring Boot und Kotlin für die Automatisierung von Prozessen mit zeebe.","pt":"Exemplo de serviço de orquestração de processos com Spring Boot, Kotlin e Zeebe. Automatize seus processos com bpmn","ru":"Пример сервиса оркестровки процессов с Spring Boot, Kotlin и Zeebe. Автоматизируйте свои процессы с bpmn","ar":"مثال لخدمة تنسيق العمليات مع Spring Boot و Kotlin و Zeebe. آليّة عملياتك مع bpmn","en":"A spring-boot and kotlin example service using zeebe for process-orchestration ⭐"},"definition":{"en":"A spring-boot and kotlin example service using zeebe for process-orchestration ⭐"},"features":{"zh":["使用Spring Boot和Kotlin开发","Zeebe进行流程编排","实现自动化流程","支持BPMN标准","高可扩展性和可靠性"],"ja":["Spring BootとKotlinを使用した開発","Zeebeを使用したプロセスオーケストレーション","自動化プロセスの実現","BPMN標準のサポート","高可拡張性と高可頼性"],"ko":["Spring Boot와 Kotlin을 사용한 개발","Zeebe를 사용한 프로세스 오케스트레이션","자동화 프로세스의 구현","BPMN 표준의 지원","고가용성과 고신뢰성"],"es":["Integración con zeebe para la orquestación de procesos","Desarrollo con Spring Boot y Kotlin","Automatización de tareas y flujos de trabajo","Ejemplo de servicio para la implementación de procesos","Soporte para BPMN"],"fr":["Intégration avec zeebe pour l''orchestration de processus","Développement avec Spring Boot et Kotlin","Automatisation de tâches et de flux de travail","Exemple de service pour la mise en œuvre de processus","Support pour BPMN"],"de":["Integration mit zeebe für die Prozessorchestrierung","Entwicklung mit Spring Boot und Kotlin","Automatisierung von Aufgaben und Workflows","Beispiel-Service für die Implementierung von Prozessen","Unterstützung für BPMN"],"pt":["Exemplo de serviço de orquestração de processos com Spring Boot e Zeebe","Uso de bpmn para modelar processos","Integração com Kotlin para desenvolvimento de serviços","Suporte à automação de processos com Zeebe","Exemplo de código para iniciar seu projeto"],"ru":["Пример сервиса оркестровки процессов с Spring Boot и Zeebe","Использование bpmn для моделирования процессов","Интеграция с Kotlin для разработки сервисов","Поддержка автоматизации процессов с Zeebe","Пример кода для запуска вашего проекта"],"ar":["مثال لخدمة تنسيق العمليات مع Spring Boot و Zeebe","استخدام bpmn لنمذجة العمليات","التكامل مع Kotlin لتنمية الخدمات","دعم آليّة العمليات مع Zeebe","مثال للكود لبدء مشروعك"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Zeebe进行流程编排","什么是BPMN标准","Spring Boot和Kotlin的区别","Zeebe与其他流程引擎的比较","自动化流程服务的安装和配置","AI智能代理的应用场景"],"ja":["Zeebeを使用したプロセスオーケストレーションの方法","BPMN標準とは","Spring BootとKotlinの違い","Zeebeと他のプロセスエンジンの比較","自動化プロセスサービスのインストールと設定","AIエージェントの適用场景"],"ko":["Zeebe를 사용한 프로세스 오케스트레이션 방법","BPMN 표준이란","Spring Boot와 Kotlin의 차이","Zeebe와 다른 프로세스 엔진의 비교","자동화 프로세스 서비스의 설치와 설정","AI 에이전트의 적용场景"],"es":["automatización de procesos","herramientas de automatización","Spring Boot","Kotlin","zeebe","BPMN","cómo usar zeebe","alternativas a zeebe","instalación de zeebe","guía de configuración de zeebe"],"fr":["automatisation de processus","outils d''automatisation","Spring Boot","Kotlin","zeebe","BPMN","comment utiliser zeebe","alternatives à zeebe","installation de zeebe","guide de configuration de zeebe"],"de":["Prozessautomatisierung","AI-Tools","Spring Boot","Kotlin","zeebe","BPMN","wie man zeebe verwendet","Alternative zu zeebe","Installation von zeebe","Konfigurationsguide für zeebe"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","automação de processos","spring boot","kotlin","zeebe","bpmn","como usar zeebe","o que é automação de processos","alternativas para zeebe","zeebe vs outras ferramentas"],"ru":["инструменты ии","автоматизация процессов","spring boot","kotlin","zeebe","bpmn","как использовать zeebe","что такое автоматизация процессов","альтернативы для zeebe","zeebe vs другие инструменты"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","آليّة العمليات","spring boot","kotlin","zeebe","bpmn","كيفية استخدام zeebe","ما هي آليّة العمليات","بديلات ل zeebe","zeebe مقابل أدوات أخرى"]}},"owner":"emaarco","repo":"easy-zeebe","repoPath":"emaarco/easy-zeebe","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T07:29:30Z","topics":["bpmn","kotlin","spring","zeebe"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"automate-process","description":"Generate full hexagonal glue-code for a Zeebe BPMN process across all five layers — inbound workers, inbound/outbound port interfaces, application services, and a process out-adapter. Use when the user asks to automate a process, generate glue-code for a BPMN process, or scaffold workers and adapters. Accepts a ProcessApi file, a BPMN model, or a plain description; skips files that already exist; optionally runs the review-process audit first.","bodyPreview":"# Skill: automate-process\n\nGenerate full hexagonal-architecture glue-code for automating a Zeebe BPMN process:\njob workers, process out-adapter, inbound/outbound port interfaces, and application service stubs.\n\n## What This Skill Creates\n\n// TODO: use a list instead of a layer like\n\n- Inbound Workers: stored in `adapter/inbound/zeebe` with one `@JobWorker` per serviceTask\n\n| Layer                | Location                     | What                                     |\n|----------------------|-","body":"# Skill: automate-process\n\nGenerate full hexagonal-architecture glue-code for automating a Zeebe BPMN process:\njob workers, process out-adapter, inbound/outbound port interfaces, and application service stubs.\n\n## What This Skill Creates\n\n// TODO: use a list instead of a layer like\n\n- Inbound Workers: stored in `adapter/inbound/zeebe` with one `@JobWorker` per serviceTask\n\n| Layer                | Location                     | What                                     |\n|----------------------|------------------------------|------------------------------------------|\n| Inbound workers      | `adapter/inbound/zeebe/`     | One `@JobWorker` class per service task  |\n| Outbound adapter     | `adapter/outbound/zeebe/`    | One process out-adapter class            |\n| Inbound ports        | `application/port/inbound/`  | One use-case interface per worker        |\n| Outbound port        | `application/port/outbound/` | One process port interface               |\n| Application services | `application/service/`       | One service class per use-case interface |\n\nThe adapter and worker files reference these interfaces so the hexagonal wiring is complete from the start.\n\n## IMPORTANT\n\n**All string constants must come from the ProcessApi — never use raw string literals.**\n\n- Worker `@JobWorker(type = ...)` → `ProcessApi.TaskTypes.CONSTANT`\n- Adapter `startProcess(processId = ...)` → `ProcessApi.PROCESS_ID`\n- Adapter `sendMessage(messageName = ...)` → `ProcessApi.Messages.CONSTANT`\n- Variable keys → `ProcessApi.Variables.CONSTANT` where defined\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Preparation – Validate the BPMN model first\n\nBefore generating any code, ask the user whether he has already performed the `review-process` subagent - and ask him\nwhether you should do it. This is very useful, to only generate code for clean processes that follow the styleguide.\n\nIf the user agrees to running the subagent, then start it, but terminate the execution of this skill. Tell the user to\nwait until the `review-process` agent is done.\n\nAfter that he must fully restart the `automate-process` once again\nIf he disagrees to perform the `review` agent, continue with step 1.\n\n### Step 1 – Resolve the input source\n\nDetermine where the process constants come from based on `$ARGUMENTS`:\n\n- **ProcessApi file (`.kt`)**: read it directly. Extract: package name, object name, `PROCESS_ID`, all `TaskTypes.*`,\n  `Messages.*`, `Signals.*` (if present), and `Variables.*` constants.\n- **BPMN file (`.bpmn`)**: search the same service module for a `*ProcessApi.kt` file (Glob\n  `**/adapter/process/*ProcessApi.kt`). If found, read it as above. If not found, ask the user whether to continue\n  without type-safe constants.\n- **No argument / plain description**: search the whole codebase for `*ProcessApi.kt` files (Glob\n  `**/adapter/process/*ProcessApi.kt`). List them and ask the user which one to use.\n\nIf you can''t find a ProcessApi, pause the execution of the skill, and ask the user to generate one first.\n\n### Step 2 – Determine packages and source root\n\nDerive the base package from the ProcessApi package. Example:\n\n- ProcessApi: `io.miragon.example.adapter.process`\n- Base: `io.miragon.example`\n- Inbound workers: `<base>.adapter.inbound.zeebe`\n- Outbound adapter: `<base>.adapter.outbound.zeebe`\n- Inbound ports: `<base>.application.port.inbound`\n- Outbound port: `<base>.application.port.outbound`\n- Services: `<base>.application.service`\n\n### Step 2.5 – Discover existing domain types\n\nBefore generating any port or adapter code, scan the domain package (`<base>.domain`) for existing value objects.\n\nFor each `Variables.*` constant in the ProcessApi:\n\n- Derive a candidate domain type name by converting the constant to PascalCase\n  (e.g. `NEWSLETTER_ID` → `NewsletterId`, `SUBSCRIPTION_ID` → `SubscriptionId`)\n- If a variable name makes no sense as a domain type name, ask the developer for feedback\n- Check if a file with that name exists under `**/domain/<TypeName>.kt`\n- If found, read it and note the class name and its primary constructor parameter type (typically `UUID` or `String`)\n\nIf no suitable domain type exists for a variable, **create one** (a Kotlin `data class` wrapping `UUID` or `String`,\nwith a secondary `String` constructor when the primary wraps `UUID`) **before** generating ports or adapters.\n\n### Step 3 – Generate inbound port interfaces (use cases)\n\nFor each `TaskTypes.*` constant, generate a use-case interface. Name convention: derive a meaningful interface name from\nthe task type constant (e.g. `NEWSLETTER_ABORT_REGISTRATION` → `AbortSubscriptionUseCase`).\n\nGenerated structure:\n\n- Interface with one method matching the worker''s action\n- Method parameters must use domain types discovered in Step 2.5 — never raw `String` or `UUID`\n\nSkip if file already exists.\n\n### Step 4 – Generate outbound port interface\n\nGenerate one outbound port interface for the process. Name convention: derive from the process name (e.g.\n`NewsletterSubscription` → `NewsletterSubscriptionProcess`).\n\nGenerated structure:\n\n- `startProcess` method (returns `Long`) — or a message-send method if the process uses a message start event\n- One method per `Messages.*` constant\n- All method parameters use domain types discovered in Step 2.5\n\nSkip if file already exists.\n\n### Step 5 – Generate application services\n\nFor each inbound use-case interface, generate an application service implementing it. Name convention: append `Service`\nto the use-case name (e.g. `AbortSubscriptionUseCase` → `AbortSubscriptionService`).\n\nGenerated structure:\n\n- `@Service` class implementing the use-case interface\n- `override fun` with domain type parameters (matching the use-case interface) and `TODO(\"Add implementation\")` body\n\nSkip if file already exists.\n\n### Step 6 – Generate workers (with use-case injection)\n\nSame as `/create-worker` Step 3, but inject the generated use-case interface as the constructor parameter instead of\na placeholder. Apply the same `@Variable` / `@VariableAsType` guidance from that step.\n\nWorker `handle` method parameters must be **primitive types** (`UUID`, `String`) annotated with `@Variable`;\nconvert them to domain types inside the body before calling the use case\n(e.g. `useCase.handle(NewsletterId(newsletterId))`).\n\n### Step 7 – Generate process out-adapter (implementing outbound port)\n\nSame as `/create-process-adapter` Step 3, but add `: ProcessNameProcess` to the class declaration so it implements the\noutbound port interface. Mark each method with `override`.\n\nAdapter methods must accept **domain types** as parameters. Inside the method body, extract the primitive value\n(e.g. `id.value.toString()`) before passing to `engineApi.startProcess` / `engineApi.sendMessage`.\n\n### Step 8 – Report\n\nList every file created or skipped. Remind the developer to:\n\n1. Run `/test-worker` for each worker\n2. Run `/test-process-adapter` for the adapter\n3. Run `/test-process` to generate process integration tests\n\nOffer to run these test-generation commands right away."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T02:00:11.740Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Process Automation Agents requiring advanced Zeebe BPMN process orchestration capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级Zeebe BPMN流程编排能力的流程自动化代理。","ja":"Zeebe BPMNプロセスオーケストレーションの高度な機能を必要とするプロセス自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Zeebe BPMN 프로세스 오케스트레이션 기능을 요구하는 프로세스 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Procesos que requieren capacidades de orquestación de procesos Zeebe BPMN avanzadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation de processus nécessitant des capacités d''orchestration de processus Zeebe BPMN avancées.","de":"Ideal für Prozessautomationsagenten, die erweiterte Zeebe BPMN-Prozessorchestrierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Processos que exigem capacidades avançadas de orquestração de processos Zeebe BPMN.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации процессов, требующих расширенных возможностей оркестровки процессов Zeebe BPMN.","ar":"مثالي لعميل أتمتة العمليات التي تتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لترتيب العمليات Zeebe BPMN."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate complex business processes using Zeebe, generating hexagonal-architecture glue-code for job workers, process out-adapters, and application service stubs, leveraging Spring Boot and Kotlin.","zh":"赋予代理使用Zeebe自动化复杂业务流程的能力，生成六边形架构粘合代码，用于作业工作者、流程出适配器和应用服务桩，利用Spring Boot和Kotlin。","ja":"Zeebeを使用して複雑なビジネスプロセスを自動化するエージェントの能力を提供し、六角形アーキテクチャのグルー・コードを生成し、ジョブ・ワーカー、プロセス・アウト・アダプター、及びアプリケーション・サービス・スタブに利用するSpring BootとKotlinを活用する。","ko":"Zeebe를 사용하여 복잡한 비즈니스 프로세스를 자동화하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 六角형 아키텍처의 글루 코드를 생성하여 작업자, 프로세스 아웃 어댑터 및 애플리케이션 서비스 스텁에 사용하며, Spring Boot와 Kotlin을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar procesos comerciales complejos utilizando Zeebe, generando código de pegamento de arquitectura hexagonal para trabajadores de tareas, adaptadores de proceso de salida y stubs de servicio de aplicación, aprovechando Spring Boot y Kotlin.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser des processus métier complexes en utilisant Zeebe, en générant du code de colle d''architecture hexagonale pour les travailleurs de tâches, les adaptateurs de processus de sortie et les stubs de service d''application, en exploitant Spring Boot et Kotlin.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Geschäftsprozesse mit Zeebe zu automatisieren, indem sie hexagonale Architektur-Verbindungscode für Jobarbeiter, Prozessausgangsadapter und Anwendungsservice-Stubs generieren, wobei Spring Boot und Kotlin genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar processos de negócios complexos usando Zeebe, gerando código cola de arquitetura hexagonal para trabalhadores de tarefas, adaptadores de processos de saída e stubs de serviço de aplicação, aproveitando Spring Boot e Kotlin.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать сложные бизнес-процессы с помощью Zeebe, генерируя код для рабочих процессов, адаптеров входящих и исходящих портов, а также заглушек сервиса приложения, используя Spring Boot и Kotlin.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أتمتة عمليات الأعمال المعقدة باستخدام Zeebe، مما يولد رمز لاصق لهندسة متعددة الزوايا لعمال المهام، وموصلات عملية الإخراج، وخيوط خدمة التطبيق، مستفيدا من Spring Boot وKotlin."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Zeebe BPMN processes with custom job workers","Generating inbound and outbound port interfaces for seamless integration","Creating application service stubs for efficient process orchestration"],"zh":["使用自定义作业工作者自动化Zeebe BPMN流程","生成入站和出站端口接口以实现无缝集成","创建应用服务桩以实现高效的流程编排"],"ja":["カスタムジョブワーカーを使用してZeebe BPMNプロセスを自動化する","入力および出力ポートインターフェイスを生成してシームレスな統合を実現する","アプリケーションサービススタブを作成して効率的なプロセスオーケストレーションを実現する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 작업자를 사용하여 Zeebe BPMN 프로세스를 자동화하는こと","입력 및 출력 포트 인터페이스를 생성하여無縫な 통합을 실현하는こと","애플리케이션 서비스 스텁을 생성하여 효율적인 프로세스 오케스트레이션을 실현하는こと"],"es":["Automatizar procesos Zeebe BPMN con trabajadores de tareas personalizados","Generar interfaces de puertos de entrada y salida para una integración sin problemas","Crear stubs de servicio de aplicación para una orquestación de procesos eficiente"],"fr":["Automatiser des processus Zeebe BPMN avec des travailleurs de tâches personnalisés","Générer des interfaces de ports d''entrée et de sortie pour une intégration transparente","Créer des stubs de service d''application pour une orchestration de processus efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung von Zeebe-BPMN-Prozessen mit benutzerdefinierten Jobarbeitern","Generierung von Schnittstellen für Ein- und Ausgangsports für eine nahtlose Integration","Erstellung von Anwendungsservice-Stubs für eine effiziente Prozessorchestrierung"],"pt":["Automatizar processos Zeebe BPMN com trabalhadores de tarefas personalizados","Gerar interfaces de portas de entrada e saída para integração perfeita","Criar stubs de serviço de aplicação para orquestração de processos eficiente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процессы Zeebe BPMN с помощью пользовательских рабочих процессов","Генерировать входные и исходящие интерфейсы портов для бесперебойной интеграции","Создавать заглушки сервиса приложения для эффективной оркестровки процессов"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات Zeebe BPMN باستخدام عمال مهام مخصصة","توليد واجهات منفذ الدخول والخروج من أجل التكامل السلس","إنشاء خيوط خدمة التطبيق من أجل ترتيب العمليات الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Zeebe setup and configuration","Limited to Spring Boot and Kotlin environments","Dependent on Zeebe BPMN process models"],"zh":["需要Zeebe设置和配置","仅限Spring Boot和Kotlin环境","依赖于Zeebe BPMN流程模型"],"ja":["Zeebeの設定と構成が必要","Spring BootとKotlinの環境のみ","Zeebe BPMNプロセスモデルに依存"],"ko":["Zeebe 설정 및 구성이 필요함","Spring Boot 및 Kotlin 환경에만 제한됨","Zeebe BPMN 프로세스 모델에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración y setup de Zeebe","Limitado a entornos Spring Boot y Kotlin","Dependiente de modelos de proceso Zeebe BPMN"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et un setup de Zeebe","Limité aux environnements Spring Boot et Kotlin","Dépendant des modèles de processus Zeebe BPMN"],"de":["Benötigt Zeebe-Setup und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Spring-Boot- und Kotlin-Umgebungen","Abhängig von Zeebe-BPMN-Prozessmodellen"],"pt":["Exige configuração e setup do Zeebe","Limitado a ambientes Spring Boot e Kotlin","Dependente de modelos de processo Zeebe BPMN"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации Zeebe","Ограничен средами Spring Boot и Kotlin","Зависит от моделей процессов Zeebe BPMN"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادا وتكوينا لبرنامج Zeebe","محدود بالبيئات Spring Boot وKotlin","يعتمد على نماذج العمليات Zeebe BPMN"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d14e88d4a1648c100e0ac5200840a34364cad5ab9187d1757e386ee9012cbbdb","qualityScore":45}');
