ins pour répondre à des besoins spécifiques","Compatibilité avec React, Python et Node.js"],"de":["Anpassung von KI-Agents","Verbesserung der Effizienz von Tools","Integration mit der Resilienzplattform","Konfiguration von Plugins für spezifische Anforderungen","Kompatibilität mit React, Python und Node.js"],"pt":["Configuração de plugins personalizados","Otimização de workflows com Ferramentas de IA","Integração com a Plataforma de Resiliência","Melhoria da eficiência e escalabilidade","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Настройка пользовательских плагинов","Оптимизация рабочих процессов с помощью ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с платформой устойчивости","Улучшение эффективности и масштабируемости","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки"],"ar":["تكوين البرامج المساعدة المخصصة","تحسين سير العمل باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع منصة الصلابة","تحسين الكفاءة والتماسك","دعم بيئات متعددة للتطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用插件设置","什么是Resilience Platform","插件设置教程","Resilience Platform插件设置","插件设置与开发效率","如何安装插件","插件设置最佳实践"],"ja":["プラグイン設定の使い方","Resilience Platformとは","プラグイン設定チュートリアル","Resilience Platformプラグイン設定","プラグイン設定と開発効率","プラグインのインストール方法","プラグイン設定ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["플러그인 설정 사용법","Resilience Platform이란","플러그인 설정 튜토리얼","Resilience Platform 플러그인 설정","플러그인 설정과 개발 효율성","플러그인 설치 방법","플러그인 설정 모범 사례"],"es":["cómo configurar plugins para agentes de IA","agentes de IA para la Plataforma de Resiliencia","alternativas a plugins de agentes de IA","instalación de plugins para agentes de IA","guía de configuración de plugins para agentes de IA","beneficios de la configuración de plugins para agentes de IA","mejora de la eficiencia de las herramientas con plugins de agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment configurer des plugins pour les outils d''IA","outils d''IA pour la Plateforme de Résilience","alternatives aux plugins d''outils d''IA","installation de plugins pour les outils d''IA","guide de configuration de plugins pour les outils d''IA","avantages de la configuration de plugins pour les outils d''IA","amélioration de l''efficacité des outils avec des plugins d''outils d''IA"],"de":["wie konfiguriert man Plugins für KI-Agents","KI-Agents für die Resilienzplattform","Alternativen zu Plugins für KI-Agents","Installation von Plugins für KI-Agents","Anleitung zur Konfiguration von Plugins für KI-Agents","Vorteile der Konfiguration von Plugins für KI-Agents","Verbesserung der Effizienz von Tools mit Plugins für KI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar plugins de IA","o que é plataforma de resiliência","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","plugin settings para plataforma de resiliência","alternativas para plataforma de resiliência","guia de instalação de plugins de IA","configuração de plugins personalizados","otimização de workflows com IA"],"ru":["как использовать плагины ИИ","что такое платформа устойчивости","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","настройки плагина для платформы устойчивости","альтернативы для платформы устойчивости","руководство по установке плагинов ИИ","настройка пользовательских плагинов","оптимизация рабочих процессов с помощью ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام البرامج المساعدة الذكية","ما هي منصة الصلابة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","إعدادات البرنامج المساعد لمنصة الصلابة","بديل لمنصة الصلابة","دليل تثبيت البرامج المساعدة الذكية","تكوين البرامج المساعدة المخصصة","تحسين سير العمل باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"SS2608-dev","repo":"Resilience","repoPath":"SS2608-dev/Resilience","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T10:28:55Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Plugin Settings","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks about plugin settings, store plugin configuration, user-configurable plugin, .local.md files, plugin state files, read YAML frontmatter, per-project plugin settings, or wants to make plugin behavior configurable. Documents the .claude/plugin-name.local.md pattern for storing plugin-specific configuration with YAML frontmatter and markdown content.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Plugin Settings Pattern for Claude Code Plugins\n\n## Overview\n\nPlugins can store user-configurable settings and state in `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` files within the project directory. This pattern uses YAML frontmatter for structured configuration and markdown content for prompts or additional context.\n\n**Key characteristics:**\n\n- File location: `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` in project root\n- Structure: YAML frontmatter + markdown body\n- Purpose: Per-project plugin configuration and state","body":"# Plugin Settings Pattern for Claude Code Plugins\n\n## Overview\n\nPlugins can store user-configurable settings and state in `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` files within the project directory. This pattern uses YAML frontmatter for structured configuration and markdown content for prompts or additional context.\n\n**Key characteristics:**\n\n- File location: `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` in project root\n- Structure: YAML frontmatter + markdown body\n- Purpose: Per-project plugin configuration and state\n- Usage: Read from hooks, commands, and agents\n- Lifecycle: User-managed (not in git, should be in `.gitignore`)\n\n## File Structure\n\n### Basic Template\n\n```markdown\n---\nenabled: true\nsetting1: value1\nsetting2: value2\nnumeric_setting: 42\nlist_setting: [\"item1\", \"item2\"]\n---\n\n# Additional Context\n\nThis markdown body can contain:\n\n- Task descriptions\n- Additional instructions\n- Prompts to feed back to Claude\n- Documentation or notes\n```\n\n### Example: Plugin State File\n\n**.claude/my-plugin.local.md:**\n\n```markdown\n---\nenabled: true\nstrict_mode: false\nmax_retries: 3\nnotification_level: info\ncoordinator_session: team-leader\n---\n\n# Plugin Configuration\n\nThis plugin is configured for standard validation mode.\nContact @team-lead with questions.\n```\n\n## Reading Settings Files\n\n### From Hooks (Bash Scripts)\n\n**Pattern: Check existence and parse frontmatter**\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\n# Define state file path\nSTATE_FILE=\".claude/my-plugin.local.md\"\n\n# Quick exit if file doesn''t exist\nif [[ ! -f \"$STATE_FILE\" ]]; then\n  exit 0  # Plugin not configured, skip\nfi\n\n# Parse YAML frontmatter (between --- markers)\nFRONTMATTER=$(sed -n ''/^---$/,/^---$/{ /^---$/d; p; }'' \"$STATE_FILE\")\n\n# Extract individual fields\nENABLED=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^enabled:'' | sed ''s/enabled: *//'' | sed ''s/^\"\\(.*\\)\"$/\\1/'')\nSTRICT_MODE=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^strict_mode:'' | sed ''s/strict_mode: *//'' | sed ''s/^\"\\(.*\\)\"$/\\1/'')\n\n# Check if enabled\nif [[ \"$ENABLED\" != \"true\" ]]; then\n  exit 0  # Disabled\nfi\n\n# Use configuration in hook logic\nif [[ \"$STRICT_MODE\" == \"true\" ]]; then\n  # Apply strict validation\n  # ...\nfi\n```\n\nSee `examples/read-settings-hook.sh` for complete working example.\n\n### From Commands\n\nCommands can read settings files to customize behavior:\n\n```markdown\n---\ndescription: Process data with plugin\nallowed-tools: [\"Read\", \"Bash\"]\n---\n\n# Process Command\n\nSteps:\n\n1. Check if settings exist at `.claude/my-plugin.local.md`\n2. Read configuration using Read tool\n3. Parse YAML frontmatter to extract settings\n4. Apply settings to processing logic\n5. Execute with configured behavior\n```\n\n### From Agents\n\nAgents can reference settings in their instructions:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: configured-agent\ndescription: Agent that adapts to project settings\n---\n\nCheck for plugin settings at `.claude/my-plugin.local.md`.\nIf present, parse YAML frontmatter and adapt behavior according to:\n\n- enabled: Whether plugin is active\n- mode: Processing mode (strict, standard, lenient)\n- Additional configuration fields\n```\n\n## Parsing Techniques\n\n### Extract Frontmatter\n\n```bash\n# Extract everything between --- markers\nFRONTMATTER=$(sed -n ''/^---$/,/^---$/{ /^---$/d; p; }'' \"$FILE\")\n```\n\n### Read Individual Fields\n\n**String fields:**\n\n```bash\nVALUE=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^field_name:'' | sed ''s/field_name: *//'' | sed ''s/^\"\\(.*\\)\"$/\\1/'')\n```\n\n**Boolean fields:**\n\n```bash\nENABLED=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^enabled:'' | sed ''s/enabled: *//'')\n# Compare: if [[ \"$ENABLED\" == \"true\" ]]; then\n```\n\n**Numeric fields:**\n\n```bash\nMAX=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^max_value:'' | sed ''s/max_value: *//'')\n# Use: if [[ $MAX -gt 100 ]]; then\n```\n\n### Read Markdown Body\n\nExtract content after second `---`:\n\n```bash\n# Get everything after closing ---\nBODY=$(awk ''/^---$/{i++; next} i>=2'' \"$FILE\")\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Temporarily Active Hooks\n\nUse settings file to control hook activation:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nSTATE_FILE=\".claude/security-scan.local.md\"\n\n# Quick exit if not configured\nif [[ ! -f \"$STATE_FILE\" ]]; then\n  exit 0\nfi\n\n# Read enabled flag\nFRONTMATTER=$(sed -n ''/^---$/,/^---$/{ /^---$/d; p; }'' \"$STATE_FILE\")\nENABLED=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^enabled:'' | sed ''s/enabled: *//'')\n\nif [[ \"$ENABLED\" != \"true\" ]]; then\n  exit 0  # Disabled\nfi\n\n# Run hook logic\n# ...\n```\n\n**Use case:** Enable/disable hooks without editing hooks.json (requires restart).\n\n### Pattern 2: Agent State Management\n\nStore agent-specific state and configuration:\n\n**.claude/multi-agent-swarm.local.md:**\n\n```markdown\n---\nagent_name: auth-agent\ntask_number: 3.5\npr_number: 1234\ncoordinator_session: team-leader\nenabled: true\ndependencies: [\"Task 3.4\"]\n---\n\n# Task Assignment\n\nImplement JWT authentication for the API.\n\n**Success Criteria:**\n\n- Authentication endpoints created\n- Tests passing\n- PR created and CI green\n```\n\nRead from hooks to coordinate agents:\n\n```bash\nAGENT_NAME=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^agent_name:'' | sed ''s/agent_name: *//'')\nCOORDINATOR=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^coordinator_session:'' | sed ''s/coordinator_session: *//'')\n\n# Send notification to coordinator\ntmux send-keys -t \"$COORDINATOR\" \"Agent $AGENT_NAME completed task\" Enter\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Configuration-Driven Behavior\n\n**.claude/my-plugin.local.md:**\n\n```markdown\n---\nvalidation_level: strict\nmax_file_size: 1000000\nallowed_extensions: [\".js\", \".ts\", \".tsx\"]\nenable_logging: true\n---\n\n# Validation Configuration\n\nStrict mode enabled for this project.\nAll writes validated against security policies.\n```\n\nUse in hooks or commands:\n\n```bash\nLEVEL=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^validation_level:'' | sed ''s/validation_level: *//'')\n\ncase \"$LEVEL\" in\n  strict)\n    # Apply strict validation\n    ;;\n  standard)\n    # Apply standard validation\n    ;;\n  lenient)\n    # Apply lenient validation\n    ;;\nesac\n```\n\n## Creating Settings Files\n\n### From Commands\n\nCommands can create settings files:\n\n```markdown\n# Setup Command\n\nSteps:\n\n1. Ask user for configuration preferences\n2. Create `.claude/my-plugin.local.md` with YAML frontmatter\n3. Set appropriate values based on user input\n4. Inform user that settings are saved\n5. Remind user to restart Claude Code for hooks to recognize changes\n```\n\n### Template Generation\n\nProvide template in plugin README:\n\n```markdown\n## Configuration\n\nCreate `.claude/my-plugin.local.md` in your project:\n\n## \\`\\`\\`markdown\n\nenabled: true\nmode: standard\nmax_retries: 3\n\n---\n\n# Plugin Configuration\n\nYour settings are active.\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nAfter creating or editing, restart Claude Code for changes to take effect.\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### File Naming\n\n✅ **DO:**\n\n- Use `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` format\n- Match plugin name exactly\n- Use `.local.md` suffix for user-local files\n\n❌ **DON''T:**\n\n- Use different directory (not `.claude/`)\n- Use inconsistent naming\n- Use `.md` without `.local` (might be committed)\n\n### Gitignore\n\nAlways add to `.gitignore`:\n\n```gitignore\n.claude/*.local.md\n.claude/*.local.json\n```\n\nDocument this in plugin README.\n\n### Defaults\n\nProvide sensible defaults when settings file doesn''t exist:\n\n```bash\nif [[ ! -f \"$STATE_FILE\" ]]; then\n  # Use defaults\n  ENABLED=true\n  MODE=standard\nelse\n  # Read from file\n  # ...\nfi\n```\n\n### Validation\n\nValidate settings values:\n\n```bash\nMAX=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^max_value:'' | sed ''s/max_value: *//'')\n\n# Validate numeric range\nif ! [[ \"$MAX\" =~ ^[0-9]+$ ]] || [[ $MAX -lt 1 ]] || [[ $MAX -gt 100 ]]; then\n  echo \"⚠️  Invalid max_value in settings (must be 1-100)\" >&2\n  MAX=10  # Use default\nfi\n```\n\n### Restart Requirement\n\n**Important:** Settings changes require Claude Code restart.\n\nDocument in your README:\n\n```markdown\n## Changing Settings\n\nAfter editing `.claude/my-plugin.local.md`:\n\n1. Save the file\n2. Exit Claude Code\n3. Restart: `claude` or `cc`\n4. New settings will be loaded\n```\n\nHooks cannot be hot-swapped within a session.\n\n## Security Considerations\n\n### Sanitize User Input\n\nWhen writing settings files from user input:\n\n```bash\n# Escape quotes in user input\nSAFE_VALUE=$(echo \"$USER_INPUT\" | sed ''s/\"/\\\\\"/g'')\n\n# Write to file\ncat > \"$STATE_FILE\" <<EOF\n---\nuser_setting: \"$SAFE_VALUE\"\n---\nEOF\n```\n\n### Validate File Paths\n\nIf settings contain file paths:\n\n```bash\nFILE_PATH=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^data_file:'' | sed ''s/data_file: *//'')\n\n# Check for path traversal\nif [[ \"$FILE_PATH\" == *\"..\"* ]]; then\n  echo \"⚠️  Invalid path in settings (path traversal)\" >&2\n  exit 2\nfi\n```\n\n### Permissions\n\nSettings files should be:\n\n- Readable by user only (`chmod 600`)\n- Not committed to git\n- Not shared between users\n\n## Real-World Examples\n\n### multi-agent-swarm Plugin\n\n**.claude/multi-agent-swarm.local.md:**\n\n```markdown\n---\nagent_name: auth-implementation\ntask_number: 3.5\npr_number: 1234\ncoordinator_session: team-leader\nenabled: true\ndependencies: [\"Task 3.4\"]\nadditional_instructions: Use JWT tokens, not sessions\n---\n\n# Task: Implement Authentication\n\nBuild JWT-based authentication for the REST API.\nCoordinate with auth-agent on shared types.\n```\n\n**Hook usage (agent-stop-notification.sh):**\n\n- Checks if file exists (line 15-18: quick exit if not)\n- Parses frontmatter to get coordinator_session, agent_name, enabled\n- Sends notifications to coordinator if enabled\n- Allows quick activation/deactivation via `enabled: true/false`\n\n### ralph-wiggum Plugin\n\n**.claude/ralph-loop.local.md:**\n\n```markdown\n---\niteration: 1\nmax_iterations: 10\ncompletion_promise: \"All tests passing and build successful\"\n---\n\nFix all the linting errors in the project.\nMake sure tests pass after each fix.\n```\n\n**Hook usage (stop-hook.sh):**\n\n- Checks if file exists (line 15-18: quick exit if not active)\n- Reads iteration count and max_iterations\n- Extracts completion_promise for loop termination\n- Reads body as the prompt to feed back\n- Updates iteration count on each loop\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### File Location\n\n```\nproject-root/\n└── .claude/\n    └── plugin-name.local.md\n```\n\n### Frontmatter Parsing\n\n```bash\n# Extract frontmatter\nFRONTMATTER=$(sed -n ''/^---$/,/^---$/{ /^---$/d; p; }'' \"$FILE\")\n\n# Read field\nVALUE=$(echo \"$FRONTMATTER\" | grep ''^field:'' | sed ''s/field: *//'' | sed ''s/^\"\\(.*\\)\"$/\\1/'')\n```\n\n### Body Parsing\n\n```bash\n# Extract body (after second ---)\nBODY=$(awk ''/^---$/{i++; next} i>=2'' \"$FILE\")\n```\n\n### Quick Exit Pattern\n\n```bash\nif [[ ! -f \".claude/my-plugin.local.md\" ]]; then\n  exit 0  # Not configured\nfi\n```\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n### Reference Files\n\nFor detailed implementation patterns:\n\n- **`references/parsing-techniques.md`** - Complete guide to parsing YAML frontmatter and markdown bodies\n- **`references/real-world-examples.md`** - Deep dive into multi-agent-swarm and ralph-wiggum implementations\n\n### Example Files\n\nWorking examples in `examples/`:\n\n- **`read-settings-hook.sh`** - Hook that reads and uses settings\n- **`create-settings-command.md`** - Command that creates settings file\n- **`example-settings.md`** - Template settings file\n\n### Utility Scripts\n\nDevelopment tools in `scripts/`:\n\n- **`validate-settings.sh`** - Validate settings file structure\n- **`parse-frontmatter.sh`** - Extract frontmatter fields\n\n## Implementation Workflow\n\nTo add settings to a plugin:\n\n1. Design settings schema (which fields, types, defaults)\n2. Create template file in plugin documentation\n3. Add gitignore entry for `.claude/*.local.md`\n4. Implement settings parsing in hooks/commands\n5. Use quick-exit pattern (check file exists, check enabled field)\n6. Document settings in plugin README with template\n7. Remind users that changes require Claude Code restart\n\nFocus on keeping settings simple and providing good defaults when settings file doesn''t exist.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:30:19.913Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code, needing customizable plugin configurations and state management through YAML frontmatter and markdown content.","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 这样的高级 AI 代理，需要可定制的插件配置和通过 YAML 前置内容和 markdown 内容进行的状态管理。","ja":"Claude Code のような高度な AI エージェントに適しています。カスタマイズ可能なプラグイン構成と YAML フロントマターおよび Markdown コンテンツを介したステート管理が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 사용자 지정 가능한 플러그인 구성과 YAML 프론트매터 및 마크다운 콘텐츠를 통해 상태 관리가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como Claude Code, que necesitan configuraciones de plugins personalizables y gestión de estado a través de YAML frontmatter y contenido de markdown.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA avancés comme Claude Code, nécessitant des configurations de plugins personnalisables et une gestion d''état via YAML frontmatter et contenu de markdown.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die benutzerdefinierte Plugin-Konfigurationen und Zustandsverwaltung durch YAML-Frontmatter und Markdown-Inhalt benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Claude Code, que necessitam de configurações de plugin personalizáveis e gerenciamento de estado por meio de frontmatter YAML e conteúdo em markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих настраиваемых конфигураций плагинов и управления состоянием через YAML-заголовки и содержание markdown.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم مثل Claude Code ، الذي يحتاج إلى تكوينات إضافية مخصصة وإدارة الحالة من خلال YAML و المحتوى markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to store user-configurable settings and state in `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` files, utilizing YAML for structured configuration and markdown for prompts or additional context, thereby enhancing plugin functionality and user experience through protocols like file-based storage and YAML parsing.","zh":"赋予代理存储用户可配置的设置和状态在 `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` 文件中，利用 YAML 进行结构化配置和 markdown 进行提示或额外上下文，从而通过文件存储和 YAML 解析等协议增强插件功能和用户体验。","ja":"エージェントが `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` ファイルにユーザー設定可能な設定と状態を保存できるようにし、YAML を使用して構造化された構成を行い、Markdown を使用してヒントや追加のコンテキストを提供し、ファイルベースのストレージや YAML パーシングなどのプロトコルを通じてプラグインの機能とユーザーエクスペリエンスを強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` 파일에 사용자 설정 가능한 설정과 상태를 저장할 수 있도록 하여 YAML을 사용한 구조화된 구성과 마크다운을 사용한 힌트 또는 추가 컨텍스트를 제공함으로써 파일 기반 저장소 및 YAML 파싱과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 플러그인 기능과 사용자 경험을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a almacenar ajustes y estado configurables por el usuario en archivos `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`, utilizando YAML para configuración estructurada y markdown para solicitudes o contexto adicional, mejorando así la funcionalidad del plugin y la experiencia del usuario a través de protocolos como almacenamiento basado en archivos y análisis de YAML.","fr":"Permet aux agents de stocker des paramètres et un état configurables par l''utilisateur dans des fichiers `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`, en utilisant YAML pour une configuration structurée et markdown pour les invites ou le contexte supplémentaire, améliorant ainsi la fonctionnalité du plugin et l''expérience utilisateur à travers des protocoles tels que le stockage basé sur des fichiers et l''analyse YAML.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, benutzerkonfigurierbare Einstellungen und Zustand in `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`-Dateien zu speichern, wobei YAML für strukturierte Konfiguration und Markdown für Anfragen oder zusätzlichen Kontext verwendet wird, wodurch die Funktionalität des Plugins und die Benutzererfahrung durch Protokolle wie dateibasiertes Speichern und YAML-Parsing verbessert werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes armazenem configurações e estado personalizáveis do usuário em arquivos `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`, utilizando YAML para configuração estruturada e markdown para prompts ou contexto adicional, melhorando assim a funcionalidade do plugin e a experiência do usuário por meio de protocolos como armazenamento baseado em arquivos e análise YAML.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью хранить настраиваемые параметры и состояние пользователя в файлах `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`, используя YAML для структурированной конфигурации и markdown для подсказок или дополнительного контекста, тем самым улучшая функциональность плагина и пользовательский опыт посредством протоколов, таких как хранение на основе файлов и парсинг YAML.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تخزين إعدادات و حالة المستخدم القابل للتعديل في الملفات `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` ، باستخدام YAML لتهيئة الهيكل و markdown للتحفيز أو السياق الإضافي ، وبالتالي تحسين وظيفة الإضافات وتجربة المستخدم من خلال بروتوكولات مثل تخزين الملفات وتحليل YAML."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring plugins for specific projects","Storing user preferences in markdown files","Managing plugin state across different projects"],"zh":["为特定项目配置插件","在 markdown 文件中存储用户首选项","在不同项目中管理插件状态"],"ja":["特定のプロジェクト用のプラグインを構成する","Markdown ファイルにユーザー設定を保存する","異なるプロジェクト間でプラグインの状態を管理する"],"ko":["특정 프로젝트를 위한 플러그인 구성","마크다운 파일에 사용자 설정 저장","다른 프로젝트 간에 플러그인 상태 관리"],"es":["Configuración de plugins para proyectos específicos","Almacenamiento de preferencias de usuario en archivos de markdown","Gestión del estado del plugin en diferentes proyectos"],"fr":["Configuration de plugins pour des projets spécifiques","Stockage des préférences de l''utilisateur dans des fichiers markdown","Gestion de l''état du plugin sur différents projets"],"de":["Konfiguration von Plugins für spezifische Projekte","Speicherung von Benutzervorlieben in Markdown-Dateien","Verwaltung des Plugin-Zustands in verschiedenen Projekten"],"pt":["Configurando plugins para projetos específicos","Armazenando preferências de usuário em arquivos markdown","Gerenciando estado de plugin em diferentes projetos"],"ru":["Настройка плагинов для конкретных проектов","Хранение предпочтений пользователя в файлах markdown","Управление состоянием плагина в разных проектах"],"ar":["تكوين الإضافات لمشاريع محددة","تخزين تفضيلات المستخدم في ملفات markdown","إدارة حالة الإضافة في مشاريع مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires file system access to read and write `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` files","Specific to Claude Code plugins","Dependent on YAML frontmatter for configuration"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限来读写 `.claude/plugin-name.local.md` 文件","仅限 Claude Code 插件","依赖 YAML 前置内容进行配置"],"ja":["`.claude/plugin-name.local.md` ファイルを読み書きするためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","Claude Code プラグインにのみ適用","構成には YAML フロントマターに依存"],"ko":["`.claude/plugin-name.local.md` 파일을 읽고 쓰기 위해 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","Claude Code 플러그인에만 적용","구성에는 YAML 프론트매터에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para leer y escribir archivos `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`","Específico para plugins de Claude Code","Dependiente de YAML frontmatter para la configuración"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour lire et écrire des fichiers `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`","Spécifique aux plugins de Claude Code","Dépendant de YAML frontmatter pour la configuration"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem, um `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`-Dateien zu lesen und zu schreiben","Spezifisch für Claude Code-Plugins","Abhängig von YAML-Frontmatter für die Konfiguration"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao sistema de arquivos para ler e gravar arquivos `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`","Específico para plugins do Claude Code","Dependente de frontmatter YAML para configuração"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе для чтения и записи файлов `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`","Конкретно для плагинов Claude Code","Зависит от YAML-заголовков для конфигурации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لقراءة وكتابة الملفات `.claude/plugin-name.local.md`","محدد لإضافات Claude Code","يعتمد على YAML-الرأس لتكوين"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c6767a395d656799235d64120f57ea1f6b16d8118a1c5d86e4c8d622aa33e497","qualityScore":45}');
