da operações essenciais de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python e ferramentas de linha de comando.","ru":"Это руководство охватывает основные операции обработки PDF с использованием библиотек Python и командной строки.","ar":"يهتم هذا الدليل بالعمليات الأساسية لمعالجة ملفات PDF باستخدام مكتبات Python وأدوات سطر الأوامر","en":"Goodable is a local-first Desktop AI Workspace (Desktop Agent Runtime) powered by Claude Agent SDK, combining OS/file control, browser automation, and coding..."},"definition":{"en":"Goodable is a local-first Desktop AI Workspace (Desktop Agent Runtime) powered by Claude Agent SDK, combining OS/file control, browser automation, and coding into composable Skills (tool + app modes) to build, run, and publish real AI apps."},"features":{"zh":["PDF ","Python ","JavaScript "," "," "],"ja":["PDF ","Python ","JavaScript "," "," "],"ko":["PDF ","Python ","JavaScript "," "," "],"es":["Lectura de PDF con Python","Extracción de texto de PDF","Uso de bibliotecas como pypdf","Automatización de tareas de PDF","Creación de aplicaciones de PDF personalizadas"],"fr":["Lecture de PDF avec Python","Extraction de texte de PDF","Utilisation de bibliothèques comme pypdf","Automatisation de tâches de PDF","Création d''applications de PDF personnalisées"],"de":["Lesen von PDF mit Python","Textextraktion aus PDF","Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie pypdf","Automatisierung von PDF-Aufgaben","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten PDF-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Leitura de arquivos PDF","Extração de texto de PDF","Preenchimento de formulários PDF","Manipulação de páginas PDF","Uso de bibliotecas Python para PDF","Uso de ferramentas de linha de comando para PDF"],"ru":["Чтение файлов PDF","Извлечение текста из PDF","Заполнение форм PDF","Манипуляция страницами PDF","Использование библиотек Python для PDF","Использование командной строки для PDF"],"ar":["قراءة ملفات PDF","استخراج النص من ملفات PDF","ملء الاستمارات في ملفات PDF","التلاعب بصفحات ملفات PDF","استخدام مكتبات Python لمعالجة ملفات PDF","استخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر لمعالجة ملفات PDF"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF ","Python PDF","JavaScript PDF","PDF "," "," "],"ja":["PDF ","Python PDF","JavaScript PDF","PDF "," "," "],"ko":["PDF ","Python PDF","JavaScript PDF","PDF "," "," "],"es":["procesamiento de PDF","Python PDF","bibliotecas de PDF","extracción de texto de PDF","automatización de PDF","aplicaciones de PDF","desarrollo de PDF","PDF con Python"],"fr":["traitement de PDF","Python PDF","bibliothèques de PDF","extraction de texte de PDF","automatisation de PDF","applications de PDF","développement de PDF","PDF avec Python"],"de":["PDF-Verarbeitung","Python PDF","PDF-Bibliotheken","Textextraktion aus PDF","PDF-Automatisierung","PDF-Anwendungen","PDF-Entwicklung","PDF mit Python"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","python pdf","ferramentas de linha de comando pdf","extração de texto pdf","preenchimento de formulários pdf","manipulação de páginas pdf","bibliotecas python pdf","desenvolvimento de pdf"],"ru":["обработка pdf","python pdf","командная строка pdf","извлечение текста pdf","заполнение форм pdf","манипуляция страницами pdf","библиотеки python pdf","разработка pdf"],"ar":["معالجة ملفات pdf","python pdf","أدوات سطر الأوامر pdf","استخراج النص من ملفات pdf","ملء الاستمارات في ملفات pdf","التلاعب بصفحات ملفات pdf","مكتبات python لمعالجة ملفات pdf","تطوير ملفات pdf"]}},"owner":"ImGoodBai","repo":"goodable","repoPath":"ImGoodBai/goodable","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.663Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"Comprehensive PDF manipulation toolkit for extracting text and tables, creating new PDFs, merging/splitting documents, and handling forms. When Claude needs to fill in a PDF form or programmatically process, generate, or analyze PDF documents at scale.","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see forms.md) | See forms.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see reference.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see reference.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in forms.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see reference.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:21:01.456Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities using Python libraries like pypdf.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Python库（如pypdf）进行高级PDF处理的文档分析代理。","ja":"Pythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用した高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용하여 고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas utilizando bibliotecas de Python como pypdf.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents ayant besoin de capacités de traitement de PDF avancées en utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agenten, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen unter Verwendung von Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python como pypdf.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, которым требуются расширенные возможности обработки PDF с использованием библиотек Python, таких как pypdf.","ar":"مثالي للعوامل تحليل الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى قدرات معالجة PDF متقدمة باستخدام مكتبات بايثون مثل pypdf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to read and extract text from PDF documents, utilizing PdfReader and PdfWriter for seamless page manipulation and text analysis, supporting advanced features through JavaScript libraries and command-line tools.","zh":"赋予代理读取和提取PDF文档中的文本能力，利用PdfReader和PdfWriter实现无缝的页面操作和文本分析，并通过JavaScript库和命令行工具支持高级功能。","ja":"PdfReaderとPdfWriterを使用して、エージェントがPDFドキュメントからテキストを読み取り、抽出できるようにし、ページ操作とテキスト分析をシームレスに行い、JavaScriptライブラリとコマンドラインツールを通じて高度な機能をサポートします。","ko":"PdfReader와 PdfWriter를 사용하여 에이전트가 PDF 문서에서 텍스트를 읽고 추출할 수 있도록 하며, 페이지 조작과 텍스트 분석을 무결점으로 수행하며, JavaScript 라이브러리와 명령줄 도구를 통해 고급 기능을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a leer y extraer texto de documentos PDF, utilizando PdfReader y PdfWriter para una manipulación y análisis de texto de página sin problemas, y admite funciones avanzadas a través de bibliotecas de JavaScript y herramientas de línea de comandos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lire et d''extraire le texte des documents PDF, en utilisant PdfReader et PdfWriter pour une manipulation et une analyse de texte de page sans problème, et prend en charge des fonctionnalités avancées via des bibliothèques JavaScript et des outils de ligne de commande.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Text aus PDF-Dokumenten zu lesen und zu extrahieren, indem PdfReader und PdfWriter für eine nahtlose Seitenmanipulation und Textanalyse verwendet werden, und unterstützt erweiterte Funktionen durch JavaScript-Bibliotheken und Befehlszeilentools.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ler e extrair texto de documentos PDF, utilizando PdfReader e PdfWriter para manipulação de página sem interrupções e análise de texto, suportando recursos avançados por meio de bibliotecas JavaScript e ferramentas de linha de comando.","ru":"Позволяет агентам читать и извлекать текст из документов PDF, используя PdfReader и PdfWriter для бесшовной манипуляции страницами и анализа текста, поддерживая расширенные функции через библиотеки JavaScript и командные инструменты.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من قراءة و استخراج النص من مستندات PDF، باستخدام PdfReader و PdfWriter لتعامل الصفحات بسلاسة و تحليل النص، و دعم الميزات المتقدمة من خلال مكتبات JavaScript وأدوات سطر الأوامر."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from PDF pages","Automating PDF form filling using forms.md guidance","Analyzing PDF document structures with Python"],"zh":["从PDF页面提取文本","使用forms.md指南自动填充PDF表单","使用Python分析PDF文档结构"],"ja":["PDFページからテキストを抽出する","forms.mdの指南を使用してPDFフォームを自動的に埋める","Pythonを使用してPDFドキュメントの構造を分析する"],"ko":["PDF 페이지에서 텍스트 추출","forms.md 가이드를 사용하여 PDF 양식을 자동으로 채우기","Python을 사용하여 PDF 문서 구조 분석"],"es":["Extracción de texto de páginas PDF","Automatización del llenado de formularios PDF utilizando la guía forms.md","Análisis de estructuras de documentos PDF con Python"],"fr":["Extraction de texte à partir de pages PDF","Automatisation du remplissage de formulaires PDF à l''aide de la guidance forms.md","Analyse de structures de documents PDF avec Python"],"de":["Extraktion von Text aus PDF-Seiten","Automatisierung des Ausfüllens von PDF-Formularen unter Verwendung der forms.md-Anleitung","Analyse von PDF-Dokumentstrukturen mit Python"],"pt":["Extração de texto de páginas PDF","Automação de preenchimento de formulários PDF usa