notificações de voz","configuração personalizada","guia de instalação","alternativas ao peon ping config"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для игр","peon ping config","warcraft iii","claude code","codex","голосовые уведомления","настройка под себя","руководство по установке","альтернативы peon ping config"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للألعاب","peon ping config","warcraft iii","claude code","codex","تنبيهات صوتية","التخصيص الشخصي","دليل التثبيت","بديل لبرنامج peon ping config"]}},"owner":"PeonPing","repo":"peon-ping","repoPath":"PeonPing/peon-ping","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.668Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"peon-ping-config","description":"Update peon-ping configuration — volume, pack rotation, categories, active pack, and other settings. Use when user wants to change peon-ping settings like volume, enable round-robin, add packs to rotation, toggle sound categories, or adjust any config.","bodyPreview":"# peon-ping-config\n\nUpdate peon-ping configuration settings.\n\n## Config location\n\nThe config file is at `${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json`.\n\n## Available settings\n\n- **volume** (number, 0.0–1.0): Sound volume\n- **active_pack** (string): Current sound pack name (e.g. `\"peon\"`, `\"sc_kerrigan\"`, `\"glados\"`)\n- **enabled** (boolean): Master on/off switch\n- **pack_rotation** (array of strings): List of packs to rotate through per session. Empty `[]` uses `active_pack` on","body":"# peon-ping-config\n\nUpdate peon-ping configuration settings.\n\n## Config location\n\nThe config file is at `${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json`.\n\n## Available settings\n\n- **volume** (number, 0.0–1.0): Sound volume\n- **active_pack** (string): Current sound pack name (e.g. `\"peon\"`, `\"sc_kerrigan\"`, `\"glados\"`)\n- **enabled** (boolean): Master on/off switch\n- **pack_rotation** (array of strings): List of packs to rotate through per session. Empty `[]` uses `active_pack` only.\n- **pack_rotation_mode** (string): `\"random\"` (default) picks a random pack each session. `\"round-robin\"` cycles through in order. `\"agentskill\"` uses explicit per-session assignments from `/peon-ping-use`; invalid or missing packs fall back to `active_pack` and the stale assignment is removed.\n- **categories** (object): Toggle individual CESP sound categories:\n  - `session.start`, `task.acknowledge`, `task.complete`, `task.error`, `input.required`, `resource.limit`, `user.spam` — each a boolean\n- **annoyed_threshold** (number): How many rapid prompts trigger user.spam sounds\n- **annoyed_window_seconds** (number): Time window for the annoyed threshold\n- **silent_window_seconds** (number): Suppress task.complete sounds for tasks shorter than this many seconds\n- **session_ttl_days** (number, default: 7): Expire stale per-session pack assignments older than N days (when using agentskill mode)\n- **desktop_notifications** (boolean): Toggle notification popups independently from sounds (default: `true`)\n- **use_sound_effects_device** (boolean): Route audio through macOS Sound Effects device (`true`) or default output via afplay (`false`). Only affects macOS. Default: `true`\n\n## How to update\n\n1. Read the config file using the Read tool\n2. Edit the relevant field(s) using the Edit tool\n3. Confirm the change to the user\n\n## Common Configuration Examples\n\n### Disable desktop notification popups but keep sounds\n\n**User request:** \"Disable desktop notifications\"\n\n**Action:**\nSet `desktop_notifications: false` in config\n\n**Result:**\n- ✅ Sounds continue playing (voice reminders)\n- ❌ Desktop notification popups suppressed\n- ✅ Mobile notifications unaffected (separate toggle)\n\n**Alternative CLI command:**\n```bash\npeon notifications off\n# or\npeon popups off\n```\n\n### Adjust volume\n\n**User request:** \"Set volume to 30%\"\n\n**Action:**\nSet `volume: 0.3` in config\n\n### Enable round-robin pack rotation\n\n**User request:** \"Enable round-robin pack rotation with peon and glados\"\n\n**Action:**\nSet:\n```json\n{\n  \"pack_rotation\": [\"peon\", \"glados\"],\n  \"pack_rotation_mode\": \"round-robin\"\n}\n```\n\n## Directory pack bindings\n\nPermanently associate a sound pack with a working directory so every session in that directory uses the right pack automatically. Uses the `path_rules` config key (array of `{ \"pattern\": \"<glob>\", \"pack\": \"<name>\" }` objects).\n\n### CLI commands\n\n```bash\n# Bind a pack to the current directory\npeon packs bind <pack>\n# e.g. peon packs bind glados\n# → bound glados to /Users/dan/Frontend\n\n# Bind with a custom glob pattern (matches any dir with that name)\npeon packs bind <pack> --pattern \"*/Frontend/*\"\n\n# Auto-download a missing pack and bind it\npeon packs bind <pack> --install\n\n# Remove binding for the current directory\npeon packs unbind\n\n# Remove a specific pattern binding\npeon packs unbind --pattern \"*/Frontend/*\"\n\n# List all bindings (* marks rules matching current directory)\npeon packs bindings\n```\n\n### Manual config\n\nThe `path_rules` array in `config.json` can also be edited directly:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"path_rules\": [\n    { \"pattern\": \"/Users/dan/Frontend/*\", \"pack\": \"glados\" },\n    { \"pattern\": \"*/backend/*\", \"pack\": \"sc_kerrigan\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nPatterns use Python `fnmatch` glob syntax. First matching rule wins. Path rules override `default_pack` and `pack_rotation` but are overridden by `session_override` (agentskill) assignments.\n\n## List available packs\n\nTo show available packs, run:\n\n```bash\nbash \"${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}\"/hooks/peon-ping/peon.sh packs list\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:22:10.819Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Voice-Enabled Agents like Claude Code and Codex needing customizable sound notifications and alerts","zh":"非常适合需要可自定义声音通知和警报的语音驱动代理，如 Claude Code 和 Codex","ja":"Claude Code や Codex など、カスタマイズ可能なサウンド通知とアラートを必要とする音声対応エージェントに最適です","ko":"Claude Code 및 Codex와 같이 사용자 정의 가능한 사운드 알림 및 경고가 필요한 음성 사용 에이전트에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes con capacidad de voz como Claude Code y Codex que necesitan notificaciones y alertas de sonido personalizables","fr":"Idéal pour les agents à activation vocale comme Claude Code et Codex nécessitant des notifications et des alertes sonores personnalisables","de":"Ideal für sprachgesteuerte Agenten wie Claude Code und Codex, die benutzerdefinierte Soundbenachrichtigungen und -alarme benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes com Recursos de Voz, como Claude Code e Codex, que necessitam de notificações e alertas sonoros personalizáveis","ru":"Идеально подходит для голосовых агентов, таких как Claude Code и Codex, требующих настраиваемых звуковых уведомлений и оповещений","ar":"مثالي لعميل تمكين الصوت مثل Claude Code و Codex الذي يحتاج إلى إشعارات وتنبيهات صوتية قابلة للتخصيص"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage sound volume, rotate through custom sound packs like ''peon'' or ''sc_kerrigan'', and toggle notifications on or off using a config.json file, streamlining terminal interactions with features like pack rotation and master on/off switch","zh":"使代理能够通过 config.json 文件管理音量、在 ''peon'' 或 ''sc_kerrigan'' 等自定义声音包之间轮换以及切换通知开关，通过包轮换和主开关等特性简化终端交互","ja":"config.json ファイルを使用して、音量の管理、''peon'' や ''sc_kerrigan'' などのカスタムサウンドパックのローテーション、通知のオン/オフ切り替えをエージェントが行えるようにし、パックローテーションやマスターオン/オフスイッチなどの機能でターミナル操作を効率化します","ko":"config.json 파일을 사용하여 사운드 볼륨 관리, ''peon'' 또는 ''sc_kerrigan''과 같은 사용자 정의 사운드 팩 순환, 알림 켜기/끄기 전환을 통해 에이전트를 강화하며, 팩 순환 및 마스터 온/오프 스위치와 같은 기능으로 터미널 상호 작용을 간소화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el volumen de sonido, rotar a través de paquetes de sonido personalizados como ''peon'' o ''sc_kerrigan'' y activar o desactivar notificaciones usando un archivo config.json, simplificando las interacciones de terminal con características como rotación de paquetes y conmutador master de encendido y apagado","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer le volume sonore, de faire pivoter des packs de sons personnalisés comme ''peon'' ou ''sc_kerrigan'' et de basculer les notifications sur ou hors à l''aide d''un fichier config.json, rationalisant les interactions de terminal avec des fonctionnalités comme la rotation de packs et l''interrupteur master marche/arrêt","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Lautstärke zu steuern, durch benutzerdefinierte Sound-Pakete wie ''peon'' oder ''sc_kerrigan'' zu rotieren und Benachrichtigungen mithilfe einer config.json-Datei ein- oder auszuschalten, wodurch die Terminal-Interaktionen mit Funktionen wie Paketrotation und Master-Ein-/Ausschalter rationalisiert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o volume do som, alternar entre pacotes de som personalizados como ''peon'' ou ''sc_kerrigan'' e alternar notificações ligadas ou desligadas usando um arquivo config.json, otimizando as interações de terminal com recursos como rotação de pacotes e interruptor principal ligar/desligar","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять громкостью звука, переключаться между настраиваемыми звуковыми пакетами, такими как ''peon'' или ''sc_kerrigan'', и включать/выключать уведомления с помощью файла config.json, оптимизируя взаимодействия с терминалом с функциями, такими как ротация пакетов и основной выключатель","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إدارة مستوى الصوت وتبديل بين حزم صوتية مخصصة مثل ''peon'' أو ''sc_kerrigan'' وتoggle الإشعارات على أو إيقافها باستخدام ملف config.json ، مما ي简ifies التفاعلات المحطة مع الميزات مثل دوران الحزمة ومفتاح الرئيسي تشغيل/إيقاف"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Warcraft III Peon voice notifications","Rotating through custom sound packs per session","Toggling sound notifications on or off using the enabled setting"],"zh":["配置 Warcraft III Peon 语音通知","每个会话在自定义声音包之间轮换","使用 enabled 设置切换声音通知的开关"],"ja":["Warcraft III Peon の音声通知の設定","セッションごとにカスタムサウンドパックをローテーション","enabled 設定を使用してサウンド通知のオン/オフを切り替え"],"ko":["Warcraft III Peon 음성 알림 구성","세션별 사용자 정의 사운드 팩 순환","enabled 설정을 사용하여 사운드 알림 켜기/끄기 전환"],"es":["Configuración de notificaciones de voz de Peon de Warcraft III","Rotación a través de paquetes de sonido personalizados por sesión","Activación o desactivación de notificaciones de sonido usando la configuración habilitada"],"fr":["Configuration des notifications vocales de Peon de Warcraft III","Rotation à travers des packs de sons personnalisés par session","Activation ou désactivation des notifications sonores à l''aide de la configuration activée"],"de":["Konfiguration von Warcraft-III-Peon-Sprachbenachrichtigungen","Durchlaufen benutzerdefinierter Sound-Pakete pro Sitzung","Ein- oder Ausschalten von Soundbenachrichtigungen unter Verwendung der aktivierten Einstellung"],"pt":["Configurando notificações de voz do Peon do Warcraft III","Rotacionando por pacotes de som personalizados por sessão","Alternando notificações sonoras ligadas ou desligadas usando a configuração habilitada"],"ru":["Настройка уведомлений голоса Peon из Warcraft III","Переключение между настраиваемыми звуковыми пакетами за сессию","Включение/выключение звуковых уведомлений с помощью включенной настройки"],"ar":["تكوين إشعارات صوت Peon من ووركرافت III","التبديل بين حزم صوتية مخصصة لكل جلسة","تبديل الإشعارات الصوتية على أو إيقافها باستخدام إعداد تمكين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json file","Compatible with Claude Code and Codex only"],"zh":["需要访问 ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json 文件","仅与 Claude Code 和 Codex 兼容"],"ja":["${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json ファイルへのアクセスが必要","Claude Code と Codex のみと互換性あり"],"ko":["${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json 파일에 대한 액세스 필요","Claude Code 및 Codex 전용 호환"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Compatible solo con Claude Code y Codex"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au fichier ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Compatible uniquement avec Claude Code et Codex"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Datei ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Kompatibel nur mit Claude Code und Codex"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Compatível apenas com Claude Code e Codex"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Совместимо только с Claude Code и Codex"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الملف ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","متوافق فقط مع Claude Code و Codex"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4b2ff0c13199d1cfd65c2a7930d31368464b6fe0194db14b3e064f18bf5f58a5","qualityScore":45}');
