pwork_jobs","deepwork_jobs vs Wettbewerber","Installation von deepwork_jobs","Konfigurationsanleitung für deepwork_jobs"],"pt":["como usar deepwork_jobs","o que é deepwork_jobs","ferramentas de ia para análise de portfólio","deepwork_jobs vs outras ferramentas","instalar deepwork_jobs","guia de configuração do deepwork_jobs","análise de portfólio com python","análise de portfólio com react"],"ru":["как использовать deepwork_jobs","что такое deepwork_jobs","инструменты ИИ для анализа портфеля","deepwork_jobs vs другие инструменты","установить deepwork_jobs","руководство по настройке deepwork_jobs","анализ портфеля с помощью python","анализ портфеля с помощью react"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام deepwork_jobs","ما هي أداة deepwork_jobs","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحليل المحفظة","deepwork_jobs مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت deepwork_jobs","دليل إعداد deepwork_jobs","تحليل المحفظة باستخدام python","تحليل المحفظة باستخدام react"]}},"owner":"ncrmro","repo":"deepwork-permanent-portfolio","repoPath":"ncrmro/deepwork-permanent-portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.691Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deepwork_jobs","description":"Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.","bodyPreview":"# deepwork_jobs\n\n**Multi-step workflow**: Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.\n\n> **CRITICAL**: Always invoke steps using the Skill tool. Never copy/paste step instructions directly.\n\nCore commands for managing DeepWork jobs. These commands help you define new multi-step\nworkflows and learn from running them.\n\nThe `define` command guides you through an interactive process to create a new job by\nasking structured questions about","body":"# deepwork_jobs\n\n**Multi-step workflow**: Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.\n\n> **CRITICAL**: Always invoke steps using the Skill tool. Never copy/paste step instructions directly.\n\nCore commands for managing DeepWork jobs. These commands help you define new multi-step\nworkflows and learn from running them.\n\nThe `define` command guides you through an interactive process to create a new job by\nasking structured questions about your workflow, understanding each step''s inputs and outputs,\nand generating all necessary files.\n\nThe `learn` command reflects on conversations where DeepWork jobs were run, identifies\nconfusion or inefficiencies, and improves job instructions. It also captures bespoke\nlearnings specific to the current run into AGENTS.md files in the working folder.\n\n\n## Available Steps\n\n1. **define** - Creates a job.yml specification by gathering workflow requirements through structured questions. Use when starting a new multi-step workflow.\n2. **review_job_spec** - Reviews job.yml against quality criteria using a sub-agent for unbiased validation. Use after defining a job specification. (requires: define)\n3. **implement** - Generates step instruction files and syncs slash commands from the job.yml specification. Use after job spec review passes. (requires: review_job_spec)\n4. **learn** - Analyzes conversation history to improve job instructions and capture learnings. Use after running a job to refine it.\n\n## Execution Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Intent\n\nParse any text following `/deepwork_jobs` to determine user intent:\n- \"define\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.define`\n- \"review_job_spec\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.review_job_spec`\n- \"implement\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.implement`\n- \"learn\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.learn`\n\n### Step 2: Invoke Starting Step\n\nUse the Skill tool to invoke the identified starting step:\n```\nSkill tool: deepwork_jobs.define\n```\n\n### Step 3: Continue Workflow Automatically\n\nAfter each step completes:\n1. Check if there''s a next step in the sequence\n2. Invoke the next step using the Skill tool\n3. Repeat until workflow is complete or user intervenes\n\n### Handling Ambiguous Intent\n\nIf user intent is unclear, use AskUserQuestion to clarify:\n- Present available steps as numbered options\n- Let user select the starting point\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Do NOT copy/paste step instructions directly; always use the Skill tool to invoke steps\n- Do NOT skip steps in the workflow unless the user explicitly requests it\n- Do NOT proceed to the next step if the current step''s outputs are incomplete\n- Do NOT make assumptions about user intent; ask for clarification when ambiguous\n\n## Context Files\n\n- Job definition: `.deepwork/jobs/deepwork_jobs/job.yml`"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:33:42.408Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automated Investment Agents requiring strategic portfolio management through Harry Browne''s Permanent Portfolio strategy","zh":"适用于需要通过Harry Browne的永久投资组合策略进行战略投资组合管理的自动化投资代理","ja":"ハリー・ブラウンの永久ポートフォリオ戦略を通じて戦略的なポートフォリオ管理を必要とする自動化投資エージェントに適する","ko":"해리 브라운의 영원한 投資組合 전략을 통해 전략적인 投資組合 관리를 필요로 하는 자동화 투자 에이전트에 적합함","es":"Ideal para Automated Investment Agents que requieren gestión estratégica de carteras mediante la estrategia de Cartera Permanente de Harry Browne","fr":"Idéal pour les Automated Investment Agents nécessitant une gestion stratégique de portefeuille via la stratégie de Portefeuille Permanent de Harry Browne","de":"Ideal für Automated Investment Agents, die ein strategisches Portfoliomanagement durch die Permanent Portfolio-Strategie von Harry Browne benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Investimento Automatizados que exigem gestão estratégica de carteira por meio da estratégia de Carteira Permanente de Harry Browne","ru":"Идеально подходит для автоматических инвестиционных агентов, требующих стратегического управления портфелем через постоянную стратегию портфеля Гарри Брауна","ar":"مثالي لعميل الاستثمار الآلي الذي يتطلب إدارة محفظة استراتيجية من خلال استراتيجية المحفظة الدائمة لهاري بروون"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage multi-step workflows for automated daily portfolio analysis, utilizing structured questions to define new jobs and implement improvements, all while leveraging core commands for DeepWork job management and interactive process creation","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理多步骤工作流程的能力，用于自动化每日投资组合分析，利用结构化问题定义新任务并实施改进，同时利用DeepWork任务管理的核心命令和交互式流程创建","ja":"毎日のポートフォリオ分析の自動化、構造化された質問を使用した新しいジョブの定義、既存のDeepWorkジョブの改善などのマルチステップのワークフローを作成して管理する機能をエージェントに与える。DeepWorkジョブ管理およびインタラクティブなプロセス作成のコアコマンドを活用する","ko":"매일 投資組合 분석의 자동화, 구조화된 질문을 사용한 새로운 작업의 정의, 기존의 DeepWork 작업의 개선 등을 위한 멀티스텝 워크플로우를 생성하고 관리할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 부여함. DeepWork 작업 관리 및 상호작용 프로세스 생성의 핵심 명령을 활용함","es":"Empodera a los agentes para crear y gestionar flujos de trabajo de múltiples pasos para el análisis automatizado diario de carteras, utilizando preguntas estructuradas para definir nuevos jobs e implementar mejoras, todo mientras aprovecha los comandos core para la gestión de jobs de DeepWork y la creación interactiva de procesos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des workflows multi-étapes pour l''analyse automatisée quotidienne de portefeuille, en utilisant des questions structurées pour définir de nouveaux jobs et mettre en œuvre des améliorations, le tout en tirant parti des commandes core pour la gestion des jobs DeepWork et la création interactive de processus","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, mehrstufige Workflows für die automatisierte tägliche Portfolioanalyse zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem strukturierte Fragen zur Definition neuer Jobs und zur Implementierung von Verbesserungen genutzt werden, alles unter Verwendung der core-Befehle für das DeepWork Job-Management und die interaktive Prozesserstellung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar fluxos de trabalho multietapas para análise automática diária de carteira, utilizando perguntas estruturadas para definir novos trabalhos e implementar melhorias, tudo isso aproveitando comandos básicos para gerenciamento de trabalhos DeepWork e criação de processos interativos","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять многоступенчатыми рабочими процессами для автоматического ежедневного анализа портфеля, используя структурированные вопросы для определения новых заданий и реализации улучшений, все это при использовании основных команд для управления заданиями DeepWork и создания интерактивных процессов","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء وإدارة عمليات متعددة الخطوات لتحليل المحفظة اليومي الآلي، باستخدام أسئلة منظمة لتحديد مهام جديدة وتنفيذ تحسينات، مع الاستفادة من أوامر أساسية لإدارة مهام DeepWork وإنشاء عمليات تفاعلية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating daily portfolio analysis","Defining new multi-step workflows","Improving existing DeepWork jobs through interactive process creation"],"zh":["自动化每日投资组合分析","定义新的多步骤工作流程","通过交互式流程创建改进现有的DeepWork任务"],"ja":["毎日のポートフォリオ分析の自動化","新しいマルチステップのワークフローを定義する","既存のDeepWorkジョブをインタラクティブなプロセス作成を通じて改善する"],"ko":["매일 投資組合 분석의 자동화","新的 멀티스텝 워크플로우를 정의하는","기존의 DeepWork 작업을 상호작용 프로세스 생성을 통해 개선하는"],"es":["Automatización del análisis diario de carteras","Definición de nuevos flujos de trabajo de múltiples pasos","Mejora de los jobs de DeepWork existentes mediante la creación interactiva de procesos"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''analyse quotidienne de portefeuille","Définition de nouveaux workflows multi-étapes","Amélioration des jobs DeepWork existants grâce à la création interactive de processus"],"de":["Automatisierung der täglichen Portfolioanalyse","Definition neuer mehrstufiger Workflows","Verbesserung bestehender DeepWork Jobs durch interaktive Prozesserstellung"],"pt":["Automatizar análise diária de carteira","Definir novos fluxos de trabalho multietapas","Melhorar trabalhos existentes do DeepWork por meio da criação de processos interativos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ежедневный анализ портфеля","Определить новые многоступенчатые рабочие процессы","Улучшить существующие задания DeepWork посредством создания интерактивных процессов"],"ar":["تحليل المحفظة اليومي الآلي","تحديد عمليات متعددة الخطوات جديدة","تحسين مهام DeepWork الحالية من خلال إنشاء عمليات تفاعلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires invocation of steps using the Skill tool","No direct copy/paste of step instructions allowed"],"zh":["需要使用Skill工具调用步骤","不允许直接复制/粘贴步骤指令"],"ja":["Skillツールを使用してステップを呼び出す必要がある","ステップの指示を直接コピー/ペーストすることは許可されない"],"ko":["스킬 툴을 사용하여 단계를 호출해야 함","단계 지침을 직접 복사/貼付할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere la invocación de pasos utilizando la herramienta Skill","No se permite la copia/pegado directo de las instrucciones de los pasos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''invocation des étapes à l''aide de l''outil Skill","Copier/coller directement les instructions des étapes n''est pas autorisé"],"de":["Erfordert den Aufruf von Schritten mit dem Skill-Tool","Direktes Kopieren/Einfügen von Schrittanweisungen ist nicht zulässig"],"pt":["Exige a invocação de etapas utilizando a ferramenta Skill","Não é permitida a cópia/colagem direta de instruções de etapas"],"ru":["Требует вызова шагов с помощью инструмента Skill","Недопустима прямая копия/вставка инструкций шагов"],"ar":["يتطلب استدعاء الخطوات باستخدام أداة Skill","لا يسمح بنسخ/لصق مباشر لتعليمات الخطوات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"aecfdc18f3e7bc78dc1cb4b33115b970a1be6b403e7d2c507bd710abec3c1c9f","qualityScore":45}');
