m","Outil d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","Intégration avec npm","Facilité d''utilisation pour les développeurs"],"de":["Speicherung von Abhängigkeiten von @ruan-cat","Verwaltung von npm-Paketen","KI-Agent-Tool","Integration mit npm","Einfache Bedienung für Entwickler"],"pt":["Coleção de pacotes npm","Dependências para projetos de Node.js","Repositório de código aberto","Facilidade de instalação e configuração","Compatibilidade com projetos de React e Python"],"ru":["Набор пакетов npm","Зависимости для проектов Node.js","Репозиторий открытоого кода","Легкость установки и настройки","Совместимость с проектами React и Python"],"ar":["مجموعة من الحزم npm","الإعتماديات لمشاريع Node.js","مستودع للرمز المفتوح","سهولة التثبيت والتهيئة","التوافق مع مشاريع React و Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-continue-change","npm @ruan-cat/*","阮喵喵自用包","Node.js","如何使用openspec-continue-change","openspec-continue-change安装","openspec-continue-change设置指南"],"ja":["openspec-continue-change","npm @ruan-cat/*","阮喵喵の自作パッケージ","Node.js","openspec-continue-changeの使い方","openspec-continue-changeインストール","openspec-continue-change設定ガイド"],"ko":["openspec-continue-change","npm @ruan-cat/*","阮喵喵의 自作 패키지","Node.js","openspec-continue-change 사용 방법","openspec-continue-change 설치","openspec-continue-change 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de agente de inteligencia artificial","openspec-continue-change","npm","dependencias de @ruan-cat","cómo usar openspec-continue-change","alternativas a openspec-continue-change","instalación de openspec-continue-change","guía de configuración de openspec-continue-change"],"fr":["outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","openspec-continue-change","npm","dépendances de @ruan-cat","comment utiliser openspec-continue-change","alternatives à openspec-continue-change","installation d''openspec-continue-change","guide de configuration d''openspec-continue-change"],"de":["KI-Agent-Tools","openspec-continue-change","npm","Abhängigkeiten von @ruan-cat","wie man openspec-continue-change verwendet","alternativen zu openspec-continue-change","installation von openspec-continue-change","konfigurationsanleitung für openspec-continue-change"],"pt":["como usar openspec-continue-change","o que é openspec-continue-change","alternativas para openspec-continue-change","instalar openspec-continue-change","guia de configuração do openspec-continue-change","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com openspec-continue-change"],"ru":["как использовать openspec-continue-change","что такое openspec-continue-change","альтернативы для openspec-continue-change","установить openspec-continue-change","руководство по настройке openspec-continue-change","разработка приложений с openspec-continue-change"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام openspec-continue-change","ما هو openspec-continue-change","بديل لopenspec-continue-change","تثبيت openspec-continue-change","دليل إعداد openspec-continue-change","تنمية التطبيقات مع openspec-continue-change"]}},"owner":"ruan-cat","repo":"monorepo","repoPath":"ruan-cat/monorepo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.695Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ***\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ***\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ***\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:18.093Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless integration with npm packages and version control systems like Git.","zh":"非常适合需要与 npm 包和 Git 等版本控制系统无缝集成的开发 Agent。","ja":"npmパッケージやGitなどのバージョン管理システムとのシームレスな統合を必要とする開発Agentに最適です。","ko":"npm 패키지 및 Git과 같은 버전 관리 시스템과의 원활한 통합이 필요한 개발 Agent에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una integración perfecta con paquetes npm y sistemas de control de versiones como Git.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une intégration transparente avec des packages npm et des systèmes de contrôle de version comme Git.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine nahtlose Integration mit npm-Paketen und Versionskontrollsystemen wie Git erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem integração perfeita com pacotes npm e sistemas de controle de versão como o Git.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих бесшовной интеграции с пакетами npm и системами контроля версий, такими как Git.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب التكامل السلس مع حزم npm ونظم التحكم في الإصدار مثل Git."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to continue working on changes by creating the next artifact, utilizing `openspec list --json` for retrieving available changes and the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, all while maintaining compatibility with npm @ruan-cat/* dependencies.","zh":"使 Agent 能够通过创建下一个工件来继续处理更改，利用 `openspec list --json` 检索可用更改，并使用 AskUserQuestion 工具进行用户选择，同时保持与 npm @ruan-cat/* 依赖项的兼容性。","ja":"Agentが次のアーティファクトを作成して変更作業を継続できるようにし、利用可能な変更の取得には `openspec list --json` を、ユーザー選択には AskUserQuestion ツールを利用します。これらすべては、npm @ruan-cat/* 依存関係との互換性を維持しながら行われます。","ko":"Agent가 다음 아티팩트를 생성하여 변경 사항 작업을 계속할 수 있도록 지원하며, 사용 가능한 변경 사항을 검색하기 위해 `openspec list --json`을, 사용자 선택을 위해 AskUserQuestion 도구를 활용합니다. 이 모든 것은 npm @ruan-cat/* 종속성과의 호환성을 유지하면서 수행됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a continuar trabajando en cambios creando el próximo artifacto, utilizando `openspec list --json` para recuperar cambios disponibles y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección de usuario, manteniendo al mismo tiempo la compatibilidad con dependencias npm @ruan-cat/*.","fr":"Permet aux agents de continuer à travailler sur les modifications en créant le prochain artifact, en utilisant `openspec list --json` pour récupérer les modifications disponibles et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de l''utilisateur, tout en maintenant la compatibilité avec les dépendances npm @ruan-cat/*.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, weiter an Änderungen zu arbeiten, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen, `openspec list --json` zur Abrufung verfügbarer Änderungen und das Tool AskUserQuestion für die Benutzerauswahl verwenden, während sie gleichzeitig die Kompatibilität mit Abhängigkeiten von npm @ruan-cat/* beibehalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a continuar trabalhando nas alterações criando o próximo artefato, utilizando `openspec list --json` para recuperar alterações disponíveis e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção do usuário, mantendo a compatibilidade com dependências npm @ruan-cat/*.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью продолжать работу над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт, используя `openspec list --json` для получения доступных изменений и инструмент AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, сохраняя при этом совместимость с зависимостями npm @ruan-cat/*.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من الاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات من خلال إنشاء الملف التالي، باستخدام `openspec list --json` لاسترجاع التغييرات المتاحة وأداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار المستخدم، مع الحفاظ على التوافق مع الإعتماديات npm @ruan-cat/*."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing development on existing changes","Automating artifact creation for version control","Streamlining workflow by inferring change names from conversation context"],"zh":["在现有更改上继续开发","为版本控制自动化创建工件","通过从对话上下文中推断更改名称来简化工作流程"],"ja":["既存の変更に対する開発の継続","バージョン管理のためのアーティファクト作成の自動化","会話コンテキストから変更名を推論することでワークフローを効率化"],"ko":["기존 변경 사항에 대한 개발 계속","버전 관리를 위한 아티팩트 생성 자동화","대화 컨텍스트에서 변경 이름을 추론하여 워크플로우 간소화"],"es":["Continuar el desarrollo en cambios existentes","Automatizar la creación de artifactos para el control de versiones","Optimizar el flujo de trabajo inferiendo nombres de cambios desde el contexto de la conversación"],"fr":["Continuer le développement sur des modifications existantes","Automatiser la création d''artefacts pour le contrôle de version","Optimiser le flux de travail en déduisant les noms de modifications du contexte de la conversation"],"de":["Weiterentwicklung an bestehenden Änderungen","Automatisierung der Artefakterstellung für die Versionskontrolle","Optimierung des Arbeitsablaufs durch Ableitung von Änderungsnamen aus dem Konversationskontext"],"pt":["Continuar desenvolvimento em alterações existentes","Automatizar a criação de artefatos para controle de versão","Otimizar o fluxo de trabalho inferindo nomes de alterações do contexto da conversa"],"ru":["Продолжить разработку на существующих изменениях","Автоматизировать создание артефактов для контроля версий","Оптимизировать рабочий процесс, выведя имена изменений из контекста разговора"],"ar":["المواصلة في تطوير التغييرات الحالية","تحسين إنشاء الملفات التابعة لمراقبة الإصدار","تبسيط سير العمل من خلال استنتاج أسماء التغييرات من سياق المحادثة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm @ruan-cat/* dependencies","Needs access to conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 changes for user selection"],"zh":["需要 npm @ruan-cat/* 依赖项","需要访问对话上下文以进行更改名称推断","用户选择仅限于前 3 个更改"],"ja":["npm @ruan-cat/* 依存関係が必要","変更名の推論のために会話コンテキストへのアクセスが必要","ユーザー選択は上位3つの変更に限定"],"ko":["npm @ruan-cat/* 종속성이 필요함","변경 이름 추론을 위해 대화 컨텍스트에 대한 액세스 필요","사용자 선택은 상위 3개 변경 사항으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere dependencias npm @ruan-cat/*","Necesita acceso al contexto de la conversación para la inferencia del nombre del cambio","Limitado a los 3 mejores cambios para la selección del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite des dépendances npm @ruan-cat/*","A besoin d''un accès au contexte de la conversation pour l''inférence du nom de la modification","Limité aux 3 meilleures modifications pour la sélection de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Abhängigkeiten von npm @ruan-cat/*","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens","Begrenzt auf die 3 besten Änderungen für die Benutzerauswahl"],"pt":["Exige dependências npm @ruan-cat/*","Necessita acesso ao contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Limitado às 3 principais alterações para seleção do usuário"],"ru":["Требует зависимостей npm @ruan-cat/*","Требует доступа к контексту разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен до 3-х верхних изменений для выбора пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب الإعتماديات npm @ruan-cat/*","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","محدود بالتغييرات الثلاث الأولى للمستخدم للاختيار"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d0fbc067936de6bea93e611b962d6fa0fd58bcd47b1fe8ee529fa0c97c1afd9d","qualityScore":45}');
