.js","Настраиваемый интерфейс командной строки (CLI)","Поддержка React и других библиотек front-end"],"ar":["أتمتة المهام","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم لغات البرمجة مثل Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) قابلة للتعديل","دعم React وأدوات واجهة المستخدم الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理架构","Architect-Agent","AI代理系统","如何使用AI代理","AI代理工具比较","AI代理安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントのアーキテクチャー","Architect-Agent","AIエージェントシステム","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントツールの比較","AIエージェントのインストールガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 아키텍처","Architect-Agent","AI 에이전트 시스템","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 툴 비교","AI 에이전트 설치 가이드"],"es":["agentes de IA","herramientas de desarrollo","automatización de tareas","mejora de la eficiencia","integración con React","alternativas a Architect Agent","guía de instalación de Architect Agent"],"fr":["agents IA","outils de développement","automatisation de tâches","amélioration de l''efficacité","intégration avec React","alternatives à Architect Agent","guide d''installation d''Architect Agent"],"de":["KI-Agenten","Entwicklungstools","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Verbesserung der Effizienz","Integration mit React","Alternativen zu Architect Agent","Installationsanleitung für Architect Agent"],"pt":["como usar agente de inteligência artificial","o que é agente de inteligência artificial","ferramentas de agente de inteligência artificial","alternativas ao Agent Rulz","Agent Rulz vs outros agentes","instalar Agent Rulz","guia de configuração do Agent Rulz"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агента","что такое ИИ Агент","инструменты ИИ Агента","альтернативы Agent Rulz","Agent Rulz vs другие агенты","установить Agent Rulz","руководство по настройке Agent Rulz"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات Agent Rulz","Agent Rulz مقابل وكلاء آخرين","تثبيت Agent Rulz","دليل إعداد Agent Rulz"]}},"owner":"SpillwaveSolutions","repo":"agent_rulez","repoPath":"SpillwaveSolutions/agent_rulez","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.696Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architect-agent","description":"Coordinates planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces. Use when asked to write instructions for code agent, initialize architect workspace, grade code agent work, send instructions, or verify code agent setup.","version":"3.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Architect Agent Workflow Skill\n\nCoordinate planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces.\n\n**Quick Start:** Say \"write instructions for code agent\", \"initialize workspace\", \"grade work\", or \"send instructions\". For automated setup, see [Quick Setup](#quick-setup-template-based).\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Intent Classification](#intent-classification)\n- [Decision Tree](#decision-tree)\n- [Resource Loading Policy](#resource-loading-policy)\n- [Critical Protocol: F","body":"# Architect Agent Workflow Skill\n\nCoordinate planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces.\n\n**Quick Start:** Say \"write instructions for code agent\", \"initialize workspace\", \"grade work\", or \"send instructions\". For automated setup, see [Quick Setup](#quick-setup-template-based).\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Intent Classification](#intent-classification)\n- [Decision Tree](#decision-tree)\n- [Resource Loading Policy](#resource-loading-policy)\n- [Critical Protocol: File Locations](#critical-protocol-file-locations)\n- [Quick Setup](#quick-setup-template-based)\n- [DO NOT Trigger For](#do-not-trigger-for)\n- [Reference Directory](#reference-directory)\n- [Guides Directory](#guides-directory)\n\n## Intent Classification\n\nRoute requests based on user intent:\n\n| Intent | Trigger Phrases | Action |\n|--------|-----------------|--------|\n| **Create Instructions** | \"write instructions\", \"create instructions\", \"delegate to code agent\" | → Load `guides/workflows/create-instructions.md` |\n| **Initialize Workspace** | \"set up architect agent\", \"initialize workspace\", \"new architect agent\" | → Load `guides/workflows/initialize-workspace.md` |\n| **Grade Work** | \"grade the work\", \"evaluate completed work\", \"review implementation\" | → Load `guides/workflows/grade-work.md` |\n| **Send Instructions** | \"send instructions\", \"send to code agent\" | → Load `guides/workflows/send-instructions.md` |\n| **Add OpenCode Support** | \"migrate to OpenCode\", \"add OpenCode support\" | → Load `references/opencode_integration_quickstart.md` |\n| **Verify Setup** | \"verify setup\", \"test hooks\", \"check logging\" | → Load `references/workspace_verification_protocol.md` |\n| **Setup Permissions** | \"set up permissions\", \"fix permission prompts\" | → Load `references/permissions_setup_protocol.md` |\n| **Upgrade Workspace** | \"upgrade workspace\", \"migrate to v3.0\" | → Load `references/upgrade.md` |\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n| User Intent | Pre-condition | Action |\n|-------------|---------------|--------|\n| \"write/create instructions\", \"delegate\" | `instructions/` exists | Load `guides/workflows/create-instructions.md` |\n| \"write/create instructions\", \"delegate\" | `instructions/` missing | Suggest workspace initialization first |\n| \"set up/initialize\" workspace | Directories don''t exist | Load `guides/workflows/initialize-workspace.md` |\n| \"set up/initialize\" workspace | Directories exist | Warn: already initialized |\n| \"grade\", \"evaluate\" work | `grades/` exists | Load `guides/workflows/grade-work.md` |\n| \"grade\", \"evaluate\" work | `grades/` missing | Suggest workspace initialization first |\n| \"send instructions\" | — | Load `guides/workflows/send-instructions.md` (bash copy, no agents) |\n| \"verify\", \"test hooks\" | — | Load `references/workspace_verification_protocol.md` |\n| \"OpenCode\", \"dual-mode\" | — | Load `references/opencode_integration_quickstart.md` |\n| \"permissions\" | — | Load `references/permissions_setup_protocol.md` |\n| \"upgrade\", \"migrate\" | — | Load `references/upgrade.md` |\n\n## Resource Loading Policy\n\n**Load ONLY when needed:**\n- Workflow guides: When intent is classified\n- Reference docs: When user needs detailed protocol\n- Templates: When creating workspace or files\n- Never load all references \"just in case\"\n\n**Core Resources by Intent:**\n\n| Intent | Primary Resource | Supporting Resources |\n|--------|-----------------|---------------------|\n| Create Instructions | `guides/workflows/create-instructions.md` | `references/instruction_structure.md`, `references/human_instruction_structure.md`, `references/file_naming.md` |\n| Initialize Workspace | `guides/workflows/initialize-workspace.md` | `references/workspace_setup_complete.md` |\n| Grade Work | `guides/workflows/grade-work.md` | `references/grading_rubrics.md`, `references/decision_types.md` |\n| Send Instructions | `guides/workflows/send-instructions.md` | (none - simple bash copy) |\n| Verify Setup | `references/workspace_verification_protocol.md` | `references/pre_work_checklist.md` |\n| Setup Permissions | `references/permissions_setup_protocol.md` | - |\n| OpenCode Support | `references/opencode_integration_quickstart.md` | `references/opencode_setup_guide.md` |\n\n## Critical Protocol: File Locations\n\n**The architect agent operates in its own workspace, NOT the code agent workspace.**\n\n| Artifact | Architect Writes To | Code Agent Location |\n|----------|--------------------|--------------------|\n| Instructions | `[ARCHITECT]/instructions/` | Reads from `debugging/instructions/` |\n| Human Instructions | `[ARCHITECT]/human/` | N/A (for manual execution) |\n| Grades | `[ARCHITECT]/grades/` | N/A |\n| Logs | N/A | Writes to `[CODE_AGENT]/debugging/logs/` |\n\n**Human Instructions = Executable Documentation** (not summaries!)\n\nHuman instructions must enable manual execution when code agents are unavailable. Include copy-pasteable commands, expected output, and troubleshooting. See `references/human_instruction_structure.md`.\n\n**Guard Rail:** If about to write to the code agent''s workspace, stop and verify the operation.\n\n## Quick Setup (Template-Based)\n\nFor fastest setup, use templates:\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.claude/skills/architect-agent/templates/\n\n# Create code agent workspace\n./setup-workspace.sh code-agent ~/projects/my-code-agent\n\n# Create architect workspace\n./setup-workspace.sh architect ~/projects/my-architect \\\n    --code-agent-path ~/projects/my-code-agent\n```\n\n**Time:** <5 minutes\n**See:** `templates/README.md`\n\n## DO NOT Trigger For\n\n- General architecture discussions\n- Brainstorming or exploration\n- Reading/analyzing existing code\n- Research tasks\n- Any work that isn''t explicit instruction creation, grading, or setup\n\n## Reference Directory\n\nAll detailed protocols are in `references/`. Load only what is needed for the current task.\n\n### Core References (Instruction & Grading)\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `instruction_structure.md` | Code agent instruction template |\n| `human_instruction_structure.md` | Human-executable instruction template |\n| `grading_rubrics.md` | 6-category grading criteria |\n| `instruction_grading_workflow.md` | Full grading workflow |\n| `decision_types.md` | decision, rationale, investigation, verification, deviation, milestone |\n| `file_naming.md` | Timestamp and naming conventions |\n\n### Setup & Configuration\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `installation.md` | Skill installation guide |\n| `quick_start.md` | Fast-track setup |\n| `workspace_setup_complete.md` | Full workspace initialization |\n| `workspace_verification_protocol.md` | Verify setup is correct |\n| `permissions_setup_protocol.md` | Cross-workspace permissions |\n| `upgrade.md` | Upgrade to latest version |\n\n### Logging & Debugging\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `logging_protocol.md` | Hybrid logging v2.0 |\n| `hybrid_logging_protocol.md` | Detailed hybrid logging spec |\n| `hook_configuration_critical.md` | Hook setup requirements |\n| `hook_logger_enhancements.md` | Hook logger improvements |\n| `pre_work_checklist.md` | Code agent pre-work verification |\n| `get_unstuck_protocol.md` | Recovery from blockers |\n| `resilience_protocol.md` | Error recovery patterns |\n| `testing_protocol.md` | Progressive testing requirements |\n\n### OpenCode Integration\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `opencode_integration_quickstart.md` | Dual-mode quick start |\n| `opencode_setup_guide.md` | Full OpenCode setup |\n| `opencode_migration_guide.md` | Migrate to OpenCode |\n| `opencode_logging_protocol.md` | OpenCode-specific logging |\n| `opencode_wrapper_setup.md` | Wrapper script setup |\n| `claude_vs_opencode_comparison.md` | Feature comparison |\n\n### Agent Configuration\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `agent_specialization.md` | Agent role configuration |\n| `code_agent_claude_template.md` | CLAUDE.md template for code agents |\n| `code_agent_agents_template.md` | AGENTS.md template for code agents |\n\n### Project Management\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `git_pr_management.md` | Git and PR workflow |\n| `ticket_tracking_pr_management.md` | Ticket and PR tracking |\n\n## Guides Directory\n\nStep-by-step workflows in `guides/workflows/`:\n\n| Guide | Trigger |\n|-------|---------|\n| `create-instructions.md` | \"write instructions for code agent\" |\n| `grade-work.md` | \"grade the code agent''s work\" |\n| `send-instructions.md` | \"send instructions to code agent\" |\n| `initialize-workspace.md` | \"set up architect agent workspace\" |\n\n### Templates\n\nReady-to-use workspace templates in `templates/`:\n\n| Template | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| `setup-workspace.sh` | Automated workspace creation script |\n| `architect-workspace/` | Complete architect agent workspace template |\n| `code-agent-workspace/` | Complete code agent workspace template |\n\n**See:** `templates/README.md` for usage instructions.\n\n---"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:35.854Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Architect Agents needing advanced workflow coordination and automation across architect and code agent workspaces.","zh":"非常适合需要高级工作流协调和自动化的架构代理，能够跨架构和代码代理工作空间进行协调。","ja":"アーキテクトエージェントが高度なワークフロー調整と自動化を必要とする場合に最適です。アーキテクトとコードエージェントのワークスペースを横断して調整できます。","ko":"고급 워크플로우 조정 및 자동화가 필요한 아키텍트 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 아키텍트와 코드 에이전트의 워크스페이스를跨으로 조정할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Arquitectura que necesitan una coordinación de flujo de trabajo avanzada y automatización en áreas de trabajo de arquitectura y código.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Architecture ayant besoin d''une coordination de workflow avancée et d''automatisation dans les espaces de travail d''architecture et de code.","de":"Perfekt für Architekturagenten, die eine erweiterte Workflow-Koordination und -Automatisierung in Architektur- und Code-Arbeitsbereichen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Arquiteto que necessitam de coordenação de fluxo de trabalho avançada e automação em espaços de trabalho de arquiteto e agente de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Архитектурных Агентов, которым необходима продвинутая координация рабочих процессов и автоматизация в рабочих пространствах архитектора и кодового агента.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل المعماري الذي يحتاج إلى تنسيق متقدم للعملية وآليّة عبر مساحات عمل الوكيل المعماري ووكيل الكود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to coordinate planning, delegation, and evaluation using intent classification, decision trees, and resource loading policies, streamlining workflow automation with critical protocols.","zh":"赋予代理协调规划、委托和评估的能力，使用意图分类、决策树和资源加载策略，简化工作流自动化中的关键协议。","ja":"代理が計画、委任、評価を調整する能力を付与し、意図分類、決定木、リソース読み込みポリシーを使用してワークフローの自動化を最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 계획, 위임, 평가를 조정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 의도 분류, 의사 결정 트리, 리소스 로딩 정책을 사용하여 워크플로우 자동화의 중요한 프로토콜을 간소화합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para coordinar la planificación, la delegación y la evaluación utilizando la clasificación de intenciones, los árboles de decisión y las políticas de carga de recursos, simplificando la automatización del flujo de trabajo con protocolos críticos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de coordonner la planification, la délégation et l''évaluation en utilisant la classification d''intention, les arbres de décision et les politiques de chargement de ressources, rationalisant l''automatisation du workflow avec des protocoles critiques.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Planung, Delegation und Bewertung mithilfe der Intent-Klassifizierung, Entscheidungsbäume und Ressourcenladeprozesse zu koordinieren, wodurch die Workflow-Automatisierung mit kritischen Protokollen rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coordenar planejamento, delegação e avaliação usando classificação de intenção, árvores de decisão e políticas de carregamento de recursos, simplificando a automação do fluxo de trabalho com protocolos críticos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью координировать планирование, делегирование и оценку с использованием классификации намерений, деревьев решений и политики загрузки ресурсов, оптимизируя автоматизацию рабочих процессов критическими протоколами.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تنسيق التخطيط والتفويض والتقييم باستخدام تصنيف النية وأشجار القرار وسياسات تحميل الموارد، مبسطاً آليّةautomation للعملية الإجرائية ببروتوكولات حرجة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workspace initialization for code agents","Generating instructions for code agents using decision trees","Evaluating and grading work based on predefined criteria and protocols"],"zh":["为代码代理自动初始化工作空间","使用决策树为代码代理生成指令","根据预定义的标准和协议评估和评分工作"],"ja":["コードエージェントのワークスペースを自動初期化する","決定木を使用してコードエージェントに指示を生成する","事前に定義された基準とプロトコルに基づいて作業を評価および評価する"],"ko":["코드 에이전트를 위한 워크스페이스를 자동으로 초기화합니다.","의사 결정 트리를 사용하여 코드 에이전트에 대한 지침을 생성합니다.","사전에 정의된 기준 및 프로토콜을 기반으로 작업을 평가 및 점수 매기기"],"es":["Automatizar la inicialización del área de trabajo para los agentes de código","Generar instrucciones para los agentes de código utilizando árboles de decisión","Evaluar y calificar el trabajo en función de criterios y protocolos predefinidos"],"fr":["Automatiser l''initialisation de l''espace de travail pour les agents de code","Générer des instructions pour les agents de code à l''aide d''arbres de décision","Évaluer et noter le travail en fonction de critères et de protocoles prédéfinis"],"de":["Automatisieren der Initialisierung des Arbeitsbereichs für Code-Agents","Erzeugen von Anweisungen für Code-Agents unter Verwendung von Entscheidungsbäumen","Bewerten und Benoten der Arbeit auf der Grundlage vordefinierter Kriterien und Protokolle"],"pt":["Automatizar a inicialização do espaço de trabalho para agentes de código","Gerar instruções para agentes de código usando árvores de decisão","Avaliar e classificar o trabalho com base em critérios e protocolos predefinidos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать инициализацию рабочего пространства для кодовых агентов","Генерировать инструкции для кодовых агентов с использованием деревьев решений","Оценивать и оценивать работу на основе предварительно определенных критериев и протоколов"],"ar":["تأتمتة تهيئة مساحة عمل وكيل الكود","توليد تعليمات لوكيل الكود باستخدام أشجار القرار","تقييم ودرجة العمل على أساس معايير وبروتوكولات محددة مسبقاً"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires comprehensive understanding of intent classification and decision trees","Dependent on resource loading policy for optimal performance","Limited to architect and code agent workspaces"],"zh":["需要对意图分类和决策树有全面的理解","依赖资源加载策略以实现最佳性能","仅限于架构和代码代理工作空间"],"ja":["意図分類と決定木についての包括的な理解が必要","最適なパフォーマンスを実現するためにリソース読み込みポリシーに依存する","アーキテクトとコードエージェントのワークスペースのみに限定される"],"ko":["의도 분류 및 의사 결정 트리에 대한 포괄적인 이해가 필요합니다.","최적의 성능을 달성하기 위해 리소스 로딩 정책에 의존합니다.","아키텍트 및 코드 에이전트의 워크스페이스에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere una comprensión integral de la clasificación de intenciones y los árboles de decisión","Depende de la política de carga de recursos para un rendimiento óptimo","Limitado a áreas de trabajo de arquitectura y código"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension complète de la classification d''intention et des arbres de décision","Dépend de la politique de chargement de ressources pour des performances optimales","Limité aux espaces de travail d''architecture et de code"],"de":["Erfordert ein umfassendes Verständnis der Intent-Klassifizierung und Entscheidungsbäume","Ist von der Ressourcenladepolitik für optimale Leistung abhängig","Begrenzt auf Architektur- und Code-Arbeitsbereiche"],"pt":["Requer compreensão abrangente da classificação de intenção e árvores de decisão","Dependente da política de carregamento de recursos para desempenho ótimo","Limitado a espaços de trabalho de arquiteto e agente de código"],"ru":["Требует всестороннего понимания классификации намерений и деревьев решений","Зависит от политики загрузки ресурсов для оптимальной производительности","Ограничен рабочими пространствами архитектора и кодового агента"],"ar":["يتطلب فهماً شاملاً لتصنيف النية وأشجار القرار","يعتمد على سياسة تحميل الموارد لأداء مثالي","محدود بمساحات عمل الوكيل المعماري ووكيل الكود"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3cb2e039d77927a4d2b0d7b8ea4d6ada58f099db0139ba368748909d0dae7e1f","qualityScore":45}');
