o","Soporte para múltiples habilidades de agentes"],"fr":["Standardisation de la configuration de AGENTS.md","Centralisation du support des compétences des agents","Compatibilité avec les outils d''agents IA","Implémentation simple dans votre référentiel","Support pour plusieurs compétences des agents"],"de":["Standardisierung der Konfiguration von AGENTS.md","Zentralisierung der Unterstützung von Agentenfähigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit KI-Agenten-Tools","Einfache Implementierung in Ihrem Repository","Unterstützung für mehrere Agentenfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Padronização da configuração de habilidades de agentes","Centralização da gestão de agentes de inteligência artificial","Suporte a AGENTS.md","Integração com repositórios","Simplificação da gestão de agentes"],"ru":["Стандартизация настройки навыков агентов","Централизация управления агентами ИИ","Поддержка AGENTS.md","Интеграция с репозиториями","Упрощение управления агентами"],"ar":["توحيد إعدادات مهارات الوكيل","تكامل إدارة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم AGENTS.md","تكامل مع المستودعات","تسهيل إدارة الوكلاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理工具","AGENTS.md配置","Agent Skills支持","开发效率","配置和技能支持","如何使用AI智能代理工具","AI智能代理工具安装","AI智能代理工具设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントツール","AGENTS.md設定","Agent Skillsサポート","開発効率","設定とスキルサポート","AIエージェントツールの使い方","AIエージェントツールのインストール","AIエージェントツールの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 도구","AGENTS.md 구성","에이전트 기술 지원","개발 효율","구성과 기술 지원","AI 에이전트 도구 사용법","AI 에이전트 도구 설치","AI 에이전트 도구 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de agentes de IA","polyfill para AGENTS.md","cómo usar herramientas de agentes de IA","qué es un polyfill","alternativas a herramientas de agentes de IA","instalación de herramientas de agentes de IA","guía de configuración de AGENTS.md"],"fr":["outils d''agents IA","polyfill pour AGENTS.md","comment utiliser les outils d''agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un polyfill","alternatives aux outils d''agents IA","installation des outils d''agents IA","guide de configuration de AGENTS.md"],"de":["KI-Agenten-Tools","Polyfill für AGENTS.md","wie man KI-Agenten-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Polyfill","Alternativen zu KI-Agenten-Tools","Installation von KI-Agenten-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für AGENTS.md"],"pt":["como usar polyfill para AGENTS.md","o que é polyfill para AGENTS.md","ferramentas de inteligência artificial","agentes de inteligência artificial","polyfill para AGENTS.md alternative","polyfill para AGENTS.md vs outros","instalar polyfill para AGENTS.md","guia de configuração polyfill para AGENTS.md"],"ru":["как использовать polyfill для AGENTS.md","что такое polyfill для AGENTS.md","инструменты искусственного интеллекта","агенты искусственного интеллекта","polyfill для AGENTS.md альтернатива","polyfill для AGENTS.md vs другие","установить polyfill для AGENTS.md","руководство по настройке polyfill для AGENTS.md"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام بوليفيل AGENTS.md","ما هو بوليفيل AGENTS.md","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بوليفيل AGENTS.md بديل","بوليفيل AGENTS.md مقابل غيره","تثبيت بوليفيل AGENTS.md","دليل إعداد بوليفيل AGENTS.md"]}},"owner":"nevir","repo":"agentfill","repoPath":"nevir/agentfill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.706Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# /skill\n\nCreate or update portable agent skills in `.agents/skills/` that work across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other agents supporting the [Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io).\n\n## Determine the Mode\n\n**Creating a new skill** — the user wants a skill that doesn''t exist yet. Follow the full workflow below.\n\n**Updating an existing skill** — the user wants to modify a skill in `.agents/skills/`. Read the existing SKILL.md and supporting files first, then apply changes following","body":"# /skill\n\nCreate or update portable agent skills in `.agents/skills/` that work across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other agents supporting the [Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io).\n\n## Determine the Mode\n\n**Creating a new skill** — the user wants a skill that doesn''t exist yet. Follow the full workflow below.\n\n**Updating an existing skill** — the user wants to modify a skill in `.agents/skills/`. Read the existing SKILL.md and supporting files first, then apply changes following the same quality principles.\n\n## Creating a New Skill\n\n### Step 1: Understand\n\nAsk the user to describe what they want the skill to do. Gather:\n\n- **Purpose**: What task does this skill help with?\n- **Trigger**: When should an agent activate this skill? What would the user say?\n- **Examples**: 2-3 concrete examples of the skill in action (input/output or before/after)\n\nIf the user is vague, suggest concrete examples to refine the scope. A good skill is focused — it does one thing well. If the request covers multiple distinct tasks, suggest splitting into separate skills.\n\n### Step 2: Research\n\nBefore writing the skill:\n\n- Search for existing patterns, conventions, and code related to the skill''s domain\n- Check `.agents/skills/` for existing skills that might overlap\n- Identify project-specific conventions the skill should follow\n- Note any tools, scripts, or references the skill might need to bundle\n\n### Step 3: Plan\n\nDesign the skill and present the plan to the user before writing:\n\n- **Name**: lowercase-hyphenated, 1-64 characters, descriptive. This becomes the `/slash-command`.\n- **Description**: 1-2 sentences covering WHAT it does and WHEN to use it. Include keywords matching how users naturally phrase the request. This is the most important field — it determines when agents auto-activate the skill.\n- **Instructions outline**: Key steps, rules, and examples. Only include information the agent doesn''t already know.\n- **Supporting files**: Decide what goes in SKILL.md vs `references/`:\n  - **In SKILL.md**: Rules and content the agent needs in every or most activations\n  - **In references/**: Content needed only in specific scenarios (e.g., \"when creating a new script from scratch\")\n  - Each reference file needs a clear trigger condition — not just \"overflow\"\n  - Multiple focused files are better than one monolithic reference\n\n### Step 4: Create\n\nCreate the skill directory and files:\n\n1. Create `.agents/skills/<name>/`\n2. Write `SKILL.md` with YAML frontmatter and markdown body\n3. Add supporting files as needed (`references/`, `scripts/`, `assets/`)\n\nUse the SKILL.md template below. For the full frontmatter reference, read `references/skill-specification.md`.\n\n**SKILL.md template:**\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: <lowercase-hyphenated-name>\ndescription: >-\n  <What it does>. <When to use it — include trigger keywords>.\n---\n\n# <Skill Title>\n\n<Brief overview — 1-2 sentences.>\n\n## <Main workflow or instructions>\n\n<Steps, rules, examples. Only include what the agent doesn''t already know.>\n```\n\n**Key rules:**\n- Keep the body under 500 lines (aim for under 200 for workflow skills; up to 400 for style/rules skills)\n- Use universal frontmatter fields (`name`, `description`) for portability\n- Agent-specific fields (like Claude''s `allowed-tools`) are safe to add but will be ignored by other agents\n- Use input/output examples — they''re more effective than descriptions\n- Reference supporting files from the body so the agent knows when to load them\n\n### Step 5: Validate\n\nRun the validation script to check structure and frontmatter:\n\n```sh\n.agents/skills/skill/scripts/validate-skill.sh .agents/skills/<name>\n```\n\nAlso verify manually:\n\n- [ ] `name` is lowercase-hyphenated, 1-64 characters\n- [ ] `description` explains WHAT and WHEN (includes trigger keywords)\n- [ ] Body is focused — no information the agent already knows\n- [ ] No unnecessary agent-specific assumptions in instructions\n- [ ] Supporting files are referenced from SKILL.md\n- [ ] Scripts are executable (`chmod +x`)\n\n### Step 6: Test\n\nSuggest the user test the skill:\n\n1. Start a new agent session (skills are discovered at session start)\n2. Ask the agent to perform the task the skill handles\n3. Verify the skill activates and produces correct results\n4. If it doesn''t activate, check the description for missing trigger keywords\n\n## Updating an Existing Skill\n\n1. **Read** the existing SKILL.md and all supporting files\n2. **Understand** what changes are needed and why\n3. **Update** the files, keeping the same quality principles (conciseness, portability, good description)\n4. **Validate** with the validation script\n5. **Note**: Claude Code hot-reloads skill changes (v2.1.0+) — no restart needed\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Description Quality Matters Most\n\nThe description determines whether agents auto-activate the skill. Write it as if explaining to a colleague when they should reach for this tool. Include the 3-5 most natural phrasings a user would use.\n\n### Concise is Key\n\nOnly include information the agent doesn''t already know. If the agent can figure something out from context, don''t spell it out. Challenge every paragraph.\n\n### Portability First\n\nSkills in `.agents/skills/` are shared across all configured agents. Stick to universal frontmatter fields. Describe actions rather than naming agent-specific tools. Use forward slashes for paths.\n\n### One Skill, One Job\n\nEach skill should have a focused purpose. If a skill tries to do too many things, it will either trigger too broadly or its instructions will be too vague to be useful. Split into separate skills instead.\n\n### Right-Size Your References\n\nNot all content belongs in `references/`. If the agent needs content in most activations, it belongs in SKILL.md. Reference files are for content needed only in specific scenarios.\n\n**In SKILL.md** (loaded every activation):\n- Core rules, conventions, and patterns\n- Examples of correct/incorrect usage\n- Common decision guidance\n\n**In focused reference files** (loaded on demand):\n- Full code templates (e.g., \"read when creating a new script from scratch\")\n- Detailed rules for uncommon scenarios (e.g., \"read when formatting tables\")\n- Extended examples for edge cases\n\n**Reference file guidelines:**\n- Each file should have a clear load trigger stated in SKILL.md\n- Name files by scenario: `new-script-template.md` not `full-guide.md`\n- Multiple small files (50-150 lines each) beat one large file\n- A reference that''s always loaded defeats the purpose — merge it into SKILL.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:02.437Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing standardized skill configuration and support across multiple platforms.","zh":"适用于需要在多个平台上标准化技能配置和支持的AI代理。","ja":"複数のプラットフォームで標準化されたスキル構成とサポートが必要なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"다중 플랫폼에서 표준화된 스킬 구성 및 지원이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una configuración de habilidades estandarizada y soporte en múltiples plataformas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA ayant besoin d''une configuration de compétences standardisée et d''un support sur plusieurs plateformes.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine standardisierte Fähigkeitskonfiguration und Unterstützung auf mehreren Plattformen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de configuração de habilidades padronizadas e suporte em várias plataformas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих стандартизированной конфигурации навыков и поддержки на нескольких платформах.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوين مهارات معياري ودعم عبر منصات متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage portable skills using the Agent Skills specification, supporting seamless integration with Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other compatible agents, while utilizing the `.agents/skills/` directory for centralized skill management.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理使用Agent Skills规范的便携式技能的能力，支持与Claude Code、Gemini CLI和其他兼容代理的无缝集成，同时利用`.agents/skills/`目录进行集中式技能管理。","ja":"エージェントはAgent Skillsの仕様を使用したポータブルなスキルの作成と管理を可能にし、Claude Code、Gemini CLI、その他の互換性のあるエージェントとのシームレスな統合をサポートし、`.agents/skills/`ディレクトリを使用した集中管理を利用する。","ko":"에이전트는 에이전트 스킬 사양을 사용하여 이식 가능한 스킬을 만들고 관리할 수 있으며, Claude Code, Gemini CLI 및 기타 호환 에이전트와의无縫な 통합을 지원하며, `.agents/skills/` 디렉토리를 사용하여集中 스킬 관리를 활용할 수 있다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar habilidades portátiles utilizando la especificación de habilidades del agente, lo que admite una integración sin problemas con Claude Code, Gemini CLI y otros agentes compatibles, mientras utiliza el directorio `.agents/skills/` para la gestión centralizada de habilidades.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des compétences portables en utilisant la spécification de compétences de l''agent, ce qui prend en charge une intégration transparente avec Claude Code, Gemini CLI et d''autres agents compatibles, tout en utilisant le répertoire `.agents/skills/` pour la gestion centralisée des compétences.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, portable Fähigkeiten zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem sie die Agent Skills-Spezifikation verwenden, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Claude Code, Gemini CLI und anderen kompatiblen Agents ermöglicht, während das Verzeichnis `.agents/skills/` für die zentrale Fähigkeitsverwaltung verwendet wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e gerenciem habilidades portáteis usando a especificação de Habilidades do Agente, com suporte à integração perfeita com Claude Code, Gemini CLI e outros agentes compatíveis, utilizando o diretório `.agents/skills/` para gerenciamento centralizado de habilidades.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять переносимыми навыками, используя спецификацию навыков агента, с поддержкой бесшовной интеграции с Claude Code, Gemini CLI и другими совместимыми агентами, используя директорию `.agents/skills/` для централизованного управления навыками.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء وإدارة مهارات قابلة للنقل باستخدام مواصفات مهارات الوكيل، مع دعم التكامل السلس مع Claude Code وGemini CLI ووكلاء متوافقين آخرين، مع استخدام الدليل `.agents/skills/` لإدارة المهارات المركزية."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new skills for cross-platform compatibility","Updating existing skills to adhere to the Agent Skills specification","Standardizing skill configurations across multiple agent platforms"],"zh":["为跨平台兼容性创建新的技能","更新现有的技能以遵循Agent Skills规范","在多个代理平台上标准化技能配置"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォーム互換性のために新しいスキルを作成する","既存のスキルを更新してAgent Skillsの仕様に従う","複数のエージェントプラットフォームでスキル構成を標準化する"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 위한 새로운 스킬 생성","기존의 스킬을 에이전트 스킬 사양에 따라 업데이트함","다중 에이전트 플랫폼에서 스킬 구성 표준화"],"es":["Crear nuevas habilidades para la compatibilidad entre plataformas","Actualizar habilidades existentes para que cumplan con la especificación de habilidades del agente","Estandarizar configuraciones de habilidades en varias plataformas de agentes"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles compétences pour la compatibilité entre les plateformes","Mettre à jour des compétences existantes pour qu''elles soient conformes à la spécification de compétences de l''agent","Standardiser les configurations de compétences sur plusieurs plateformes d''agents"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Fähigkeiten für die Kompatibilität zwischen Plattformen","Aktualisieren bestehender Fähigkeiten, um die Agent Skills-Spezifikation einzuhalten","Standardisieren von Fähigkeitskonfigurationen auf mehreren Agent-Plattformen"],"pt":["Criar novas habilidades para compatibilidade entre plataformas","Atualizar habilidades existentes para atender à especificação de Habilidades do Agente","Padronizar configurações de habilidades em várias plataformas de agentes"],"ru":["Создание новых навыков для совместимости между платформами","Обновление существующих навыков для соответствия спецификации навыков агента","Стандартизация конфигураций навыков на нескольких платформах агентов"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات جديدة لتحقيق التوافق بين المنصات","تحديث المهارات الحالية لتوافقها مع مواصفات مهارات الوكيل","توحيد تكوين المهارات عبر منصات وكلاء متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the Agent Skills specification","Limited to agents supporting the Agent Skills specification"],"zh":["需要遵循Agent Skills规范","仅限支持Agent Skills规范的代理"],"ja":["Agent Skillsの仕様に従う必要がある","Agent Skillsの仕様をサポートするエージェントのみ"],"ko":["에이전트 스킬 사양을 따라야 함","에이전트 스킬 사양을 지원하는 에이전트만 해당"],"es":["Requiere el cumplimiento de la especificación de habilidades del agente","Limitado a agentes que admiten la especificación de habilidades del agente"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect de la spécification de compétences de l''agent","Limité aux agents qui prennent en charge la spécification de compétences de l''agent"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Agent Skills-Spezifikation","Begrenzt auf Agents, die die Agent Skills-Spezifikation unterstützen"],"pt":["Exige aderência à especificação de Habilidades do Agente","Limitado a agentes que suportam a especificação de Habilidades do Agente"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения спецификации навыков агента","Ограничен агентами, поддерживающими спецификацию навыков агента"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع مواصفات مهارات الوكيل","محدود بالوكلاء الذين يدعمون مواصفات مهارات الوكيل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2a832e482ce790961b446226bc13d0ed7701facf32c522ced914c06eefa6c5ac","qualityScore":45}');
