board","Modifications de fichiers en masse","Automatisation des tâches","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Prise en charge de formats de fichiers variés"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Mihomo Dashboard","Änderungen an Dateien in großem Umfang","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für verschiedene Dateiformate"],"pt":["Arquivamento em massa avançado","Integração com Mihomo Dashboard","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento de IA","Suporte a React e Node.js","CLI para automação de tarefas"],"ru":["Расширенное массовое архивирование","Интеграция с Mihomo Dashboard","Инструменты разработки ИИ","Поддержка React и Node.js","CLI для автоматизации задач"],"ar":["أرشفة كبيرة متقدمة","التكامل مع لوحة تحكم Mihomo","أدوات تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم React و Node.js","CLI لآلية المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用openspec-bulk-archive-change","Mihomo Dashboard教程","openspec-bulk-archive-change替代品","批量存档更改工具","AI智能工具安装","Mihomo Dashboard设置指南"],"ja":["openspec-bulk-archive-changeの使い方","Mihomo Dashboardのチュートリアル","openspec-bulk-archive-changeの代替","バルクアーカイブ変更ツール","AIエージェントのインストール","Mihomo Dashboardの設定ガイド"],"ko":["openspec-bulk-archive-change 사용 방법","Mihomo Dashboard 튜토리얼","openspec-bulk-archive-change 대안","대량 아카이브 변경 도구","AI 에이전트 설치","Mihomo Dashboard 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar openspec-bulk-archive-change","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","alternativas a openspec-bulk-archive-change","openspec-bulk-archive-change vs otras herramientas","instalación de openspec-bulk-archive-change","guía de configuración de openspec-bulk-archive-change","desarrollo de software con openspec-bulk-archive-change","mejora de la productividad con openspec-bulk-archive-change"],"fr":["comment utiliser openspec-bulk-archive-change","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","alternatives à openspec-bulk-archive-change","openspec-bulk-archive-change vs d''autres outils","installation d''openspec-bulk-archive-change","guide de configuration d''openspec-bulk-archive-change","développement de logiciels avec openspec-bulk-archive-change","amélioration de la productivité avec openspec-bulk-archive-change"],"de":["wie man openspec-bulk-archive-change verwendet","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Alternativen zu openspec-bulk-archive-change","openspec-bulk-archive-change vs andere Tools","Installation von openspec-bulk-archive-change","Konfigurationsanleitung für openspec-bulk-archive-change","Softwareentwicklung mit openspec-bulk-archive-change","Produktivitätssteigerung mit openspec-bulk-archive-change"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","openspec-bulk-archive-change","mihomo dashboard","desenvolvimento de ia","arquivamento em massa","react","node.js","cli","automatização de tarefas"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","openspec-bulk-archive-change","mihomo dashboard","разработка ии","массовое архивирование","react","node.js","cli","автоматизация задач"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","openspec-bulk-archive-change","لوحة تحكم Mihomo","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","أرشفة كبيرة","react","node.js","cli","آلية المهام"]}},"owner":"MetaCubeX","repo":"metacubexd","repoPath":"MetaCubeX/metacubexd","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.720Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-bulk-archive-change","description":"Archive multiple completed changes at once. Use when archiving several parallel changes.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select t","body":"Archive multiple completed changes in a single operation.\n\nThis skill allows you to batch-archive changes, handling spec conflicts intelligently by checking the codebase to determine what''s actually implemented.\n\n**Input**: None required (prompts for selection)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **Get active changes**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get all active changes.\n\n   If no active changes exist, inform user and stop.\n\n2. **Prompt for change selection**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with multi-select to let user choose changes:\n   - Show each change with its schema\n   - Include an option for \"All changes\"\n   - Allow any number of selections (1+ works, 2+ is the typical use case)\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT auto-select. Always let the user choose.\n\n3. **Batch validation - gather status for all selected changes**\n\n   For each selected change, collect:\n\n   a. **Artifact status** - Run `openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json`\n   - Parse `schemaName` and `artifacts` list\n   - Note which artifacts are `done` vs other states\n\n   b. **Task completion** - Read `openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - Count `- [ ]` (incomplete) vs `- [x]` (complete)\n   - If no tasks file exists, note as \"No tasks\"\n\n   c. **Delta specs** - Check `openspec/changes/<name>/specs/` directory\n   - List which capability specs exist\n   - For each, extract requirement names (lines matching `### Requirement: <name>`)\n\n4. **Detect spec conflicts**\n\n   Build a map of `capability -> [changes that touch it]`:\n\n   ```\n   auth -> [change-a, change-b]  <- CONFLICT (2+ changes)\n   api  -> [change-c]            <- OK (only 1 change)\n   ```\n\n   A conflict exists when 2+ selected changes have delta specs for the same capability.\n\n5. **Resolve conflicts agentically**\n\n   **For each conflict**, investigate the codebase:\n\n   a. **Read the delta specs** from each conflicting change to understand what each claims to add/modify\n\n   b. **Search the codebase** for implementation evidence:\n   - Look for code implementing requirements from each delta spec\n   - Check for related files, functions, or tests\n\n   c. **Determine resolution**:\n   - If only one change is actually implemented -> sync that one''s specs\n   - If both implemented -> apply in chronological order (older first, newer overwrites)\n   - If neither implemented -> skip spec sync, warn user\n\n   d. **Record resolution** for each conflict:\n   - Which change''s specs to apply\n   - In what order (if both)\n   - Rationale (what was found in codebase)\n\n6. **Show consolidated status table**\n\n   Display a table summarizing all changes:\n\n   ```\n   | Change               | Artifacts | Tasks | Specs   | Conflicts | Status |\n   |---------------------|-----------|-------|---------|-----------|--------|\n   | schema-management   | Done      | 5/5   | 2 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | project-config      | Done      | 3/3   | 1 delta | None      | Ready  |\n   | add-oauth           | Done      | 4/4   | 1 delta | auth (!)  | Ready* |\n   | add-verify-skill    | 1 left    | 2/5   | None    | None      | Warn   |\n   ```\n\n   For conflicts, show the resolution:\n\n   ```\n   * Conflict resolution:\n     - auth spec: Will apply add-oauth then add-jwt (both implemented, chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   For incomplete changes, show warnings:\n\n   ```\n   Warnings:\n   - add-verify-skill: 1 incomplete artifact, 3 incomplete tasks\n   ```\n\n7. **Confirm batch operation**\n\n   Use **AskUserQuestion tool** with a single confirmation:\n   - \"Archive N changes?\" with options based on status\n   - Options might include:\n     - \"Archive all N changes\"\n     - \"Archive only N ready changes (skip incomplete)\"\n     - \"Cancel\"\n\n   If there are incomplete changes, make clear they''ll be archived with warnings.\n\n8. **Execute archive for each confirmed change**\n\n   Process changes in the determined order (respecting conflict resolution):\n\n   a. **Sync specs** if delta specs exist:\n   - Use the openspec-sync-specs approach (agent-driven intelligent merge)\n   - For conflicts, apply in resolved order\n   - Track if sync was done\n\n   b. **Perform the archive**:\n\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p openspec/changes/archive\n   mv openspec/changes/<name> openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n   ```\n\n   c. **Track outcome** for each change:\n   - Success: archived successfully\n   - Failed: error during archive (record error)\n   - Skipped: user chose not to archive (if applicable)\n\n9. **Display summary**\n\n   Show final results:\n\n   ```\n   ## Bulk Archive Complete\n\n   Archived 3 changes:\n   - schema-management-cli -> archive/2026-01-19-schema-management-cli/\n   - project-config -> archive/2026-01-19-project-config/\n   - add-oauth -> archive/2026-01-19-add-oauth/\n\n   Skipped 1 change:\n   - add-verify-skill (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\n   Spec sync summary:\n   - 4 delta specs synced to main specs\n   - 1 conflict resolved (auth: applied both in chronological order)\n   ```\n\n   If any failures:\n\n   ```\n   Failed 1 change:\n   - some-change: Archive directory already exists\n   ```\n\n**Conflict Resolution Examples**\n\nExample 1: Only one implemented\n\n```\nConflict: specs/auth/spec.md touched by [add-oauth, add-jwt]\n\nChecking add-oauth:\n- Delta adds \"OAuth Provider Integration\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/auth/oauth.ts implementing OAuth flow\n\nChecking add-jwt:\n- Delta adds \"JWT Token Handling\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... no JWT implementation found\n\nResolution: Only add-oauth is implemented. Will sync add-oauth specs only.\n```\n\nExample 2: Both implemented\n\n```\nConflict: specs/api/spec.md touched by [add-rest-api, add-graphql]\n\nChecking add-rest-api (created 2026-01-10):\n- Delta adds \"REST Endpoints\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/rest.ts\n\nChecking add-graphql (created 2026-01-15):\n- Delta adds \"GraphQL Schema\" requirement\n- Searching codebase... found src/api/graphql.ts\n\nResolution: Both implemented. Will apply add-rest-api specs first,\nthen add-graphql specs (chronological order, newer takes precedence).\n```\n\n**Output On Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n- <change-2> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-2>/\n\nSpec sync summary:\n- N delta specs synced to main specs\n- No conflicts (or: M conflicts resolved)\n```\n\n**Output On Partial Success**\n\n```\n## Bulk Archive Complete (partial)\n\nArchived N changes:\n- <change-1> -> archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<change-1>/\n\nSkipped M changes:\n- <change-2> (user chose not to archive incomplete)\n\nFailed K changes:\n- <change-3>: Archive directory already exists\n```\n\n**Output When No Changes**\n\n```\n## No Changes to Archive\n\nNo active changes found. Use `/opsx:new` to create a new change.\n```\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Allow any number of changes (1+ is fine, 2+ is the typical use case)\n- Always prompt for selection, never auto-select\n- Detect spec conflicts early and resolve by checking codebase\n- When both changes are implemented, apply specs in chronological order\n- Skip spec sync only when implementation is missing (warn user)\n- Show clear per-change status before confirming\n- Use single confirmation for entire batch\n- Track and report all outcomes (success/skip/fail)\n- Preserve .openspec.yaml when moving to archive\n- Archive directory target uses current date: YYYY-MM-DD-<name>\n- If archive target exists, fail that change but continue with others\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:51:34.708Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing efficient spec conflict resolution and bulk archiving capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高效的规格冲突解决和批量归档功能的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが効率的な仕様の相互に矛盾する解決と一括アーカイブ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 관리 에이전트가 효율적인 사양 충돌 해결 및 일괄 보관 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de código que necesitan una resolución eficiente de conflictos de especificaciones y capacidades de archivado masivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant une résolution efficace de conflits de spécifications et des capacités d''archivage massif.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agents, die eine effiziente Auflösung von Spezifikationskonflikten und Massenarchivierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de resolução eficiente de conflitos de especificação e capacidades de arquivamento em massa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, которым требуются эффективное решение конфликтов спецификаций и возможности массового архивирования.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى حل فعال للتعارضات في المواصفات وقدرات الأرشفة بالجملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to intelligently handle spec conflicts by checking the codebase, and archive multiple completed changes in a single operation using the openspec list --json command, streamlining the development process with JSON output and multi-select prompts via the AskUserQuestion tool.","zh":"赋予代理智能处理规格冲突的能力，通过检查代码库，并使用 openspec list --json 命令在单一操作中存档多个已完成的更改，通过 JSON 输出和 AskUserQuestion 工具的多选提示简化开发流程。","ja":"エージェントに、コードベースを確認し、openspec list --json コマンドを使用して単一の操作で複数の完了した変更をアーカイブすることにより、仕様の相互に矛盾する解決を智能的に処理する能力を与え、JSON 出力と AskUserQuestion ツールの複数選択のプロンプトを使用して開発プロセスを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드베이스를 확인하고 openspec list --json 명령을 사용하여 단일 작업에서 여러 완료된 변경 사항을 보관함으로써 사양 충돌을 지능적으로 처리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고 JSON 출력 및 AskUserQuestion 도구의 다중 선택 프롬프트를 통해 개발 프로세스를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar inteligentemente los conflictos de especificaciones mediante la verificación de la base de código y archivar varios cambios completados en una sola operación utilizando el comando openspec list --json, simplificando el proceso de desarrollo con salida JSON y solicitudes de selección múltiple a través de la herramienta AskUserQuestion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer intelligemment les conflits de spécifications en vérifiant la base de code et en archivant plusieurs modifications complétées en une seule opération en utilisant la commande openspec list --json, rationalisant le processus de développement avec une sortie JSON et des invites de sélection multiple via l''outil AskUserQuestion.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Spezifikationskonflikte intelligent durch Überprüfung der Codebasis zu handhaben und mehrere abgeschlossene Änderungen in einer einzigen Operation mit dem Befehl openspec list --json zu archivieren, wodurch der Entwicklungsprozess mit JSON-Ausgabe und Multi-Select-Prompts über das Tool AskUserQuestion rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar inteligentemente com conflitos de especificações, verificando a base de código e arquivando várias alterações concluídas em uma única operação usando o comando openspec list --json, otimizando o processo de desenvolvimento com saída JSON e prompts de seleção múltipla via a ferramenta AskUserQuestion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интеллектуально обрабатывать конфликты спецификаций, проверяя кодовую базу и архивируя несколько завершенных изменений в одной операции с помощью команды openspec list --json, оптимизируя процесс разработки с выводом JSON и многоселективными подсказками через инструмент AskUserQuestion.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من التعامل بذكاء مع تعارضات المواصفات من خلال التحقق من قاعدة الشفرة وأرشفة عدة تغييرات مكتملة في عملية واحدة باستخدام الأمر openspec list --json ، وبتحسين عملية التطوير الإخراج JSON وعرض المطالبات المتعددة من خلال أداة AskUserQuestion."},"useCases":{"en":["Batch-archiving completed changes","Resolving spec conflicts intelligently","Automating codebase organization"],"zh":["批量归档已完成的更改","智能解决规格冲突","自动代码库组织"],"ja":["完了した変更の一括アーカイブ","仕様の相互に矛盾する解決の智能化","コードベースの自動整理"],"ko":["완료된 변경 사항의 일괄 보관","사양 충돌의 지능형 해결","코드베이스 자동 구성"],"es":["Archivado masivo de cambios completados","Resolución inteligente de conflictos de especificaciones","Automatización de la organización de la base de código"],"fr":["Archivage massif de modifications complétées","Résolution intelligente de conflits de spécifications","Automatisation de l''organisation de la base de code"],"de":["Massenarchivierung abgeschlossener Änderungen","Intelligente Auflösung von Spezifikationskonflikten","Automatisierung der Codebasis-Organisation"],"pt":["Arquivamento em massa de alterações concluídas","Resolução inteligente de conflitos de especificações","Organização automática da base de código"],"ru":["Пакетное архивирование завершенных изменений","Интеллектуальное решение конфликтов спецификаций","Автоматическая организация кодовой базы"],"ar":["الأرشفة بالجملة للتغييرات المكتملة","حل ذكي للتعارضات في المواصفات","تنظيم تلقائي لقاعدة الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation","Dependent on codebase accessibility"],"zh":["需要 openspec 安装","依赖于代码库的可访问性"],"ja":["openspec のインストールが必要","コードベースのアクセシビリティに依存"],"ko":["openspec 설치가 필요","코드베이스 접근성에 종속"],"es":["Requiere instalación de openspec","Dependiente de la accesibilidad de la base de código"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''openspec","Dépend de l''accessibilité de la base de code"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von openspec","Abhängig von der Zugänglichkeit der Codebasis"],"pt":["Requer instalação do openspec","Dependente da acessibilidade da base de código"],"ru":["Требует установки openspec","Зависит от доступности кодовой базы"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت openspec","يعتمد على إمكانية الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f42ab9c99f56c5646d109e7fe94407c25e847ea12c8b43facc8ea42ddc488c72","qualityScore":45}');
