s d''IA: Amélioration de l''UI/UX avec Docker et Atlas","de":"KI-Tools: UI/UX-Verbesserung mit Docker und Atlas","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: ui-ux-improve para Desenvolvimento Local","ru":"ИИ Агенты: ui-ux-improve для локальной разработки","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: ui-ux-improve للتنمية المحلية","en":"ui-ux-improve"},"description":{"zh":"ui-ux-improve是一种使用Docker和Atlas迁移管理PostgreSQL模式的本地开发基础设施","ja":"ui-ux-improveは、DockerとAtlasマイグレーションを使用してPostgreSQLスキーマを管理するローカル開発インフラです","ko":"ui-ux-improve는 Docker와 Atlas 마이그레이션을 사용하여 PostgreSQL 스키마를 관리하는 로컬 개발 인프라입니다","es":"Mejora la infraestructura de desarrollo local y la gestión de esquemas de PostgreSQL con Docker y Atlas migrations para una mejor experiencia de UI/UX","fr":"Améliorez l''infrastructure de développement local et la gestion de schémas PostgreSQL avec Docker et Atlas migrations pour une meilleure expérience UI/UX","de":"Verbessern Sie die lokale Entwicklungsumgebung und die PostgreSQL-Schemaverwaltung mit Docker und Atlas-Migrationen für eine bessere UI/UX-Erfahrung","pt":"ui-ux-improve é uma ferramenta de IA para melhorar a infraestrutura de desenvolvimento local, utilizando Docker e migrações Atlas para gerenciamento de esque...","ru":"ui-ux-improve - это инструмент ИИ для улучшения локальной инфраструктуры разработки, использующий Docker и миграции Atlas для управления схемами PostgreSQL","ar":"ui-ux-improve هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتحسين البنية التحتية للتنمية المحلية، باستخدام Docker وعمليات نقل الأطلس لإدارة مخططات قاعدة البيانات PostgreSQL","en":"🏗️ Local development infrastructure and PostgreSQL schema management using Docker and Atlas migrations."},"definition":{"en":"🏗️ Local development infrastructure and PostgreSQL schema management using Docker and Atlas migrations."},"features":{"zh":["使用Docker管理PostgreSQL模式","Atlas迁移支持","本地开发基础设施","提高开发效率","支持多种数据库模式"],"ja":["Dockerを使用してPostgreSQLスキーマを管理する","Atlasマイグレーションのサポート","ローカル開発インフラ","開発効率の向上","複数のデータベーススキーマをサポート"],"ko":["Docker를 사용하여 PostgreSQL 스키마를 관리","Atlas 마이그레이션 지원","로컬 개발 인프라","개발 효율성 향상","다수의 데이터베이스 스키마 지원"],"es":["Infraestructura de desarrollo local con Docker","Gestión de esquemas de PostgreSQL con Atlas migrations","Mejora de la experiencia de UI/UX","Desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Optimización de la eficiencia del desarrollo"],"fr":["Infrastructure de développement local avec Docker","Gestion de schémas PostgreSQL avec Atlas migrations","Amélioration de l''expérience UI/UX","Développement d''applications évolutives","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Optimisation de l''efficacité du développement"],"de":["Lokale Entwicklungsumgebung mit Docker","Verwaltung von PostgreSQL-Schemata mit Atlas-Migrationen","Verbesserung der UI/UX-Erfahrung","Entwicklung von skalierbaren Anwendungen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Optimierung der Entwicklungseffizienz"],"pt":["Utilização de Docker para desenvolvimento local","Gerenciamento de esquemas PostgreSQL com migrações Atlas","Melhoria da infraestrutura de desenvolvimento local","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a desenvolvedores para melhorar a produtividade"],"ru":["Использование Docker для локальной разработки","Управление схемами PostgreSQL с помощью миграций Atlas","Улучшение локальной инфраструктуры разработки","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка разработчиков для повышения производительности"],"ar":["استخدام Docker للتنمية المحلية","إدارة مخططات قاعدة البيانات PostgreSQL مع عمليات نقل الأطلس","تحسين البنية التحتية للتنمية المحلية","التكامل مع أدوات التنمية","دعم المطورين لتحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ui-ux-improve","AI智能工具","本地开发基础设施","PostgreSQL模式管理","Docker","Atlas迁移","如何使用ui-ux-improve","ui-ux-improve安装","ui-ux-improve设置指南"],"ja":["ui-ux-improve","AIエージェント","ローカル開発インフラ","PostgreSQLスキーマ管理","Docker","Atlasマイグレーション","ui-ux-improveの使い方","ui-ux-improveインストール","ui-ux-improve設定ガイド"],"ko":["ui-ux-improve","AI 에이전트","로컬 개발 인프라","PostgreSQL 스키마 관리","Docker","Atlas 마이그레이션","ui-ux-improve 사용법","ui-ux-improve 설치","ui-ux-improve 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","mejora de UI/UX","Docker","Atlas migrations","desarrollo de aplicaciones","infraestructura de desarrollo local","gestión de esquemas de PostgreSQL","cómo mejorar la experiencia de UI/UX","alternativas a Docker","guía de instalación de Atlas"],"fr":["outils d''IA","amélioration de l''UI/UX","Docker","Atlas migrations","développement d''applications","infrastructure de développement local","gestion de schémas PostgreSQL","comment améliorer l''expérience UI/UX","alternatives à Docker","guide d''installation d''Atlas"],"de":["KI-Tools","Verbesserung von UI/UX","Docker","Atlas-Migrationen","Anwendungsentwicklung","lokale Entwicklungsumgebung","Verwaltung von PostgreSQL-Schemata","wie man die UI/UX-Erfahrung verbessert","Alternativen zu Docker","Installationsanleitung für Atlas"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento local","docker","migrações atlas","postgreSQL","ui-ux-improve","melhoria da infraestrutura","produtividade de desenvolvedores","guias de instalação","configuração de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","локальная разработка","docker","миграции atlas","postgreSQL","ui-ux-improve","улучшение инфраструктуры","производительность разработчиков","руководства по установке","настройка разработки"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التنمية المحلية","docker","عمليات نقل الأطلس","قاعدة البيانات postgresql","ui-ux-improve","تحسين البنية التحتية","إنتاجية المطورين","دلائل التثبيت","إعداد التنمية"]}},"owner":"specvital","repo":"infra","repoPath":"specvital/infra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.723Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-improve","description":"Research UI/UX improvements with trend analysis and generate actionable recommendations. Use when you need comprehensive UI/UX analysis and improvement suggestions.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Improvement Research Command\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nParse user input for:\n\n- **Focus Area**: Specific component, page, or feature to improve (optional)\n- **Mode**: `research` (default) or `implement` (immediate action)\n- **Scope**: `full` (entire app) or `targeted` (specific area)\n\nIf empty, analyze entire application with research mode.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis command combines AI-powered UI/UX analysis with real-time trend research to generate actionable improvement rec","body":"# UI/UX Improvement Research Command\n\n## User Input\n\n```text\n$ARGUMENTS\n```\n\nParse user input for:\n\n- **Focus Area**: Specific component, page, or feature to improve (optional)\n- **Mode**: `research` (default) or `implement` (immediate action)\n- **Scope**: `full` (entire app) or `targeted` (specific area)\n\nIf empty, analyze entire application with research mode.\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis command combines AI-powered UI/UX analysis with real-time trend research to generate actionable improvement recommendations.\n\n### Key Features\n\n- 🎨 **UI/UX Designer Agent**: Specialized analysis via ui-ux-designer agent\n- 🛠️ **Tech Stack Advisor Agent**: Library/framework recommendations via tech-stack-advisor agent\n- 🔍 **Trend Research**: Web search for current UI/UX trends (2024-2025)\n- 📊 **Gap Analysis**: Compare current state vs best practices\n- 📝 **Actionable Report**: Generate improvement roadmap in markdown\n- 🚀 **Optional Implementation**: Execute improvements on demand\n\n---\n\n## Execution Steps\n\n### 1. Context Gathering\n\n#### Analyze Project Structure\n\n**Detect Frontend Framework**:\n\n- Check `package.json` for: React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, Angular\n- Identify styling approach: Tailwind, CSS Modules, styled-components, CSS-in-JS\n- Find component library: shadcn/ui, MUI, Chakra, Radix\n\n**Explore UI Components**:\n\n- Use Glob to find component files (`**/*.tsx`, `**/components/**/*`)\n- Identify layout components (Header, Footer, Sidebar, Navigation)\n- Map page structure and routing\n\n**Analyze Current Design System**:\n\n- Color palette (CSS variables, theme config)\n- Typography (fonts, sizes, weights)\n- Spacing and layout patterns\n- Component consistency\n\n### 2. Invoke UI/UX Designer Agent\n\n**REQUIRED**: Use Task tool with `subagent_type: \"ui-ux-designer\"` to perform:\n\n- User experience evaluation\n- Accessibility assessment (WCAG guidelines)\n- Information architecture review\n- Component usability analysis\n- Mobile responsiveness check\n\n**Agent Prompt Template**:\n\n```\nAnalyze the UI/UX of this project focusing on:\n1. User journey and flow optimization\n2. Visual hierarchy and information architecture\n3. Accessibility compliance (WCAG 2.1 AA)\n4. Component reusability and consistency\n5. Responsive design patterns\n6. User interaction feedback patterns\n\nProject context:\n- Framework: {detected framework}\n- Styling: {styling approach}\n- Component library: {if any}\n- Focus area: {from user input or \"entire application\"}\n\nProvide specific, actionable recommendations with priority levels.\n```\n\n### 3. Invoke Tech Stack Advisor Agent\n\n**REQUIRED**: Use Task tool with `subagent_type: \"tech-stack-advisor\"` when:\n\n- Recommending new UI component libraries\n- Evaluating animation/interaction libraries\n- Comparing styling solutions\n- Suggesting accessibility tooling\n- Recommending state management for UI\n\n**Agent Prompt Template**:\n\n```\nEvaluate UI/UX related technologies for this project:\n\nCurrent stack:\n- Framework: {detected framework}\n- Styling: {styling approach}\n- Component library: {if any}\n\nEvaluate these categories based on project needs:\n1. Component libraries (shadcn/ui, Radix, Headless UI, etc.)\n2. Animation libraries (Framer Motion, React Spring, GSAP)\n3. Accessibility tools (axe-core, react-aria, etc.)\n4. Icon libraries (Lucide, Heroicons, Phosphor)\n5. Form libraries (React Hook Form, Formik, etc.)\n\nFor each recommendation:\n- Modernity score (0-10)\n- Stability score (0-10)\n- Bundle size impact\n- Migration complexity\n- Learning curve\n\nFocus on: {user focus area or \"general UI/UX improvement\"}\n```\n\n### 4. Trend Research (Web Search)\n\n**Search Queries** (use WebSearch tool):\n\n1. `\"UI/UX trends 2025\" best practices`\n2. `\"{framework} UI design patterns 2025\"` (e.g., \"React UI design patterns 2025\")\n3. `\"modern web design trends\" accessibility`\n4. `\"{component type} UX best practices\"` (if specific focus area)\n5. `\"best {library type} library 2025\"` (e.g., \"best React animation library 2025\")\n\n**Information to Gather**:\n\n- Current design trends (micro-interactions, glassmorphism, etc.)\n- Accessibility improvements\n- Performance optimization patterns\n- User engagement techniques\n- Mobile-first strategies\n- Emerging UI libraries and tools\n- Bundle size optimization techniques\n\n### 5. Gap Analysis\n\n**Compare and Identify**:\n\n- Current design vs trend recommendations\n- Missing accessibility features\n- Outdated patterns to modernize\n- Quick wins vs major refactors\n- Priority based on impact/effort ratio\n- Library/tool upgrades or additions needed\n\n### 6. Generate Report\n\n**Create**: `UI-UX-IMPROVEMENTS.md` at project root\n\n**Structure**:\n\n```markdown\n# UI/UX Improvement Recommendations\n\n> **Generated**: {YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm}\n> **Scope**: {full/targeted: specific area}\n> **Mode**: {research/implement}\n\n---\n\n## 📊 Current State Analysis\n\n### Framework & Stack\n\n- **Framework**: {detected}\n- **Styling**: {approach}\n- **Component Library**: {if any}\n\n### Strengths\n\n- {what''s working well}\n\n### Areas for Improvement\n\n- {identified issues}\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Trend Insights (2024-2025)\n\n### Design Trends\n\n- {trend 1}: {how it applies}\n- {trend 2}: {how it applies}\n\n### Accessibility Standards\n\n- {WCAG requirements}\n- {current compliance status}\n\n### UX Best Practices\n\n- {practice 1}\n- {practice 2}\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ Technology Recommendations\n\n### Recommended Libraries\n\n| Category   | Library   | Score  | Bundle Size | Why      |\n| ---------- | --------- | ------ | ----------- | -------- |\n| {category} | {library} | {X}/10 | {size}      | {reason} |\n\n### Migration Considerations\n\n- {library 1}: {migration notes}\n- {library 2}: {migration notes}\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Recommendations\n\n### Critical Priority\n\n#### 1. {Recommendation Title}\n\n**Problem**: {what''s wrong}\n**Solution**: {how to fix}\n**Impact**: {user benefit}\n**Effort**: {Low/Medium/High}\n**Files**: {affected files}\n\n### High Priority\n\n#### 2. {Recommendation Title}\n\n{same structure}\n\n### Medium Priority\n\n#### 3. {Recommendation Title}\n\n{same structure}\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Implementation Roadmap\n\n### Phase 1: Quick Wins (1-2 days)\n\n- [ ] {task 1}\n- [ ] {task 2}\n\n### Phase 2: Core Improvements (1-2 weeks)\n\n- [ ] {task 3}\n- [ ] {task 4}\n\n### Phase 3: Advanced Enhancements (2-4 weeks)\n\n- [ ] {task 5}\n- [ ] {task 6}\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Resources\n\n- {relevant documentation links}\n- {trend articles referenced}\n- {component library docs}\n```\n\n### 7. Implementation Mode (if requested)\n\nIf user specified `implement` mode or requests immediate action:\n\n1. Confirm scope with user before proceeding\n2. Start with Critical Priority items\n3. Make incremental changes with clear commits\n4. Verify each change doesn''t break existing functionality\n5. Update report with completed items\n\n---\n\n## Key Rules\n\n### ✅ MUST DO\n\n- **Always invoke ui-ux-designer agent** for expert analysis\n- **Always invoke tech-stack-advisor agent** for library/tool recommendations\n- **Perform web search** for current trends and library comparisons\n- **Analyze actual project code** (not assumptions)\n- **Provide specific file paths** in recommendations\n- **Include effort estimates** for each recommendation\n- **Evaluate bundle size impact** for library recommendations\n- **Generate report at project root** (`UI-UX-IMPROVEMENTS.md`)\n- **Consider accessibility** in all recommendations\n- **Prioritize by impact/effort ratio**\n\n### ❌ NEVER DO\n\n- Skip ui-ux-designer or tech-stack-advisor agent invocation\n- Make recommendations without code analysis\n- Suggest breaking changes without migration path\n- Ignore mobile/responsive considerations\n- Recommend trends that conflict with project constraints\n- Implement without user confirmation (in implement mode)\n- Generate vague or non-actionable recommendations\n- Recommend libraries without bundle size consideration\n- Suggest libraries with poor stability scores (<6/10)\n\n### 🎯 Quality Standards\n\nEach recommendation must include:\n\n1. **Clear Problem Statement**: What''s wrong and why it matters\n2. **Specific Solution**: How to fix with code examples if applicable\n3. **User Impact**: How it improves user experience\n4. **Effort Estimate**: Implementation complexity (Low/Medium/High)\n5. **File References**: Which files need changes\n\n---\n\n## Completion Report\n\nAfter execution, provide summary:\n\n```markdown\n## UI/UX Improvement Research Complete\n\n### 📊 Analysis Summary\n\n- **Components Analyzed**: {X}\n- **Pages Reviewed**: {Y}\n- **Trends Researched**: {Z}\n- **Libraries Evaluated**: {W}\n\n### 🎯 Recommendations\n\n- **Critical**: {N}\n- **High**: {M}\n- **Medium**: {K}\n\n### 📄 Generated Report\n\n`UI-UX-IMPROVEMENTS.md` created at project root.\n\n### Next Steps\n\n{Based on mode}:\n\n- **Research mode**: Review recommendations and run with `implement` to proceed\n- **Implement mode**: {X} improvements applied, {Y} remaining\n```\n\n---\n\n## Execute\n\nStart the UI/UX improvement research following the guidelines above.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:52:48.729Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Analysis Agents needing advanced UI/UX improvement research capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级 UI/UX 改进研究能力的 UI/UX 分析代理","ja":"UI/UX 分析エージェントが高度な UI/UX 改善研究能力を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"고급 UI/UX 개선 연구 능력이 필요한 UI/UX 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de UI/UX que necesitan capacidades de investigación de mejora de UI/UX avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse UI/UX nécessitant des capacités de recherche avancées d''amélioration de UI/UX.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte UI/UX-Verbesserungsforschungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de UI/UX que necessitam de capacidades de pesquisa de melhoria de UI/UX avançadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа UI/UX, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности исследования улучшения UI/UX.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى قدرات بحث متقدمة لتحسين واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate actionable UI/UX improvement recommendations using research mode and implement mode, with capabilities such as focus area, mode, and scope analysis.","zh":"通过研究模式和实现模式，赋予代理生成可操作的 UI/UX 改善建议的能力，包括焦点区域、模式和范围分析等功能","ja":"エージェントに研究モードと実装モードを使用して、可操作な UI/UX 改善の推奨を生成する能力を与えます。これには、焦点区域、モード、スコープ分析などの機能があります","ko":"연구 모드와 구현 모드를 사용하여 에이전트가 UI/UX 개선의 추천을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. 이는焦점 지역, 모드, 범위 분석などの 기능을 포함합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar recomendaciones de mejora de UI/UX accionables utilizando el modo de investigación y el modo de implementación, con capacidades como análisis de área de enfoque, modo y alcance.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des recommandations d''amélioration de UI/UX actionnables en utilisant le mode de recherche et le mode d''implémentation, avec des capacités telles que l''analyse de zone de focalisation, de mode et de portée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, handhabbare UI/UX-Verbesserungsempfehlungen unter Verwendung des Forschungsmodus und des Implementierungsmodus zu generieren, mit Fähigkeiten wie Fokusflächen-, Modus- und Umfangsanalyse.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar recomendações ações de melhoria de UI/UX usando modo de pesquisa e modo de implementação, com capacidades como área de foco, modo e análise de escopo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать рекомендации по улучшению UI/UX, используя режим исследования и режим реализации, с возможностями, такими как область фокуса, режим и анализ объема.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد توصيات لتحسين واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم باستخدام وضع البحث ووضع التنفيذ، مع إمكانيات مثل منطقة التركيز والوضع وتحليل النطاق."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing entire applications for UI/UX improvements","Improving specific components or pages","Generating targeted UI/UX improvement recommendations"],"zh":["分析整个应用程序以获取 UI/UX 改善","提高特定组件或页面的 UI/UX","生成针对特定 UI/UX 改善的建议"],"ja":["UI/UX 改善のために、全アプリケーションを分析します","特定のコンポーネントまたはページの UI/UX を改善します","特定の UI/UX 改善のために、ターゲットを生成します"],"ko":["UI/UX 개선을 위해 전체 애플리케이션을 분석합니다","특정 구성 요소 또는 페이지의 UI/UX를 개선합니다","특정 UI/UX 개선의 대상으로 생성합니다"],"es":["Análisis de aplicaciones completas para mejoras de UI/UX","Mejora de componentes o páginas específicos","Generación de recomendaciones de mejora de UI/UX dirigidas"],"fr":["Analyse d''applications complètes pour améliorations de UI/UX","Amélioration de composants ou de pages spécifiques","Génération de recommandations d''amélioration de UI/UX ciblées"],"de":["Analyse ganzer Anwendungen für UI/UX-Verbesserungen","Verbesserung spezifischer Komponenten oder Seiten","Erzeugen gezielter UI/UX-Verbesserungsempfehlungen"],"pt":["Analisar aplicativos inteiros para melhorias de UI/UX","Melhorar componentes ou páginas específicas","Gerar recomendações direcionadas de melhoria de UI/UX"],"ru":["Анализировать все приложения для улучшения UI/UX","Улучшать определенные компоненты или страницы","Генерировать целевые рекомендации по улучшению UI/UX"],"ar":["تحليل التطبيقات الكاملة لتحسينات واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم","تحسين المكونات أو الصفحات المحددة","توليد توصيات مستهدفة لتحسين واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input for focus area, mode, and scope","Limited to research and implement modes"],"zh":["需要用户输入焦点区域、模式和范围","仅限于研究和实现模式"],"ja":["焦点区域、モード、スコープに対するユーザー入力を必要とします","研究モードと実装モードのみに制限されます"],"ko":["焦점 지역, 모드, 범위를 위한 사용자 입력을 필요로 합니다","연구 모드와 구현 모드만으로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere entrada de usuario para área de enfoque, modo y alcance","Limitado a modos de investigación e implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la zone de focalisation, le mode et la portée","Limité aux modes de recherche et d''implémentation"],"de":["Benutzereingabe für Fokusfläche, Modus und Umfang erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Forschungs- und Implementierungsmodi"],"pt":["Requer entrada do usuário para área de foco, modo e escopo","Limitado a modos de pesquisa e implementação"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для области фокуса, режима и объема","Ограничен режимами исследования и реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لمنطقة التركيز والوضع والنطاق","محدود بالوضعين البحث والتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f8805caf12b5bb62d92b47b071eac6e30267915c83aba10a1b48a5494731f032","qualityScore":45}');
