o de macOS para Desenvolved...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Настройка macOS для разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: إعداد بيئة تطوير macOS","en":"macos-setup"},"description":{"zh":"macOS开发环境搭建指南，涵盖Homebrew、Zsh、Node.js、Python、Go、Docker、Kubernetes等工具","ja":"macOS開発環境のセットアップガイド。Homebrew、Zsh、Node.js、Python、Go、Docker、Kubernetesなどを含む","ko":"macOS 개발 환경 설정 가이드. Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker, Kubernetes 등을 포함","es":"Configuración de entorno de desarrollo macOS para ingenieros con Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker y Kubernetes.","fr":"Configuration de l''environnement de développement macOS pour les ingénieurs avec Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker et Kubernetes.","de":"Einrichtung der macOS-Entwicklungsumgebung für Ingenieure mit Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker und Kubernetes.","pt":"Guia de configuração de ambiente de desenvolvimento macOS para engenheiros, com ferramentas como Homebrew, Zsh e Node.js.","ru":"Руководство по настройке среды разработки macOS для инженеров, с инструментами seperti Homebrew, Zsh и Node.js.","ar":"دليل إعداد بيئة تطوير macOS للمهندسين، مع أدوات مثل Homebrew و Zsh و Node.js.","en":"From Zero to Hero — An opinionated macOS development environment setup guide for engineers. Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker, Kubernetes, and more."},"definition":{"en":"From Zero to Hero — An opinionated macOS development environment setup guide for engineers. Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker, Kubernetes, and more."},"features":{"zh":["使用Homebrew安装开发工具","配置Zsh shell","安装Node.js、Python、Go等开发环境","使用Docker和Kubernetes进行容器化开发","简化开发环境的搭建和管理"],"ja":["Homebrewを使用して開発ツールをインストール","Zshシェルを設定","Node.js、Python、Goなどの開発環境をインストール","DockerとKubernetesを使用してコンテナ化開発","開発環境のセットアップと管理を簡素化"],"ko":["Homebrew를 사용하여 개발 도구 설치","Zsh 쉘 구성","Node.js, Python, Go 등 개발 환경 설치","Docker와 Kubernetes를 사용한 컨테이너화 개발","개발 환경 설정과 관리를 간소화"],"es":["Instalación de Homebrew","Configuración de Zsh","Instalación de Node.js y Python","Configuración de Go y Docker","Implementación de Kubernetes"],"fr":["Installation de Homebrew","Configuration de Zsh","Installation de Node.js et Python","Configuration de Go et Docker","Mise en œuvre de Kubernetes"],"de":["Installation von Homebrew","Konfiguration von Zsh","Installation von Node.js und Python","Konfiguration von Go und Docker","Implementierung von Kubernetes"],"pt":["Instalação do Homebrew","Configuração do Zsh","Instalação do Node.js","Configuração do Docker","Instalação do Kubernetes","Configuração do Go e Python"],"ru":["Установка Homebrew","Настройка Zsh","Установка Node.js","Настройка Docker","Установка Kubernetes","Настройка Go и Python"],"ar":["تثبيت Homebrew","إعداد Zsh","تثبيت Node.js","إعداد Docker","تثبيت Kubernetes","إعداد Go و Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["macOS开发环境搭建","AI智能工具","Homebrew安装","Zsh shell配置","Node.js安装","Python开发环境","Go语言开发","Docker容器化","Kubernetes集群管理"],"ja":["macOS開発環境のセットアップ","AIエージェント","Homebrewを使用した開発ツールのインストール","Zshシェルの設定","Node.jsのインストール","Python開発環境","Go言語の開発","Dockerのコンテナ化","Kubernetesのクラスター管理"],"ko":["macOS 개발 환경 설정","AI 에이전트","Homebrew를 사용한 개발 도구 설치","Zsh 쉘 구성","Node.js 설치","Python 개발 환경","Go 언어 개발","Docker 컨테이너화","Kubernetes 클러스터 관리"],"es":["herramientas AI para desarrollo","configuración de macOS para desarrollo","guía de instalación de Homebrew","cómo usar Zsh","instalación de Node.js en macOS","alternativas a Docker","Kubernetes vs Docker"],"fr":["outils IA pour le développement","configuration de macOS pour le développement","guide d''installation de Homebrew","comment utiliser Zsh","installation de Node.js sur macOS","alternatives à Docker","Kubernetes vs Docker"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Konfiguration von macOS für die Entwicklung","Anleitungen zur Installation von Homebrew","wie man Zsh verwendet","Installation von Node.js auf macOS","Alternativen zu Docker","Kubernetes vs Docker"],"pt":["como usar Homebrew","o que é Zsh","guia de instalação do Node.js","ferramentas de desenvolvimento para macOS","alternativas ao Homebrew","Homebrew vs MacPorts","instalar Docker no macOS","configurar Kubernetes no macOS"],"ru":["как использовать Homebrew","что такое Zsh","руководство по установке Node.js","инструменты разработки для macOS","альтернативы Homebrew","Homebrew vs MacPorts","установить Docker на macOS","настроить Kubernetes на macOS"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Homebrew","ما هو Zsh","دليل تثبيت Node.js","أدوات تطوير للتطبيقات على macOS","بديلات Homebrew","Homebrew مقابل MacPorts","تثبيت Docker على macOS","إعداد Kubernetes على macOS"]}},"owner":"larrykoo711","repo":"new-macos-starter","repoPath":"larrykoo711/new-macos-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.729Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"macos-setup","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# macOS Starter - Setup Skill\n\n> From Zero to Hero - AI-powered macOS development environment configuration\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `/new-macos-setup` | Full interactive setup wizard |\n| `/new-macos-setup --quick` | Quick setup with defaults |\n| `/new-macos-setup --preset fullstack` | Use fullstack preset |\n| `/new-macos-setup --dry-run` | Preview without installing |\n\n---\n\n## Skill Capabilities\n\n### 0. Network Proxy Check (前置步骤)\n\n在开始安装前，必须确保网络可","body":"# macOS Starter - Setup Skill\n\n> From Zero to Hero - AI-powered macOS development environment configuration\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `/new-macos-setup` | Full interactive setup wizard |\n| `/new-macos-setup --quick` | Quick setup with defaults |\n| `/new-macos-setup --preset fullstack` | Use fullstack preset |\n| `/new-macos-setup --dry-run` | Preview without installing |\n\n---\n\n## Skill Capabilities\n\n### 0. Network Proxy Check (前置步骤)\n\n在开始安装前，必须确保网络可以访问 Google 和 GitHub：\n\n```bash\ncheck_network() {\n    echo \"=== Network Connectivity Check ===\"\n    echo \"\"\n\n    # Test GitHub\n    echo \"Testing GitHub...\"\n    if curl -s --connect-timeout 5 https://github.com > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n        echo \"✅ GitHub: accessible\"\n    else\n        echo \"❌ GitHub: not accessible\"\n        NEED_PROXY=true\n    fi\n\n    # Test Google (for some Homebrew dependencies)\n    echo \"Testing Google...\"\n    if curl -s --connect-timeout 5 https://www.google.com > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n        echo \"✅ Google: accessible\"\n    else\n        echo \"❌ Google: not accessible\"\n        NEED_PROXY=true\n    fi\n\n    # Test Homebrew\n    echo \"Testing Homebrew...\"\n    if curl -s --connect-timeout 5 https://raw.githubusercontent.com > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n        echo \"✅ Homebrew sources: accessible\"\n    else\n        echo \"❌ Homebrew sources: not accessible\"\n        NEED_PROXY=true\n    fi\n\n    if [ \"$NEED_PROXY\" = true ]; then\n        echo \"\"\n        echo \"⚠️  Network issues detected. Proxy configuration required.\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    echo \"\"\n    echo \"✅ Network OK - Ready to proceed\"\n    return 0\n}\n```\n\n**代理配置流程:**\n\n1. **询问用户代理信息:**\n```yaml\nquestions:\n  - id: proxy_needed\n    question: \"Do you need to configure a network proxy to access GitHub/Google?\"\n    options:\n      - label: \"Yes, I have a proxy\"\n        description: \"Configure HTTP/HTTPS proxy\"\n      - label: \"No, direct connection works\"\n        description: \"Skip proxy configuration\"\n\n  - id: proxy_config\n    question: \"Please provide your proxy configuration:\"\n    condition: \"proxy_needed == ''Yes''\"\n    inputs:\n      - label: \"Proxy URL\"\n        placeholder: \"http://127.0.0.1:7890\"\n        example: \"http://127.0.0.1:7890 or socks5://127.0.0.1:1080\"\n```\n\n2. **设置临时环境变量:**\n```bash\nsetup_proxy() {\n    local proxy_url=\"$1\"\n\n    if [ -n \"$proxy_url\" ]; then\n        echo \"Setting proxy: $proxy_url\"\n        export http_proxy=\"$proxy_url\"\n        export https_proxy=\"$proxy_url\"\n        export HTTP_PROXY=\"$proxy_url\"\n        export HTTPS_PROXY=\"$proxy_url\"\n        export ALL_PROXY=\"$proxy_url\"\n\n        # For Git\n        git config --global http.proxy \"$proxy_url\"\n        git config --global https.proxy \"$proxy_url\"\n\n        echo \"✅ Proxy configured for this session\"\n        echo \"\"\n        echo \"To make permanent, add to ~/.zshrc:\"\n        echo \"  export http_proxy=\\\"$proxy_url\\\"\"\n        echo \"  export https_proxy=\\\"$proxy_url\\\"\"\n    fi\n}\n```\n\n3. **验证代理是否工作:**\n```bash\nverify_proxy() {\n    echo \"Verifying proxy configuration...\"\n\n    if curl -s --connect-timeout 5 https://github.com > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n        echo \"✅ GitHub accessible via proxy\"\n    else\n        echo \"❌ GitHub still not accessible\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    if curl -s --connect-timeout 5 https://www.google.com > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n        echo \"✅ Google accessible via proxy\"\n    else\n        echo \"❌ Google still not accessible\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    echo \"✅ Proxy verification passed\"\n    return 0\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 1. System Detection\n\nDetect installed software and versions:\n\n```bash\n# Core tools detection script\ndetect_installed() {\n    echo \"=== System Detection ===\"\n\n    # Homebrew\n    if command -v brew &>/dev/null; then\n        echo \"✅ Homebrew: $(brew --version | head -1)\"\n    else\n        echo \"❌ Homebrew: not installed\"\n    fi\n\n    # Shell\n    echo \"✅ Shell: $SHELL\"\n    [ -d \"$HOME/.oh-my-zsh\" ] && echo \"✅ Oh-My-Zsh: installed\"\n    command -v starship &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Starship: installed\"\n\n    # Git\n    command -v git &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Git: $(git --version)\"\n    command -v gh &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ GitHub CLI: installed\"\n    command -v delta &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Delta: installed\"\n\n    # Modern CLI\n    command -v eza &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ eza: installed\"\n    command -v bat &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ bat: installed\"\n    command -v fd &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ fd: installed\"\n    command -v rg &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ ripgrep: installed\"\n\n    # Languages\n    command -v fnm &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ fnm: installed\"\n    command -v node &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Node.js: $(node --version)\"\n    command -v pnpm &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ pnpm: installed\"\n    command -v uv &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ uv: installed\"\n    command -v python3 &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Python: $(python3 --version)\"\n    command -v goenv &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ goenv: installed\"\n    command -v go &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Go: $(go version)\"\n\n    # Container\n    command -v docker &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Docker: installed\"\n    command -v kubectl &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ kubectl: installed\"\n    command -v helm &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Helm: installed\"\n    command -v k9s &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ k9s: installed\"\n\n    # Applications\n    [ -d \"/Applications/Raycast.app\" ] && echo \"✅ Raycast: installed\"\n    [ -d \"/Applications/Warp.app\" ] && echo \"✅ Warp: installed\"\n    [ -d \"/Applications/Visual Studio Code.app\" ] && echo \"✅ VS Code: installed\"\n    [ -d \"/Applications/OrbStack.app\" ] && echo \"✅ OrbStack: installed\"\n\n    # Vibe Coding Tools\n    echo \"\"\n    echo \"--- Vibe Coding Tools ---\"\n    command -v claude &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Claude Code: $(claude --version 2>/dev/null | head -1 || echo ''installed'')\" || echo \"❌ Claude Code\"\n    command -v ccline &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ CCometixLine: installed\" || echo \"❌ CCometixLine\"\n    [ -d \"/Applications/Cursor.app\" ] && echo \"✅ Cursor: installed\" || echo \"❌ Cursor\"\n    command -v opencode &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ OpenCode: installed\" || echo \"❌ OpenCode\"\n    [ -d \"/Applications/Cherry Studio.app\" ] && echo \"✅ Cherry Studio: installed\" || echo \"❌ Cherry Studio\"\n    [ -d \"/Applications/LM Studio.app\" ] && echo \"✅ LM Studio: installed\" || echo \"❌ LM Studio\"\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Interactive Q&A Flow\n\nUse `AskUserQuestion` tool with structured questions:\n\n```yaml\nquestions:\n  - id: role\n    question: \"What best describes your primary development role?\"\n    options:\n      - label: \"Fullstack Developer\"\n        description: \"React/Vue + Node.js + Database\"\n      - label: \"Frontend Developer\"\n        description: \"React/Vue/Svelte + UI/Design tools\"\n      - label: \"Backend Developer\"\n        description: \"Go/Python/Java + APIs + Infrastructure\"\n      - label: \"Data/ML Engineer\"\n        description: \"Python + Jupyter + ML frameworks\"\n      - label: \"DevOps/Platform\"\n        description: \"K8s + Terraform + CI/CD\"\n\n  - id: languages\n    question: \"Which programming languages do you need?\"\n    multiSelect: true\n    options:\n      - label: \"JavaScript/TypeScript\"\n        description: \"fnm + Node.js LTS + pnpm\"\n      - label: \"Python\"\n        description: \"uv + Python 3.12\"\n      - label: \"Go\"\n        description: \"goenv + latest Go\"\n      - label: \"Rust\"\n        description: \"rustup + stable\"\n\n  - id: containers\n    question: \"Do you need container and Kubernetes tools?\"\n    options:\n      - label: \"Full K8s setup\"\n        description: \"OrbStack + kubectl + helm + k9s + stern\"\n      - label: \"Docker only\"\n        description: \"OrbStack for containers\"\n      - label: \"Skip\"\n        description: \"No container tools\"\n\n  - id: vibe_coding\n    question: \"Which additional Vibe Coding tools do you need?\"\n    multiSelect: true\n    note: \"We assume you already have at least one AI coding tool installed to use this project.\"\n    detection: |\n      command -v claude &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ Claude Code installed\"\n      command -v ccline &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ CCometixLine installed\"\n      [ -d \"/Applications/Cursor.app\" ] && echo \"✅ Cursor installed\"\n      command -v opencode &>/dev/null && echo \"✅ OpenCode installed\"\n      [ -d \"/Applications/Cherry Studio.app\" ] && echo \"✅ Cherry Studio installed\"\n    options:\n      - label: \"Claude Code\"\n        description: \"Anthropic''s official agentic CLI\"\n        skip_if: \"command -v claude &>/dev/null\"\n      - label: \"CCometixLine\"\n        description: \"Claude Code statusline enhancer (Git, model, context)\"\n        skip_if: \"command -v ccline &>/dev/null\"\n        requires: \"Node.js\"\n      - label: \"Cursor\"\n        description: \"AI-first code editor\"\n        skip_if: \"[ -d ''/Applications/Cursor.app'' ]\"\n      - label: \"OpenCode\"\n        description: \"Open-source terminal AI assistant\"\n        skip_if: \"command -v opencode &>/dev/null\"\n      - label: \"Cherry Studio\"\n        description: \"AI desktop client with multi-model support\"\n        skip_if: \"[ -d ''/Applications/Cherry Studio.app'' ]\"\n\n  - id: apps\n    question: \"Which collaboration apps?\"\n    multiSelect: true\n    options:\n      - label: \"Work (CN)\"\n        description: \"Lark + DingTalk + WeCom\"\n      - label: \"International\"\n        description: \"Slack + Discord + WhatsApp\"\n      - label: \"Meetings\"\n        description: \"Tencent Meeting + Zoom\"\n\n  - id: macos\n    question: \"macOS optimizations?\"\n    multiSelect: true\n    options:\n      - label: \"Dock\"\n        description: \"Hide recent apps, faster animations\"\n      - label: \"Keyboard\"\n        description: \"Faster repeat, disable auto-correct\"\n      - label: \"Finder\"\n        description: \"Show hidden files, path bar\"\n      - label: \"Screenshots\"\n        description: \"Save to ~/Pictures/Screenshots\"\n```\n\n### 3. Plan Generation\n\nGenerate structured installation plan based on answers:\n\n```markdown\n## Generated Plan for: [User Name]\n\n### Phase 1: Prerequisites\n- [ ] Xcode Command Line Tools\n- [ ] Homebrew\n\n### Phase 2: CLI Tools\n| Package | Purpose | Command |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| git | Version control | `brew install git` |\n| gh | GitHub CLI | `brew install gh` |\n| delta | Better diffs | `brew install delta` |\n| starship | Modern prompt | `brew install starship` |\n| eza | ls replacement | `brew install eza` |\n| bat | cat replacement | `brew install bat` |\n| fd | find replacement | `brew install fd` |\n| ripgrep | grep replacement | `brew install ripgrep` |\n\n### Phase 3: Language Environments\n| Language | Manager | Setup Command |\n|----------|---------|---------------|\n| Node.js | fnm | `fnm install --lts && fnm default lts-latest` |\n| Python | uv | `uv python install 3.12` |\n| Go | goenv | `goenv install latest && goenv global latest` |\n\n### Phase 4: Applications\n| App | Purpose | Command |\n|-----|---------|---------|\n| Raycast | Launcher + window mgmt | `brew install --cask raycast` |\n| Warp | Modern terminal | `brew install --cask warp` |\n| OrbStack | Docker/K8s | `brew install --cask orbstack` |\n\n### Phase 5: Vibe Coding Tools\n> Note: Skip already installed tools\n\n| Tool | Purpose | Command | Skip If |\n|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| Claude Code | Anthropic agentic CLI | `brew install --cask claude-code` | `command -v claude` |\n| CCometixLine | Claude Code statusline | `npm install -g @cometix/ccline` | `command -v ccline` |\n| Cursor | AI-first code editor | `brew install --cask cursor` | App exists |\n| OpenCode | Open-source terminal AI | `brew install opencode` | `command -v opencode` |\n| Cherry Studio | Multi-model AI client | `brew install --cask cherry-studio` | App exists |\n\n### Phase 6: Fonts\n| Font | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| JetBrains Mono Nerd Font | Terminal icons |\n| Fira Code | Ligatures |\n| Inter | UI font |\n\n### Phase 7: Shell Configuration\n- [ ] Zsh plugins (autosuggestions, syntax-highlighting)\n- [ ] Starship prompt\n- [ ] Modern CLI aliases\n\n### Phase 8: macOS Defaults\n- [ ] Dock optimization\n- [ ] Keyboard settings\n- [ ] Finder preferences\n```\n\n### 4. Execution Engine\n\nExecute plan with progress tracking:\n\n```bash\n# Example execution with progress\nexecute_phase() {\n    local phase=$1\n    echo \"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\"\n    echo \"📦 Phase $phase\"\n    echo \"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\"\n}\n\n# Phase 1: CLI Tools\nexecute_phase \"1: CLI Tools\"\nbrew install git gh delta starship\nbrew install eza bat fd ripgrep sd dust procs bottom\nbrew install tree wget curl jq yq\n\n# Phase 2: Languages\nexecute_phase \"2: Language Environments\"\nbrew install fnm uv goenv go\nfnm install --lts\nfnm default lts-latest\nnpm install -g pnpm\n\n# Phase 3: Apps\nexecute_phase \"3: Applications\"\nbrew install --cask raycast warp orbstack\n\n# Phase 4: Vibe Coding (with skip detection)\nexecute_phase \"4: Vibe Coding Tools\"\n\n# Claude Code\nif ! command -v claude &>/dev/null; then\n    echo \"📦 Installing Claude Code...\"\n    brew install --cask claude-code\nelse\n    echo \"⏭️  Claude Code already installed, skipping\"\nfi\n\n# CCometixLine (requires Node.js)\nif ! command -v ccline &>/dev/null; then\n    if command -v npm &>/dev/null; then\n        echo \"📦 Installing CCometixLine...\"\n        npm install -g @cometix/ccline\n        echo \"💡 Configure: Add to ~/.claude/settings.json:\"\n        echo ''   {\"statusLine\": {\"type\": \"command\", \"command\": \"ccline\"}}''\n    else\n        echo \"⚠️  CCometixLine requires Node.js, install fnm/node first\"\n    fi\nelse\n    echo \"⏭️  CCometixLine already installed, skipping\"\nfi\n\n# Cursor\nif [ ! -d \"/Applications/Cursor.app\" ]; then\n    echo \"📦 Installing Cursor...\"\n    brew install --cask cursor\nelse\n    echo \"⏭️  Cursor already installed, skipping\"\nfi\n\n# OpenCode\nif ! command -v opencode &>/dev/null; then\n    echo \"📦 Installing OpenCode...\"\n    brew install opencode\nelse\n    echo \"⏭️  OpenCode already installed, skipping\"\nfi\n\n# Cherry Studio\nif [ ! -d \"/Applications/Cherry Studio.app\" ]; then\n    echo \"📦 Installing Cherry Studio...\"\n    brew install --cask cherry-studio\nelse\n    echo \"⏭️  Cherry Studio already installed, skipping\"\nfi\n\n# Phase 5: Fonts\nexecute_phase \"5: Fonts\"\nbrew install --cask font-jetbrains-mono-nerd-font\nbrew install --cask font-fira-code font-inter\n\n# Phase 6: Shell\nexecute_phase \"6: Shell Configuration\"\n# Install zsh plugins...\n# Configure starship...\n\n# Phase 7: macOS\nexecute_phase \"7: macOS Optimization\"\ndefaults write com.apple.dock show-recents -bool false\ndefaults write NSGlobalDomain KeyRepeat -int 2\n# ...\n\necho \"✅ Setup complete!\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Presets\n\n### fullstack\n```yaml\nname: Fullstack Developer\nlanguages: [javascript, python]\ncontainers: full\napps: [raycast, warp, cursor, orbstack, notion]\nmacos: [dock, keyboard]\n```\n\n### frontend\n```yaml\nname: Frontend Developer\nlanguages: [javascript]\ncontainers: docker\napps: [raycast, cursor, figma]\nmacos: [dock, keyboard]\n```\n\n### backend\n```yaml\nname: Backend Developer\nlanguages: [go, python]\ncontainers: full\ncloud: [aws]\napps: [raycast, warp, cursor, orbstack]\nmacos: [dock, keyboard, finder]\n```\n\n### data\n```yaml\nname: Data/ML Engineer\nlanguages: [python]\ncontainers: docker\napps: [cursor, jupyter]\nmacos: [keyboard]\n```\n\n### devops\n```yaml\nname: DevOps Engineer\nlanguages: [go, python]\ncontainers: full\ncloud: [aws, gcp]\napps: [raycast, warp, orbstack]\nmacos: [dock, keyboard, finder]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Files\n\nThis skill references:\n- `presets.md` - Detailed preset configurations\n- `packages.md` - Complete package registry\n- `../../scripts/Brewfile` - Homebrew bundle\n- `../../configs/` - Configuration templates\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always detect first** - Never reinstall what exists\n2. **Ask, don''t assume** - User preferences matter\n3. **Show before doing** - Display plan before execution\n4. **Progress tracking** - Use TodoWrite for visibility\n5. **Verify after** - Confirm installations succeeded\n6. **Non-destructive** - Never remove existing tools\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```bash\n# Retry failed installations\nretry_install() {\n    local cmd=$1\n    local max_attempts=3\n    local attempt=1\n\n    while [ $attempt -le $max_attempts ]; do\n        if eval \"$cmd\"; then\n            return 0\n        fi\n        echo \"⚠️  Attempt $attempt failed, retrying...\"\n        ((attempt++))\n        sleep 2\n    done\n\n    echo \"❌ Failed after $max_attempts attempts\"\n    return 1\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Trigger Keywords\n\nThis skill activates on:\n- `/new-macos-setup`\n- \"setup macos\"\n- \"configure mac\"\n- \"new mac setup\"\n- \"dev environment\"\n- \"install development tools\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:59:09.449Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents requiring a streamlined macOS development environment setup with Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker, and Kubernetes.","zh":"非常适合需要简化 macOS 开发环境设置的开发者代理，包括 Homebrew、Zsh、Node.js、Python、Go、Docker 和 Kubernetes。","ja":"macOS 開発環境をストリームライン化したい Developer Agents に最適です。Homebrew、Zsh、Node.js、Python、Go、Docker、Kubernetes が含まれます。","ko":"Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker, Kubernetes가 포함된 macOS 개발 환경 설정을 간소화해야 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren un entorno de desarrollo de macOS optimizado con Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker y Kubernetes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développeur nécessitant un environnement de développement macOS optimisé avec Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker et Kubernetes.","de":"Perfekt für Developer-Agents, die ein optimiertes macOS-Entwicklungsumfeld mit Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker und Kubernetes benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que exigem um ambiente de desenvolvimento macOS simplificado com Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker e Kubernetes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, требующих упрощенной среды разработки macOS с Homebrew, Zsh, Node.js, Python, Go, Docker и Kubernetes.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى بيئة تطوير macOS مبسطة مع Homebrew و Zsh و Node.js و Python و Go و Docker و Kubernetes."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure a comprehensive macOS development environment with tools like Homebrew for package management, Zsh for shell customization, and support for Node.js, Python, and Go programming languages, leveraging Docker and Kubernetes for containerization and orchestration.","zh":"赋予代理配置全面的 macOS 开发环境的能力，包括使用 Homebrew 进行包管理、使用 Zsh 进行 shell 自定义，以及支持 Node.js、Python 和 Go 编程语言，并利用 Docker 和 Kubernetes 进行容器化和编排。","ja":"エージェントが Homebrew を使用したパッケージ管理、Zsh を使用したシェルカスタマイズ、Node.js、Python、Go プログラミング言語のサポートなど、包括的な macOS 開発環境を構成できるようにします。さらに、Docker と Kubernetes を使用したコンテナ化とオーケストレーションも可能です。","ko":"Homebrew를 사용한 패키지 관리, Zsh를 사용한 쉘 사용자 정의, Node.js, Python, Go 프로그래밍 언어 지원 등의 포괄적인 macOS 개발 환경을 구성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다. 또한 Docker와 Kubernetes를 사용한 컨테이너화와 오케스트레이션도 가능합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar un entorno de desarrollo macOS integral con herramientas como Homebrew para la gestión de paquetes, Zsh para la personalización de la shell y soporte para los lenguajes de programación Node.js, Python y Go, aprovechando Docker y Kubernetes para la contenerización y la orquestación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer un environnement de développement macOS complet avec des outils tels que Homebrew pour la gestion des paquets, Zsh pour la personnalisation de la shell et le support des langages de programmation Node.js, Python et Go, en exploitant Docker et Kubernetes pour la conteneurisation et l''orchestration.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, ein umfassendes macOS-Entwicklungsumfeld mit Tools wie Homebrew für das Paketmanagement, Zsh für die Shell-Anpassung und Unterstützung für die Programmiersprachen Node.js, Python und Go zu konfigurieren, indem Docker und Kubernetes für die Containerisierung und Orchestrierung genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes configurem uma ambiente de desenvolvimento macOS abrangente com ferramentas como Homebrew para gerenciamento de pacotes, Zsh para personalização do shell e suporte para linguagens de programação Node.js, Python e Go, utilizando Docker e Kubernetes para contêinerização e orquestração.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настроить комплексную среду разработки macOS с помощью инструментов, таких как Homebrew для управления пакетами, Zsh для настройки оболочки и поддержки языков программирования Node.js, Python и Go, используя Docker и Kubernetes для контейнеризации и оркестровки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تكوين بيئة تطوير macOS شاملة باستخدام أدوات مثل Homebrew لإدارة الحزم و Zsh لتخصيص Shell ودعم لغات البرمجة Node.js و Python و Go، واستخدام Docker و Kubernetes للتحجيم وتحديد الخدمات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating macOS setup for development teams","Configuring Zsh and Homebrew for efficient package management","Deploying Docker and Kubernetes for scalable application development"],"zh":["为开发团队自动化 macOS 设置","配置 Zsh 和 Homebrew 以实现高效的包管理","部署 Docker 和 Kubernetes 以实现可扩展的应用程序开发"],"ja":["開発チームの macOS 設定を自動化する","Zsh と Homebrew を設定して効率的なパッケージ管理を行う","Docker と Kubernetes をデプロイしてスケーラブルなアプリケーション開発を行う"],"ko":["개발 팀을 위한 macOS 설정 자동화","Zsh 및 Homebrew를 사용한 효율적인 패키지 관리 구성","Docker 및 Kubernetes를 사용한 확장 가능한 애플리케이션 개발 배포"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración de macOS para equipos de desarrollo","Configurar Zsh y Homebrew para una gestión de paquetes eficiente","Implementar Docker y Kubernetes para el desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration de macOS pour les équipes de développement","Configurer Zsh et Homebrew pour une gestion de paquets efficace","Déployer Docker et Kubernetes pour le développement d''applications scalables"],"de":["Automatisieren der macOS-Konfiguration für Entwicklungsteams","Konfigurieren von Zsh und Homebrew für ein effizientes Paketmanagement","Bereitstellen von Docker und Kubernetes für die Entwicklung von skalierbaren Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração do macOS para equipes de desenvolvimento","Configurar Zsh e Homebrew para gerenciamento eficiente de pacotes","Implantar Docker e Kubernetes para desenvolvimento de aplicações escaláveis"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку macOS для команд разработки","Настроить Zsh и Homebrew для эффективного управления пакетами","Развернуть Docker и Kubernetes для масштабируемого разработки приложений"],"ar":["أتمتة إعداد macOS لفريق التطوير","تكوين Zsh و Homebrew للإدارة الفعالة للحزم","نشر Docker و Kubernetes لتطوير التطبيقات القابلة للتوسيع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires administrative access to macOS","Dependent on network connectivity for package downloads and installations","Limited to macOS operating system"],"zh":["需要 macOS 的管理员访问权限","依赖网络连接进行包下载和安装","仅限 macOS 操作系统"],"ja":["macOS の管理者アクセスが必要","パッケージのダウンロードとインストールにネットワーク接続が必要","macOS オペレーティングシステムのみ"],"ko":["macOS 관리자 액세스 권한 필요","패키지 다운로드 및 설치를 위해 네트워크 연결 필요","macOS 운영 체제만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso administrativo a macOS","Dependiente de la conectividad de red para las descargas e instalaciones de paquetes","Limitado al sistema operativo macOS"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès administratif à macOS","Dépend de la connectivité réseau pour les téléchargements et les installations de paquets","Limité au système d''exploitation macOS"],"de":["Benötigt administrativen Zugriff auf macOS","Abhängig von der Netzwerkverbindung für Paket-Downloads und -Installationen","Begrenzt auf das macOS-Betriebssystem"],"pt":["Exige acesso administrativo ao macOS","Depende da conectividade de rede para downloads e instalações de pacotes","Limitado ao sistema operacional macOS"],"ru":["Требует административного доступа к macOS","Зависит от сетевого подключения для скачивания и установки пакетов","Ограничен операционной системой macOS"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول الإداري إلى نظام macOS","يعتمد على الاتصال الشبكي لتنزيل الحزم وتثبيتها","محدود بنظام التشغيل macOS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a9b1b2711428ff54612cdfd81a2f2991695cb1bd67cf41e7a22ce7983b752820","qualityScore":45}');
