,"guia de configuração do projeto workflow","melhorias de produtividade com AI Agents"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое управление проектами","инструменты ИИ Агентов","управление проектами vs управление задачами","установка управления проектами","руководство по настройке управления проектами","повышение производительности с помощью ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الإجنت الذكية","ما هو مسار العمل","أدوات الإجنت الذكية","مسار العمل مقابل إدارة المشاريع","تثبيت مسار العمل","دليل إعداد مسار العمل","تحسين الإنتاجية مع أدوات الإجنت الذكية"]}},"owner":"fefogarcia","repo":"approved-skills","repoPath":"fefogarcia/approved-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.761Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-workflow","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Project Workflow Skill\n\n9 integrated slash commands for complete project lifecycle automation: idea validation → planning → execution → session management → context preservation → release.\n\n**Time savings**: 35-55 minutes per project lifecycle\n\n## Installation\n\n**Marketplace**: `/plugin install project-workflow@jezweb-skills`\n\n**Manual**: Copy `commands/*.md` to `~/.claude/commands/`\n\n## The 9 Commands\n\n### 1. `/explore-idea` - Pre-Planning Exploration\n\n**Use when**: Rough idea that needs tech","body":"# Project Workflow Skill\n\n9 integrated slash commands for complete project lifecycle automation: idea validation → planning → execution → session management → context preservation → release.\n\n**Time savings**: 35-55 minutes per project lifecycle\n\n## Installation\n\n**Marketplace**: `/plugin install project-workflow@jezweb-skills`\n\n**Manual**: Copy `commands/*.md` to `~/.claude/commands/`\n\n## The 9 Commands\n\n### 1. `/explore-idea` - Pre-Planning Exploration\n\n**Use when**: Rough idea that needs tech stack validation, scope management, or research before planning.\n\n**Creates**: PROJECT_BRIEF.md with validated decisions → hands off to /plan-project\n\n**Time savings**: 10-15 min\n\n---\n\n### 2. `/plan-project` - Generate Project Planning Docs\n\n**Use when**: Starting new project with clear requirements, or after /explore-idea.\n\n**Creates**: IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, SESSION.md, DATABASE_SCHEMA.md (if needed), API_ENDPOINTS.md (if needed), ARCHITECTURE.md\n\n**Invokes**: project-planning skill\n\n**Time savings**: 5-7 min\n\n---\n\n### 3. `/plan-feature` - Add Features to Existing Projects\n\n**Use when**: Adding feature to existing project with SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md.\n\n**Does**: Generates new phases via project-planning skill, integrates into IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md with renumbering, updates SESSION.md.\n\n**Time savings**: 7-10 min\n\n---\n\n### 4. `/wrap-session` - End-of-Session Checkpoint\n\n**Use when**: Context full (>150k tokens), end of work session, or before task switch.\n\n**Does**: Task agent analyzes session → updates SESSION.md (progress, Next Action, blockers) → git checkpoint commit → formatted handoff summary.\n\n**Time savings**: 2-3 min\n\n---\n\n### 5. `/continue-session` - Start-of-Session Context Loading\n\n**Use when**: Starting new session or after /wrap-session checkpoint.\n\n**Does**: Explore agent loads SESSION.md + planning docs → shows git history + session summary (phase, progress, Next Action, blockers) → optionally opens file → asks permission to continue.\n\n**Time savings**: 1-2 min\n\n---\n\n### 6. `/workflow` - Interactive Workflow Guide\n\n**Use when**: First time user, unsure which command to use, or need quick reference.\n\n**Does**: Shows all 9 commands → context-aware guidance with decision trees → offers to execute appropriate command.\n\n---\n\n### 7. `/release` - Pre-Release Safety Checks\n\n**Use when**: Ready to push to public GitHub or create release.\n\n**8 Phases**:\n1. **Critical Safety** (BLOCKERS): Secrets scan (gitleaks), personal artifacts check, git remote verification\n2. **Documentation** (REQUIRED): LICENSE, README (>100 words), CONTRIBUTING.md (>500 LOC), CODE_OF_CONDUCT (>1000 LOC)\n3. **Configuration**: .gitignore, package.json, git branch warning\n4. **Quality** (NON-BLOCKING): Build test, npm audit, large files (>1MB)\n5. **Report**: Blockers/warnings/recommendations + safe to release verdict\n6-8. **Auto-Fix & Publish**: Fix issues, release prep commit, optional git tag + GitHub release\n\n**Time savings**: 10-15 min\n\n---\n\n### 8. `/brief` - Context Preservation Document\n\n**Use when**: Before clearing context, to preserve key decisions and requirements for future sessions.\n\n**Creates**: `docs/brief-[slug].md` with extracted information from current conversation.\n\n**Does**: Analyzes conversation → extracts what''s being built, decisions made, technical details → creates organized markdown file → optionally creates GitHub issue for tracking.\n\n**Time savings**: 3-5 min\n\n---\n\n### 9. `/reflect` - Capture Operational Knowledge\n\n**Use when**: Before context compaction, after completing significant work, or when valuable learnings accumulated.\n\n**Does**: Reviews conversation → identifies workflows discovered, patterns learned, tool sequences, corrections made → routes each learning to appropriate destination (rules, CLAUDE.md, skills, docs) → optionally suggests automation (scripts, commands, custom agents).\n\n**Key Feature**: Considers whether processes should become custom agents when they require reasoning/decisions, benefit from parallel execution, or involve research/exploration.\n\n**Time savings**: 5-10 min\n\n---\n\n## Workflow Examples\n\n**Full**: /explore-idea → /plan-project → work → /wrap-session → /continue-session → /plan-feature (if needed) → repeat → /reflect → /release\n\n**Quick** (clear requirements): /plan-project → work → /wrap-session → /continue-session → /release\n\n**Context Preservation**: /brief (before clearing context), /reflect (capture learnings)\n\n**Helpers**: /workflow (guidance), /plan-feature (add feature), /release (publish)\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n**project-planning**: Invoked by /plan-project and /plan-feature (generates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, DATABASE_SCHEMA.md, API_ENDPOINTS.md)\n\n**project-session-management**: SESSION.md protocol for /wrap-session and /continue-session\n\n**Claude Code agents**: /wrap-session (Task agent), /continue-session + /explore-idea (Explore agent)\n\n---\n\n## Command Relationships\n\n```\nEXPLORATION PHASE\n/explore-idea (optional)\n    ↓\n    Creates PROJECT_BRIEF.md\n    ↓\nPLANNING PHASE\n/plan-project (reads PROJECT_BRIEF.md if exists)\n    ↓\n    Creates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md + SESSION.md\n    ↓\nEXECUTION PHASE\nWork on phases\n    ↓\n/wrap-session (when context full)\n    ↓\n    Updates SESSION.md, git checkpoint\n    ↓\n/continue-session (new session)\n    ↓\n    Loads SESSION.md, continues work\n    ↓\n/plan-feature (when need new features)\n    ↓\n    Adds phases to IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n    ↓\nContinue wrap → resume cycle\n    ↓\nCONTEXT PRESERVATION\n/brief (before clearing context)\n    ↓\n    Creates docs/brief-[slug].md\n    ↓\n/reflect (capture learnings)\n    ↓\n    Routes knowledge to rules, docs, CLAUDE.md\n    ↓\nRELEASE PHASE\n/release (when ready to publish)\n    ↓\n    Safety checks → GitHub release\n\nHELPER\n/workflow (anytime)\n    ↓\n    Interactive guidance\n```\n\n---\n\n## Time Savings Breakdown\n\n| Command | Time Saved | Tasks Automated |\n|---------|------------|-----------------|\n| `/explore-idea` | 10-15 min | Research, validation, scope management, tech stack evaluation |\n| `/plan-project` | 5-7 min | Planning doc generation, git setup, phase structuring |\n| `/plan-feature` | 7-10 min | Feature planning, phase integration, doc updates |\n| `/wrap-session` | 2-3 min | SESSION.md updates, git checkpoint, handoff summary |\n| `/continue-session` | 1-2 min | Context loading, git history review, next action display |\n| `/workflow` | Instant | Navigation, decision trees, command selection |\n| `/release` | 10-15 min | Secret scanning, doc validation, build testing, release creation |\n| `/brief` | 3-5 min | Context extraction, decisions capture, markdown generation |\n| `/reflect` | 5-10 min | Learning extraction, knowledge routing, automation suggestions |\n\n**Total per project lifecycle:** 45-70 minutes\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**All**: Claude Code CLI, git repo (recommended)\n\n**/plan-feature**: Existing SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n\n**/wrap-session, /continue-session**: SESSION.md (created by /plan-project)\n\n**/release**: Git repo with commits, package.json (Node.js), remote URL (for publishing)\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**/plan-project \"No project description\"**: Use /explore-idea first or discuss project with Claude\n\n**/plan-feature \"Prerequisites not met\"**: Run /plan-project first (creates SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md)\n\n**/wrap-session \"No git repository\"**: Run `git init`\n\n**/continue-session \"SESSION.md not found\"**: Run /plan-project\n\n**/release \"Secrets detected\"**: Add to .gitignore, remove from git history\n\n---\n\n## Version History\n\n**1.1.0** (2026-01-11)\n- Added `/brief` command for context preservation\n- Added `/reflect` command for capturing operational knowledge\n- `/reflect` now suggests custom agents for processes requiring reasoning\n- Total commands: 9\n\n**1.0.0** (2025-11-12)\n- Initial release\n- 7 integrated slash commands\n- Plugin marketplace distribution\n- Command bundling via plugin.json\n\n---\n\n**Issues**: https://github.com/jezweb/claude-skills/issues | **Author**: Jeremy Dawes (jeremy@jezweb.net) | **License**: MIT\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:15:24.386Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, or LangChain needing streamlined project lifecycle automation and workflow management","zh":"非常适合需要简化项目生命周期自动化和工作流管理的AI代理，如Claude、AutoGPT或LangChain","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、またはLangChainのようなプロジェクトライフサイクル自動化とワークフローマネジメントをストリームライン化する必要があるAIエージェントに最適","ko":"프로젝트 생명 주기 자동화 및 워크플ロー 관리를 간소화해야 하는 Claude, AutoGPT 또는 LangChain과 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT o LangChain que necesitan una automatización y gestión de ciclo de vida de proyectos optimizadas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude, AutoGPT ou LangChain nécessitant une automatisation et une gestion de cycle de vie de projet rationalisées","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT oder LangChain, die eine optimierte Projekt-Lebenszyklus-Automatisierung und -Verwaltung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT ou LangChain que necessitam de automação de ciclo de vida de projeto e gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho otimizados","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT или LangChain, которым необходима оптимизированная автоматизация жизненного цикла проекта и управление рабочим процессом","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude، AutoGPT أو LangChain الذي يحتاج إلى تسهيل دورة حياة المشروع وتدفق العمل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate the entire project lifecycle, from idea validation to release, using 9 integrated slash commands, saving 35-55 minutes per project and enhancing collaboration through features like session management and context preservation","zh":"赋予代理自动化整个项目生命周期的能力，从想法验证到发布，使用9个集成的斜杠命令，每个项目节省35-55分钟，通过会话管理和上下文保留等功能增强协作","ja":"アイデアの検証からリリースまで、9つの統合スラッシュコマンドを使用してエージェントがプロジェクトのライフサイクルを自動化できるようにし、セッション管理やコンテキストの保存などの機能を通じて、プロジェクトごとに35〜55分を節約し、コラボレーションを強化","ko":"아이디어 검증에서 출시까지 9개의 통합 슬래시 명령을 사용하여 에이전트가 프로젝트 라이프사이클을 자동화할 수 있도록 하여 각 프로젝트당 35〜55분을 절약하고, 세션 관리 및 컨텍스트 보존 등의 기능을 통해 협력을 강화","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar todo el ciclo de vida del proyecto, desde la validación de ideas hasta la publicación, utilizando 9 comandos integrados de barra, ahorrando 35-55 minutos por proyecto y mejorando la colaboración a través de características como la gestión de sesiones y la preservación de contexto","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser l''ensemble du cycle de vie du projet, de la validation des idées à la publication, en utilisant 9 commandes intégrées de barre, en économisant 35-55 minutes par projet et en améliorant la collaboration grâce à des fonctionnalités telles que la gestion de sessions et la préservation de contexte","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, den gesamten Projekt-Lebenszyklus zu automatisieren, von der Ideenvalidierung bis zur Veröffentlichung, mit 9 integrierten Schrägstrichbefehlen, und spart 35-55 Minuten pro Projekt, während die Zusammenarbeit durch Funktionen wie Sitzungsverwaltung und Kontexterhaltung verbessert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar todo o ciclo de vida do projeto, desde a validação da ideia até a liberação, usando 9 comandos de barra integrados, economizando 35-55 minutos por projeto e aprimorando a colaboração por meio de recursos como gerenciamento de sessão e preservação de contexto","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать весь жизненный цикл проекта, от проверки идеи до выпуска, используя 9 интегрированных команд с косой чертой, экономя 35-55 минут на проект и улучшая сотрудничество за счет функций, таких как управление сеансами и сохранение контекста","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توفير تسهيل كامل لدورة حياة المشروع، من التحقق من الفكرة إلى الإصدار، باستخدام 9 أوامر منقطة متكاملة، واقتصاد 35-55 دقيقة لكل مشروع وتحسين التعاون من خلال ميزات مثل إدارة الجلسة والحفاظ على السياق"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project planning and execution","Managing project sessions and preserving context","Validating ideas and planning projects with integrated slash commands"],"zh":["自动化项目规划和执行","管理项目会话和保留上下文","使用集成的斜杠命令验证想法和规划项目"],"ja":["プロジェクト計画と実行の自動化","プロジェクトセッションの管理とコンテキストの保存","統合スラッシュコマンドを使用したアイデアの検証とプロジェクト計画"],"ko":["프로젝트 계획 및 실행 자동화","프로젝트 세션 관리 및 컨텍스트 보존","통합 슬래시 명령을 사용한 아이디어 검증 및 프로젝트 계획"],"es":["Automatizar la planificación y ejecución de proyectos","Gestionar sesiones de proyecto y preservar el contexto","Validar ideas y planificar proyectos con comandos integrados de barra"],"fr":["Automatiser la planification et l''exécution de projets","Gérer les sessions de projet et préserver le contexte","Valider les idées et planifier les projets avec des commandes intégrées de barre"],"de":["Automatisieren der Projektplanung und -ausführung","Verwalten von Projektsitzungen und Erhalt des Kontexts","Validieren von Ideen und Planen von Projekten mit integrierten Schrägstrichbefehlen"],"pt":["Automatizar planejamento e execução de projetos","Gerenciar sessões de projeto e preservar contexto","Validar ideias e planejar projetos com comandos de barra integrados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование и выполнение проектов","Управлять проектными сессиями и сохранять контекст","Проверять идеи и планировать проекты с интегрированными командами с косой чертой"],"ar":["تسهيل تخطيط المشروع وتطبيقه","إدارة جلسات المشروع والحفاظ على السياق","التحقق من الأفكار وتخطيط المشاريع باستخدام أوامر منقطة متكاملة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation via marketplace or manual command installation","Compatibility with specific agent environments like Claude or LangChain may vary"],"zh":["需要通过市场安装或手动命令安装","与特定代理环境（如Claude或LangChain）兼容性可能会有所不同"],"ja":["マーケットプレイス経由または手動コマンドインストールが必要","ClaudeまたはLangChainのような特定のエージェント環境との互換性は異なる場合がある"],"ko":["마켓플레이스 또는 수동 명령 설치가 필요","특정 에이전트 환경(Claude 또는 LangChain 등)과 호환성은 다를 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere instalación a través del marketplace o instalación de comandos manuales","La compatibilidad con entornos de agentes específicos como Claude o LangChain puede variar"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation via le marketplace ou une installation de commandes manuelles","La compatibilité avec des environnements d''agents spécifiques comme Claude ou LangChain peut varier"],"de":["Erfordert Installation über den Marketplace oder manuelle Befehlsinstallation","Die Kompatibilität mit bestimmten Agenten-Umgebungen wie Claude oder LangChain kann variieren"],"pt":["Requer instalação via marketplace ou instalação de comando manual","Compatibilidade com ambientes de agente específicos, como Claude ou LangChain, pode variar"],"ru":["Требует установки через marketplace или ручной установки команды","Совместимость с конкретными средами агентов, такими как Claude или LangChain, может варьироваться"],"ar":["يتطلب التثبيت عبر سوق التطبيقات أو تثبيت الأمر اليدوي","قد تختلف متطلبات التوافق مع بيئات وكلاء معينة، مثل Claude أو LangChain"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fccd42a49848b65d2902f2c5361f5d6df35e8f3576742d0df7874ef4b1fda9ff","qualityScore":45}');
