-gate-check设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ghm-gate-check","コンテキストエンジニアリング","進歩的なドキュメント","AI駆動の製品","ghm-gate-checkの使い方","ghm-gate-checkのインストール","ghm-gate-checkの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","ghm-gate-check","컨텍스트 엔지니어링","渐进式 文档","AI 기반 제품","ghm-gate-check 사용법","ghm-gate-check 설치","ghm-gate-check 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","ingeniería de contexto","desarrollo de productos con IA","documentación progresiva","flujos de trabajo de desarrollo","ghm-gate-check alternativa","ghm-gate-check vs otros herramientas de AI","cómo usar ghm-gate-check","guía de instalación de ghm-gate-check","configuración de ghm-gate-check"],"fr":["outils d''IA","ingénierie de contexte","développement de produits avec l''IA","documentation progressive","flux de travail de développement","ghm-gate-check alternative","ghm-gate-check vs autres outils d''IA","comment utiliser ghm-gate-check","guide d''installation de ghm-gate-check","configuration de ghm-gate-check"],"de":["KI-Tools","Kontext-Engineering","Entwicklung von KI-Produkten","fortschrittliche Dokumentation","Entwicklungsworkflows","ghm-gate-check Alternative","ghm-gate-check vs andere KI-Tools","wie man ghm-gate-check verwendet","Installationsanleitung für ghm-gate-check","Konfiguration von ghm-gate-check"],"pt":["como usar ghm-gate-check","o que é ghm-gate-check","alternativas ao ghm-gate-check","ghm-gate-check vs outros produtos de IA","instalar ghm-gate-check","guia de configuração do ghm-gate-check","desenvolvimento de produtos de IA","engenharia de contexto"],"ru":["как использовать ghm-gate-check","что такое ghm-gate-check","альтернативы ghm-gate-check","ghm-gate-check vs другие продукты ИИ","установка ghm-gate-check","руководство по настройке ghm-gate-check","разработка продуктов ИИ","контекстная инженерия"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ghm-gate-check","ما هو ghm-gate-check","بديلات ghm-gate-check","ghm-gate-check مقابل منتجات الإي آي الأخرى","تثبيت ghm-gate-check","دليل إعداد ghm-gate-check","تطوير منتجات الإي آي","هندسة السياق"]}},"owner":"mattgierhart","repo":"PRD-driven-context-engineering","repoPath":"mattgierhart/PRD-driven-context-engineering","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.770Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ghm-gate-check","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Gate Check\n\nValidate all gate criteria are met before advancing the PRD lifecycle version.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n1. **Load Gate Criteria** → Read target gate requirements from PRD.md\n2. **Verify Evidence** → Check required artifacts exist with valid IDs\n3. **Assess Readiness** → Evaluate handoff requirements\n4. **Report** → Pass/Block with specific gaps\n\n## Core Output Template\n\n| Element | Definition | Evidence |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **Target Gate** | Version being validated","body":"# Gate Check\n\nValidate all gate criteria are met before advancing the PRD lifecycle version.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n1. **Load Gate Criteria** → Read target gate requirements from PRD.md\n2. **Verify Evidence** → Check required artifacts exist with valid IDs\n3. **Assess Readiness** → Evaluate handoff requirements\n4. **Report** → Pass/Block with specific gaps\n\n## Core Output Template\n\n| Element | Definition | Evidence |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **Target Gate** | Version being validated | `v0.3 → v0.4` |\n| **Status** | Pass or Block | Clear determination |\n| **Missing Artifacts** | What''s not complete | Specific list with IDs |\n| **Recommendation** | Action to take | Proceed / Address gaps |\n\n## Gate Reference\n\n| Gate | Focus | Key Artifacts |\n|------|-------|---------------|\n| v0.1 → v0.2 | Problem validated | CFD-XXX evidence |\n| v0.2 → v0.3 | Market defined | Segment definitions |\n| v0.3 → v0.4 | Commercial viable | BR-XXX, pricing |\n| v0.4 → v0.5 | Journeys mapped | UJ-XXX complete |\n| v0.5 → v0.6 | Risks addressed | Risk register |\n| v0.6 → v0.7 | Architecture set | API-XXX, schemas |\n| v0.7 → v0.8 | Build complete | Tests passing |\n| v0.8 → v0.9 | Deployed | Live environment |\n| v0.9 → v1.0 | Launched | Metrics tracking |\n\n## Step 1: Load Gate Criteria\n\n1. Read PRD.md gate section for target version\n2. Extract all required criteria\n3. Identify artifact types needed (BR, UJ, API, CFD)\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] Target gate identified\n- [ ] All criteria extracted\n- [ ] Required artifact types listed\n\n## Step 2: Verify Evidence\n\nFor each required criterion:\n\n1. Check artifact exists in SoT/\n2. Verify artifact status is not \"Draft\"\n3. Confirm cross-references are valid\n4. Check for required CFD-XXX evidence\n\n### Evidence Matrix\n\n| Criterion Type | Verification |\n|----------------|--------------|\n| Business Rule | BR-XXX exists, status Active |\n| User Journey | UJ-XXX exists, all steps defined |\n| API Contract | API-XXX exists, endpoints specified |\n| Customer Evidence | CFD-XXX linked to BR-XXX |\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] All required BR-XXX verified\n- [ ] All required UJ-XXX verified\n- [ ] All required API-XXX verified\n- [ ] Evidence chain (CFD → BR) validated\n\n## Step 3: Assess Handoff Readiness\n\nCheck downstream requirements:\n\n1. Next agent has context needed\n2. No open blockers in current EPIC\n3. Documentation is current\n\n### Checklist\n- [ ] EPIC Session State section has no blockers\n- [ ] README.md is synchronized\n- [ ] Handoff documentation exists\n\n## Step 4: Generate Report\n\n```markdown\n## Gate Check Report: v0.X → v0.Y\n\n**Status**: [PASS / BLOCK]\n**Date**: YYYY-MM-DD\n\n### Criteria Assessment\n\n| Criterion | Status | Evidence |\n|-----------|--------|----------|\n| [Criterion 1] | ✅/❌ | [ID or gap] |\n| [Criterion 2] | ✅/❌ | [ID or gap] |\n\n### Missing Artifacts\n- [ ] [Specific gap with required action]\n\n### Recommendation\n[Proceed to v0.Y / Address [N] gaps before advancing]\n```\n\n## Quality Gates\n\n### Pass Checklist\n- [ ] All criteria evaluated (none skipped)\n- [ ] Evidence is traceable to IDs\n- [ ] Recommendation is actionable\n\n### Testability Check\n- [ ] Report can be validated against PRD.md criteria\n- [ ] Missing artifacts are specific and findable\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Example | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| Skipping criteria | \"Probably fine\" | → Verify each explicitly |\n| Vague gaps | \"Needs more work\" | → Cite specific missing ID |\n| Override blocks | Advancing despite fails | → Address gaps first |\n\n## Boundaries\n\n**DO**:\n- Validate against documented criteria\n- Identify specific gaps\n- Provide actionable recommendations\n\n**DON''T**:\n- Create missing artifacts (just report)\n- Override gate blocks\n- Make subjective quality judgments\n\n## Handoff\n\nAfter gate check:\n- If PASS: Advance PRD version, trigger `ghm-status-sync`\n- If BLOCK: Return to current stage, address gaps\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:20:31.792Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Product Development Agents requiring structured PRD lifecycle management and gate criteria validation","zh":"适用于需要结构化PRD生命周期管理和门槛标准验证的产品开发代理","ja":"PRDライフサイクル管理とゲート基準の検証が必要な製品開発エージェントに適しています","ko":"구조화된 PRD 생명주기 관리 및 게이트 기준 검증이 필요한 제품 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo de Productos que requieren una gestión de ciclo de vida de PRD estructurada y validación de criterios de puerta","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement de Produits nécessitant une gestion du cycle de vie de PRD structurée et une validation des critères de passerelle","de":"Ideal für Produktentwicklungsagenten, die eine strukturierte PRD-Lebenszyklusverwaltung und eine Gate-Kriterien-Validierung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Produto que requerem gerenciamento de ciclo de vida de PRD estruturado e validação de critérios de gate","ru":"Идеально для агентов по разработке продуктов, требующих структурированного управления циклом жизни PRD и проверки критериев шлюза","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير المنتج الذين يتطلبون إدارة دورة حياة PRD المنظمة و التحقق من معايير البوابة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically validate gate criteria using PRD-driven context engineering, ensuring all required artifacts and handoff requirements are met before advancing the PRD lifecycle version, leveraging Markdown files like PRD.md for target gate requirements","zh":"赋予代理人使用PRD驱动的上下文工程系统地验证门槛标准，确保所有必要的文档和交接要求在推进PRD生命周期版本之前得到满足，利用Markdown文件如PRD.md来记录目标门槛要求","ja":"エージェントがPRD駆動のコンテキストエンジニアリングを使用してシステム的にゲート基準を検証できるようにし、PRDライフサイクルバージョンを進める前に必要な成果物とハンドオフ要件がすべて満たされていることを保証する、PRD.mdなどのMarkdownファイルを使用してターゲットゲート要件を記述する","ko":"에이전트가 PRD 驱动의 컨텍스트 엔지니어링을 사용하여 체계적으로 게이트 기준을 검증할 수 있도록 하여, PRD 생명주기 버전을 진행하기 전에 필요한 아티팩트와 핸드오버 요구 사항이 모두 충족되는 것을 보장하며, PRD.md와 같은 Markdown 파일을 사용하여 대상 게이트 요구 사항을 기록합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar sistemáticamente los criterios de puerta utilizando la ingeniería de contexto impulsada por PRD, garantizando que se cumplan todos los artefactos y requisitos de entrega necesarios antes de avanzar en la versión del ciclo de vida de PRD, utilizando archivos Markdown como PRD.md para los requisitos de puerta objetivo, utilizando React, Python, CLI, API y otros frameworks","fr":"Habilite les agents à valider systématiquement les critères de passerelle en utilisant l''ingénierie de contexte pilotée par PRD, en garantissant que tous les artefacts et les exigences de remise nécessaires soient satisfaits avant de faire progresser la version du cycle de vie de PRD, en utilisant des fichiers Markdown comme PRD.md pour les exigences de passerelle cible, en utilisant React, Python, CLI, API et d''autres frameworks","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Gate-Kriterien systematisch unter Verwendung der durch PRD angetriebenen Kontextingenieurwissenschaft zu validieren, um sicherzustellen, dass alle erforderlichen Artefakte und Übergabeanforderungen vor dem Vorankommen der PRD-Lebenszyklusversion erfüllt sind, unter Verwendung von Markdown-Dateien wie PRD.md für die Ziel-Gate-Anforderungen, unter Verwendung von React, Python, CLI, API und anderen Frameworks","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar sistematicamente os critérios de gate usando engenharia de contexto impulsionada por PRD, garantindo que todos os artefatos necessários e requisitos de handoff sejam atendidos antes de avançar com a versão do ciclo de vida do PRD, utilizando arquivos Markdown como PRD.md para requisitos de gate de destino","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически проверять критерии шлюза с помощью контекстной инженерии, управляемой PRD, обеспечивая выполнение всех необходимых артефактов и требований к передаче перед продвижением версии цикла жизни PRD, используя файлы Markdown, такие как PRD.md, для целевых требований шлюза","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق المنهجي من معايير البوابة باستخدام هندسة السياق التي تعمل بالPRD، مع đảmين أن جميع الملفات المطلوبة ومتطلبات التسليم تتم قبل التقدم إلى نسخة دورة حياة PRD، باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل PRD.md لمتطلبات بوابة الهدف"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating gate criteria for PRD lifecycle advancement","Automating evidence verification for required artifacts","Assessing readiness for handoff requirements"],"zh":["验证PRD生命周期推进的门槛标准","自动化验证必要的文档","评估交接要求的准备情况"],"ja":["PRDライフサイクル進捗のゲート基準の検証","必要な成果物の証拠の自動検証","ハンドオフ要件の準備状況の評価"],"ko":["PRD 생명주기 진행의 게이트 기준 검증","필요한 아티팩트의 증거 자동 검증","핸드오버 요구 사항의 준비 상황 평가"],"es":["Validar los criterios de puerta para el avance del ciclo de vida de PRD","Automatizar la verificación de evidencia para los artefactos necesarios","Evaluar la preparación para los requisitos de entrega"],"fr":["Valider les critères de passerelle pour la progression du cycle de vie de PRD","Automatiser la vérification des preuves pour les artefacts nécessaires","Évaluer la préparation des exigences de remise"],"de":["Validieren der Gate-Kriterien für die Fortschritte im PRD-Lebenszyklus","Automatisieren der Beweisüberprüfung für die erforderlichen Artefakte","Bewerten der Bereitschaft für die Übergabeanforderungen"],"pt":["Validar critérios de gate para avanço do ciclo de vida do PRD","Automatizar verificação de evidências para artefatos necessários","Avaliar prontidão para requisitos de handoff"],"ru":["Проверка критериев шлюза для продвижения цикла жизни PRD","Автоматизация проверки доказательств для необходимых артефактов","Оценка готовности к требованиям к передаче"],"ar":["التحقق من معايير البوابة للتقدم بدورة حياة PRD","تأتمة التحقق من الأدلة للملفات المطلوبة","تقييم الجاهزية لمتطلبات التسليم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to PRD.md files","Limited to PRD-driven development workflows"],"zh":["需要访问PRD.md文件","仅限PRD驱动的开发工作流"],"ja":["PRD.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","PRD駆動の開発ワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["PRD.md 파일에 접근할 수 있는 권한이 필요","PRD 驱动의 개발 워크플로우에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos PRD.md","Limitado a flujos de trabajo de desarrollo impulsados por PRD"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux fichiers PRD.md","Limité aux flux de travail de développement pilotés par PRD"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf PRD.md-Dateien","Begrenzt auf PRD-getriebene Entwicklungsläufe"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos PRD.md","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento impulsionados por PRD"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам PRD.md","Ограничен рабочими процессами разработки, управляемыми PRD"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات PRD.md","محدود بتدفقات العمل التطويرية التي تعمل بالPRD"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a4f2f571a18da68b322e3e5b314158946ae8127be8c3bf45739314dac8a3e135","qualityScore":45}');
