quipe","Configuration simple et personnalisable"],"de":["Schnellstart mit uniapp und vite","Unterstützung für vue3 und typescript","Integration mit uview-plus und unocss","Für die Teamzusammenarbeit konzipiert","Einfache und anpassbare Konfiguration"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento rápido com uniapp e vite","Suporte a vue3 e typescript","Integração com uview-plus e unocss","Modelo de desenvolvimento para equipes","Fácil de usar e personalizar"],"ru":["Быстрая разработка с uniapp и vite","Поддержка vue3 и typescript","Интеграция с uview-plus и unocss","Шаблон для разработки для команд","Легко использовать и настраивать"],"ar":["التطوير السريع مع uniapp و vite","دعم vue3 و typescript","التكامل مع uview-plus و unocss","نموذج التطوير للفرق","سهل الاستخدام والتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["antfu","AI智能开发模板","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","unocss","快速开发","团队协作"],"ja":["antfu","AIエージェント","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","unocss","高速開発","チームコラボレーション"],"ko":["antfu","AI 에이전트","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","unocss","빠른 개발","팀 협업"],"es":["herramientas de desarrollo rápido","antfu vs otros frameworks","cómo usar antfu","instalación de antfu","guias de configuración de antfu","desarrollo de aplicaciones con uniapp","vite y vue3","uview-plus y unocss"],"fr":["outils de développement rapide","antfu vs autres frameworks","comment utiliser antfu","installation d''antfu","guides de configuration d''antfu","développement d''applications avec uniapp","vite et vue3","uview-plus et unocss"],"de":["Tools für den Schnellstart","antfu vs andere Frameworks","wie man antfu verwendet","Installation von antfu","Konfigurationsanleitungen für antfu","Anwendungsentwicklung mit uniapp","vite und vue3","uview-plus und unocss"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento rápido","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","unocss","como usar antfu","o que é antfu"],"ru":["инструменты ии","быстрая разработка","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","unocss","как использовать antfu","что такое antfu"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التطوير السريع","uniapp","vite","vue3","typescript","uview-plus","unocss","كيفية استخدام antfu","ما هو antfu"]}},"owner":"oyjt","repo":"uniapp-vue3-template","repoPath":"oyjt/uniapp-vue3-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.802Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"antfu","description":"Anthony Fus {Opinionated} preferences and best practices for web development","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePres","body":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePress (in `docs/`) |\n\n---\n\n## Core Stack\n\n### Package Manager (pnpm)\n\nUse pnpm as the package manager.\n\nFor monorepo setups, use pnpm workspaces:\n\n```yaml\n# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - ''packages/*''\n```\n\n\nUse pnpm named catalogs in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` to manage dependency versions:\n\n| Catalog | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `prod` | Production dependencies |\n| `inlined` | Dependencies inlined by bundler |\n| `dev` | Development tools (linter, bundler, testing, dev-server) |\n| `frontend` | Frontend libraries bundled into frontend |\n\nCatalog names are not limited to the above and can be adjusted based on needs. Avoid using default catalog.\n\n#### @antfu/ni\n\nUse `@antfu/ni` for unified package manager commands. It auto-detects the package manager (pnpm/npm/yarn/bun) based on lockfile.\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `ni` | Install dependencies |\n| `ni <pkg>` | Add dependency |\n| `ni -D <pkg>` | Add dev dependency |\n| `nr <script>` | Run script |\n| `nu` | Upgrade dependencies |\n| `nun <pkg>` | Uninstall dependency |\n| `nci` | Clean install (like `pnpm i --frozen-lockfile`) |\n| `nlx <pkg>` | Execute package (like `npx`) |\n\nInstall globally with `pnpm i -g @antfu/ni` if the commands are not found.\n\n### TypeScript (Strict Mode)\n\nAlways use TypeScript with strict mode enabled.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ESM (ECMAScript Modules)\n\nAlways work in ESM mode. Set `\"type\": \"module\"` in `package.json`.\n\n---\n\n## Code Quality\n\n### ESLint (@antfu/eslint-config)\n\nUse `@antfu/eslint-config` for both formatting and linting. This eliminates the need for Prettier.\n\nCreate `eslint.config.js` with `// @ts-check` comment:\n\n```js\n// @ts-check\nimport antfu from ''@antfu/eslint-config''\n\nexport default antfu()\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWhen getting linting errors, try to fix them with `nr lint --fix`. Don''t add `lint:fix` script.\n\n### Git Hooks (simple-git-hooks + lint-staged)\n\nUse `simple-git-hooks` with `lint-staged` for pre-commit linting:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"simple-git-hooks\": {\n    \"pre-commit\": \"pnpm i --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts --offline && npx lint-staged\"\n  },\n  \"lint-staged\": {\n    \"*\": \"eslint --fix\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"prepare\": \"npx simple-git-hooks\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Unit Testing (Vitest)\n\nUse Vitest for unit testing.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"vitest\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Conventions:**\n\n- Place test files next to source files: `foo.ts` → `foo.test.ts` (same directory)\n- High-level tests go in `tests/` directory in each package\n- Use `describe` and `it` API (not `test`)\n- Use `expect` API for assertions\n- Use `assert` only for TypeScript null assertions\n- Use `toMatchSnapshot` for complex output assertions\n- Use `toMatchFileSnapshot` with explicit file path and extension for language-specific output (exclude those files from linting)\n\n---\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Publishing (Library Projects)\n\nFor library projects, publish through GitHub Releases triggered by `bumpp`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"release\": \"bumpp -r\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Documentation (VitePress)\n\nUse VitePress for documentation. Place docs under `docs/` directory.\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── .vitepress/\n│   └── config.ts\n├── index.md\n└── guide/\n    └── getting-started.md\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"docs:dev\": \"vitepress dev docs\",\n    \"docs:build\": \"vitepress build docs\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n### Project Setup\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| @antfu/eslint-config | ESLint flat config for formatting and linting | [antfu-eslint-config](references/antfu-eslint-config.md) |\n| GitHub Actions | Preferred workflows using sxzz/workflows | [github-actions](references/github-actions.md) |\n| .gitignore | Preferred .gitignore for JS/TS projects | [gitignore](references/gitignore.md) |\n| VS Code Extensions | Recommended extensions for development | [vscode-extensions](references/vscode-extensions.md) |\n\n### Development\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| App Development | Preferences for Vue/Vite/Nuxt/UnoCSS web applications | [app-development](references/app-development.md) |\n| Library Development | Preferences for bundling and publishing TypeScript libraries | [library-development](references/library-development.md) |\n| Monorepo | pnpm workspaces, centralized alias, Turborepo | [monorepo](references/monorepo.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:30:18.672Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing robust web development setup with uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript, and unocss","zh":"适合需要强大的Web开发设置的全栈代理，包括uniapp、vite、vue3、typescript和unocss","ja":"フルスタックエージェントが堅牢なWeb開発設定を必要とする場合に最適で、uniapp、vite、vue3、typescript、unocssを使用","ko":"강력한 웹 개발 설정이 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에게 적합하며, uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript, unocss를 사용","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Full Stack que necesitan una configuración de desarrollo web robusta con uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript y unocss","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui ont besoin d''une configuration de développement web robuste avec uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript et unocss","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine robuste Webentwicklungsumgebung mit uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript und unocss benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de uma configuração de desenvolvimento web robusta com uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript e unocss","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым требуется надежная настройка веб-разработки с uniapp, vite, vue3, typescript и unocss","ar":"مثالي لعميل كامل الحزمة الذي يحتاج إلى إعداد تطوير ويب قوي مع uniapp، vite، vue3، typescript و unocss"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop scalable web applications using TypeScript in strict mode, with ESM module system, and @antfu/eslint-config for linti