patibilidad con herramientas de IA","Fácil instalación y configuración"],"fr":["Ouvre des fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc dans Marked 2","Intégration avec VS Code","Édition avancée de documents","Compatibilité avec des outils d''IA","Installation et configuration faciles"],"de":["Öffnet Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien in Marked 2","Integration mit VS Code","Erweiterte Dokumentenbearbeitung","Kompatibilität mit KI-Tools","Einfache Installation und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Abre arquivos Markdown em Marked 2","Suporta arquivos AsciiDoc","Integração com o VS Code","Melhora a produtividade dos desenvolvedores","Fácil de instalar e configurar"],"ru":["Открывает файлы Markdown в Marked 2","Поддерживает файлы AsciiDoc","Интеграция с VS Code","Улучшает производительность разработчиков","Легко установить и настроить"],"ar":["فتح ملفات Markdown في Marked 2","دعم ملفات AsciiDoc","التكامل مع VS Code","تحسين إنتاجية المطورين","سهل التثبيت والتهيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用openspec-new-change","什么是openspec-new-change","openspec-new-change安装","VS Code扩展","Marked 2","Markdown编辑器","AsciiDoc编辑器","开发工具"],"ja":["openspec-new-changeの使い方","openspec-new-changeとは","openspec-new-changeのインストール","VS Code拡張機能","Marked 2","Markdownエディター","AsciiDocエディター","開発ツール"],"ko":["openspec-new-change 사용법","openspec-new-change란","openspec-new-change 설치","VS Code 확장 기능","Marked 2","마크다운 편집기","AsciiDoc 편집기","개발 도구"],"es":["herramientas de ia para desarrolladores","cómo usar openspec-new-change","alternativas a marked 2","instalación de openspec-new-change","guía de configuración de openspec-new-change","mejores herramientas de ia para vscode","openspec-new-change vs marked 2","tutorial de openspec-new-change"],"fr":["outils d''ia pour développeurs","comment utiliser openspec-new-change","alternatives à marked 2","installation d''openspec-new-change","guide de configuration d''openspec-new-change","meilleurs outils d''ia pour vscode","openspec-new-change vs marked 2","tutoriel d''openspec-new-change"],"de":["ki-tools für entwickler","wie man openspec-new-change verwendet","alternativen zu marked 2","installation von openspec-new-change","konfigurationsanleitung für openspec-new-change","beste ki-tools für vscode","openspec-new-change vs marked 2","tutorial für openspec-new-change"],"pt":["como usar openspec-new-change","o que é openspec-new-change","alternativa para Marked 2","instalar openspec-new-change","guia de setup do openspec-new-change","ferramentas de desenvolvimento para VS Code"],"ru":["как использовать openspec-new-change","что такое openspec-new-change","альтернатива для Marked 2","установить openspec-new-change","руководство по настройке openspec-new-change","инструментальные средства разработки для VS Code"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام openspec-new-change","ما هي openspec-new-change","بديل ل Marked 2","تثبيت openspec-new-change","دليل إعداد openspec-new-change","أدوات التطوير ل VS Code"]}},"owner":"gAmUssA","repo":"vscode-open-in-marked2","repoPath":"gAmUssA/vscode-open-in-marked2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.813Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-new-change","description":"Start a new OpenSpec change using the experimental artifact workflow. Use when the user wants to create a new feature, fix, or modification with a structured step-by-step approach.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentic","body":"Start a new change using the experimental artifact-driven approach.\n\n**Input**: The user''s request should include a change name (kebab-case) OR a description of what they want to build.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no clear input provided, ask what they want to build**\n\n   Use the **AskUserQuestion tool** (open-ended, no preset options) to ask:\n   > \"What change do you want to work on? Describe what you want to build or fix.\"\n\n   From their description, derive a kebab-case name (e.g., \"add user authentication\" → `add-user-auth`).\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT proceed without understanding what the user wants to build.\n\n2. **Determine the workflow schema**\n\n   Use the default schema (omit `--schema`) unless the user explicitly requests a different workflow.\n\n   **Use a different schema only if the user mentions:**\n   - A specific schema name → use `--schema <name>`\n   - \"show workflows\" or \"what workflows\" → run `openspec schemas --json` and let them choose\n\n   **Otherwise**: Omit `--schema` to use the default.\n\n3. **Create the change directory**\n   ```bash\n   openspec new change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   Add `--schema <name>` only if the user requested a specific workflow.\n   This creates a scaffolded change at `openspec/changes/<name>/` with the selected schema.\n\n4. **Show the artifact status**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This shows which artifacts need to be created and which are ready (dependencies satisfied).\n\n5. **Get instructions for the first artifact**\n   The first artifact depends on the schema (e.g., `proposal` for spec-driven).\n   Check the status output to find the first artifact with status \"ready\".\n   ```bash\n   openspec instructions <first-artifact-id> --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n   This outputs the template and context for creating the first artifact.\n\n6. **STOP and wait for user direction**\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter completing the steps, summarize:\n- Change name and location\n- Schema/workflow being used and its artifact sequence\n- Current status (0/N artifacts complete)\n- The template for the first artifact\n- Prompt: \"Ready to create the first artifact? Just describe what this change is about and I''ll draft it, or ask me to continue.\"\n\n**Guardrails**\n- Do NOT create any artifacts yet - just show the instructions\n- Do NOT advance beyond showing the first artifact template\n- If the name is invalid (not kebab-case), ask for a valid name\n- If a change with that name already exists, suggest continuing that change instead\n- Pass --schema if using a non-default workflow\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:34:37.121Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents requiring seamless Markdown and AsciiDoc file handling in VS Code with Marked 2 integration.","zh":"适用于需要在VS Code中使用Marked 2集成实现Markdown和AsciiDoc文件无缝处理的开发者代理。","ja":"VS CodeでMarked 2を統合してMarkdownとAsciiDocファイルを無撞着に処理する必要があるデベロッパー エージェントに最適です。","ko":"VS Code에서 Marked 2를 통합하여 Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일을 무리없이 처리해야 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren un manejo sin problemas de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc en VS Code con integración de Marked 2.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion sans problème de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc dans VS Code avec intégration de Marked 2.","de":"Ideal für Entwickleragenten, die ein nahtloses Handling von Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien in VS Code mit Marked 2-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que requerem manipulação de arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc sem problemas no VS Code com integração do Marked 2.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-разработчиков, требующих бесшовного xử lý файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc в VS Code с интеграцией Marked 2.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المطور الذي يتطلب التعامل السلس مع ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc في VS Code مع دمج Marked 2."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to initiate new changes using the experimental artifact-driven approach, leveraging Markdown and AsciiDoc files, and streamlining development workflows with VS Code extensions and Marked 2.","zh":"赋予代理初始化使用实验性基于构件的方法的新更改的能力，利用Markdown和AsciiDoc文件，并使用VS Code扩展和Marked 2简化开发工作流程。","ja":"実験的なアーティファクト駆動アプローチを使用して新しい変更を開始するエージェントを可能にし、MarkdownとAsciiDocファイルを利用し、VS Code拡張機能とMarked 2を使用して開発ワークフローを簡素化します。","ko":"실험적인 아티팩트 주도 접근 방식을 사용하여 새로운 변경 사항을 시작할 수 있는 에이전트를赋予하고, Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일을 利用하며, VS Code 확장 기능과 Marked 2를 사용하여 개발 워크플로우를簡素化합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a iniciar nuevos cambios utilizando el enfoque experimental basado en artefactos, aprovechando archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc, y optimizando flujos de trabajo de desarrollo con extensiones de VS Code y Marked 2.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''initier de nouveaux changements en utilisant l''approche expérimentale basée sur les artefacts, en exploitant les fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc, et en rationalisant les flux de travail de développement avec des extensions de VS Code et Marked 2.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Änderungen mit dem experimentellen, artefaktbasierten Ansatz einzuleiten, indem sie Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateien nutzen und Entwicklungsworkflows mit VS Code-Erweiterungen und Marked 2 optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a iniciar novas alterações usando a abordagem experimental baseada em artefatos, aproveitando os arquivos Markdown e AsciiDoc e otimizando os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento com extensões do VS Code e Marked 2.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью инициировать новые изменения с помощью экспериментального подхода, основанного на артефактах, используя файлы Markdown и AsciiDoc и оптимизируя рабочие процессы разработки с помощью расширений VS Code и Marked 2.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من启动 التغييرات الجديدة باستخدام النهج التجريبي القائم على الملفات، والاستفادة من ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc وتبسيط سير عمل التطوير مع ملحقات VS Code و Marked 2."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Markdown file openings in Marked 2","Generating kebab-case change names from user descriptions","Initiating new changes with artifact-driven approaches in VS Code"],"zh":["在Marked 2中自动打开Markdown文件","从用户描述生成短横线命名的更改名称","在VS Code中使用基于构件的方法初始化新更改"],"ja":["Marked 2でMarkdownファイルを自動的に開く","ユーザーの説明からケバブケースの変更名を生成する","VS Codeでアーティファクト駆動アプローチを使用して新しい変更を開始する"],"ko":["Marked 2에서 Markdown 파일을 자동으로 열기","사용자 설명에서 케밥 케이스의 변경 이름을 생성하기","VS Code에서 아티팩트 주도 접근 방식을 사용하여 새로운 변경 사항을 시작하기"],"es":["Automatización de la apertura de archivos Markdown en Marked 2","Generación de nombres de cambios en kebab-case a partir de descripciones de usuarios","Iniciación de nuevos cambios con enfoques basados en artefactos en VS Code"],"fr":["Automation de l''ouverture de fichiers Markdown dans Marked 2","Génération de noms de changements en kebab-case à partir de descriptions d''utilisateurs","Initiation de nouveaux changements avec des approches basées sur les artefacts dans VS Code"],"de":["Automatisierung der Öffnung von Markdown-Dateien in Marked 2","Generierung von Änderungsnamen im kebab-Format aus Benutzerbeschreibungen","Initiierung neuer Änderungen mit artefaktbasierten Ansätzen in VS Code"],"pt":["Automatizar a abertura de arquivos Markdown no Marked 2","Gerar nomes de alterações em kebab-case a partir de descrições de usuário","Iniciar novas alterações com abordagens baseadas em artefatos no VS Code"],"ru":["Автоматизировать открытие файлов Markdown в Marked 2","Генерировать имена изменений в kebab-case из описаний пользователя","Инициировать новые изменения с подходами, основанными на артефактах, в VS Code"],"ar":["تتمة فتح ملفات Markdown في Marked 2","генерировать أسماء التغييرات في kebab-case من وصفات المستخدم","تشغيل التغييرات الجديدة بالنهج القائم على الملفات في VS Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires VS Code and Marked 2 installation","Limited to Markdown and AsciiDoc file formats","Dependent on user input for change name or description"],"zh":["需要安装VS Code和Marked 2","仅限Markdown和AsciiDoc文件格式","需要用户输入更改名称或描述"],"ja":["VS CodeとMarked 2のインストールが必要","MarkdownとAsciiDocファイル形式のみに限定される","変更名または説明の入力をユーザーに依存する"],"ko":["VS Code와 Marked 2 설치가 필요함","Markdown와 AsciiDoc 파일 형식만으로 제한됨","변경 이름 또는 설명의 입력이 사용자에게 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de VS Code y Marked 2","Limitado a formatos de archivos Markdown y AsciiDoc","Dependiente de la entrada del usuario para el nombre o la descripción del cambio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de VS Code et Marked 2","Limité aux formats de fichiers Markdown et AsciiDoc","Dépend de la saisie de l''utilisateur pour le nom ou la description du changement"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von VS Code und Marked 2","Begrenzt auf Markdown- und AsciiDoc-Dateiformate","Abhängig von der Benutzereingabe für den Änderungsnamen oder die Beschreibung"],"pt":["Requer instalação do VS Code e Marked 2","Limitado a formatos de arquivo Markdown e AsciiDoc","Dependente da entrada do usuário para nome ou descrição da alteração"],"ru":["Требует установки VS Code и Marked 2","Ограничен форматами файлов Markdown и AsciiDoc","Зависит от ввода пользователя для имени или описания изменения"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت VS Code و Marked 2","محدود بتنسيقات ملفات Markdown و AsciiDoc","يعتمد على إدخال المستخدم لاسم التغيير أو الوصف"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2325ae1019930c6383abd2f1312a8aa41600ac8893d036f3da74530b43df9352","qualityScore":45}');
