search","pesquisa no github","ferramentas de busca","desenvolvedores","repositórios","código","problemas","prs"],"ru":["github search","поиск на гитхабе","инструменты поиска","разработчики","репозитории","код","проблемы","prs"],"ar":["بحث جيت هاب","جيت هاب","أدوات البحث","المطورين","المستودعات","الكود","المشاكل","الطلبات سحب"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T11:52:28.980Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-search","description":"Search GitHub for repos, code, and usage examples using gh CLI. Capabilities: repo discovery, code search, finding library usage patterns, issue/PR search. Actions: search, find, discover repos/code/examples. Keywords: gh, github, search repos, search code, find examples, how to use library, stars, language filter. Use when: finding repositories, searching code patterns, discovering how libraries are used, exploring open source.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Search\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n| Goal | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Search repos | `gh search repos \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search code | `gh search code \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search issues | `gh search issues \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search PRs | `gh search prs \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Finding Repositories\n\n**When you see:** User wants to find projects/repos by criteria\n**Use:** `gh search repos`\n\n```bash\n# Basic search with stars\ngh search repos \"stars:>500 lang","body":"# GitHub Search\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n| Goal | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Search repos | `gh search repos \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search code | `gh search code \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search issues | `gh search issues \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search PRs | `gh search prs \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Finding Repositories\n\n**When you see:** User wants to find projects/repos by criteria\n**Use:** `gh search repos`\n\n```bash\n# Basic search with stars\ngh search repos \"stars:>500 language:rust\" --sort=stars --limit=50\n\n# Multiple languages (OR logic)\ngh search repos \"language:rust language:go language:typescript\"\n\n# Exclude topics\ngh search repos \"stars:>1000 -topic:cryptocurrency -topic:blockchain\"\n\n# By topic\ngh search repos \"topic:cli topic:terminal stars:>100\"\n\n# Recently updated\ngh search repos \"language:python pushed:>2024-01-01\"\n```\n\n**Output formats:**\n```bash\n--json name,url,description,stargazersCount  # JSON output\n--web                                         # Open in browser\n```\n\n### Finding Code Examples\n\n**When you see:** User wants to know how to use a library\n**Use:** `gh search code`\n\n```bash\n# Find usage patterns\ngh search code \"from zod import\" --limit=20\ngh search code \"import { z } from ''zod''\" --limit=20\n\n# In specific file types\ngh search code \"useQuery\" extension:tsx --limit=30\n\n# In specific paths\ngh search code \"tanstack/query\" path:src/ extension:ts\n\n# Exact phrase\ngh search code ''\"createTRPCRouter\"'' extension:ts\n```\n\n**Pro tip:** Combine with repo filter for focused results:\n```bash\ngh search code \"pattern\" repo:owner/repo\n```\n\n### Finding Issues/Discussions\n\n**When you see:** User looking for bug reports, feature requests, or discussions\n**Use:** `gh search issues` or `gh search prs`\n\n```bash\n# Open issues with label\ngh search issues \"is:open label:bug repo:facebook/react\"\n\n# PRs by author\ngh search prs \"author:username is:merged\"\n\n# Issues mentioning error\ngh search issues ''\"connection refused\" language:go''\n```\n\n## Query Qualifiers Reference\n\n### Repo Search\n| Qualifier | Example | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `stars:` | `stars:>1000`, `stars:100..500` | Star count |\n| `forks:` | `forks:>100` | Fork count |\n| `language:` | `language:rust` | Primary language |\n| `topic:` | `topic:cli` | Repository topic |\n| `-topic:` | `-topic:blockchain` | Exclude topic |\n| `pushed:` | `pushed:>2024-01-01` | Last push date |\n| `created:` | `created:>2023-01-01` | Creation date |\n| `license:` | `license:mit` | License type |\n| `archived:` | `archived:false` | Archive status |\n| `is:` | `is:public`, `is:private` | Visibility |\n\n### Code Search\n| Qualifier | Example | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `extension:` | `extension:ts` | File extension |\n| `path:` | `path:src/` | File path |\n| `repo:` | `repo:owner/name` | Specific repo |\n| `language:` | `language:javascript` | Code language |\n| `filename:` | `filename:package.json` | File name |\n\n### Common Flags\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `--limit N` | Number of results (max 1000) |\n| `--sort X` | Sort by: stars, forks, updated, best-match |\n| `--order X` | asc or desc |\n| `--json FIELDS` | JSON output with specific fields |\n| `--web` | Open results in browser |\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n### \"Find popular X repos\"\n```bash\ngh search repos \"language:X stars:>500\" --sort=stars --limit=50\n```\n\n### \"How do people use library Y\"\n```bash\ngh search code \"import Y\" extension:ts --limit=30\ngh search code \"from Y import\" extension:py --limit=30\n```\n\n### \"Find repos like Z but exclude crypto\"\n```bash\ngh search repos \"topic:Z -topic:cryptocurrency -topic:blockchain -topic:web3\"\n```\n\n### \"Find recent active projects\"\n```bash\ngh search repos \"language:go pushed:>2024-06-01 stars:>100\" --sort=updated\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Quote the query** when it contains special chars: `gh search repos \"stars:>500\"`\n2. **Multiple languages = OR**: `language:rust language:go` matches either\n3. **Use `--json`** for scripting: `--json name,url,stargazersCount`\n4. **Date ranges**: `pushed:2024-01-01..2024-06-01`\n5. **Numeric ranges**: `stars:100..500`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-24T11:52:35.462Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring efficient GitHub repository and code discovery capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高效的 GitHub 仓库和代码发现能力的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリおよびコードの検出機能を効率的に必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"효율적인 GitHub 저장소 및 코드 발견 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren capacidades de descubrimiento de repositorios y código de GitHub eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des capacités de découverte de référentiels et de code GitHub efficaces.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die effiziente GitHub-Repository- und Code-Entdeckungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem capacidades eficientes de descoberta de repositórios e código do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих эффективных возможностей поиска репозиториев и кода GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات كفؤة لاكتشاف مستودع ومكتبة غيت هاب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to search GitHub repositories, code, issues, and PRs using specific queries and filters, such as searching by stars, language, or limit, utilizing the GitHub CLI command ''gh search'' with various options like ''repos'', ''code'', ''issues'', and ''prs''.","zh":"赋予代理搜索 GitHub 仓库、代码、问题和 PR 的能力，使用特定的查询和过滤器，例如按星级、语言或限制搜索，利用 GitHub CLI 命令 ''gh search'' 以及各种选项，如 ''repos''、''code''、''issues'' 和 ''prs''。","ja":"エージェントに、特定のクエリとフィルタ（たとえば、スター、言語、または制限による検索）を使用して GitHub リポジトリ、コード、問題、PR を検索する能力を付与します。GitHub CLI コマンド ''gh search'' と ''repos''、''code''、''issues''、''prs'' などのさまざまなオプションを使用します。","ko":"특정 쿼리와 필터(예: 별, 언어 또는 제한으로 검색)를 사용하여 GitHub 저장소, 코드, 문제 및 PR를 검색할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여합니다. GitHub CLI 명령 ''gh search'' 및 ''repos'', ''code'', ''issues'', ''prs''などの 다양한 옵션을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a buscar repositorios de GitHub, código, problemas e informes de problemas utilizando consultas y filtros específicos, como buscar por estrellas, idioma o límite, utilizando el comando de la línea de comandos de GitHub ''gh search'' con varias opciones como ''repos'', ''code'', ''issues'' y ''prs''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher des référentiels GitHub, du code, des problèmes et des demandes de tirage en utilisant des requêtes et des filtres spécifiques, tels que la recherche par étoiles, par langage ou par limite, en utilisant la commande CLI GitHub ''gh search'' avec diverses options comme ''repos'', ''code'', ''issues'' et ''prs''.","de":"Ermächtigt Mittel, GitHub-Repositorys, Code, Probleme und Pull-Requests mithilfe spezifischer Abfragen und Filter wie Suche nach Sternen, Sprache oder Begrenzung zu durchsuchen, indem die GitHub-CLI-Befehl ''gh search'' mit verschiedenen Optionen wie ''repos'', ''code'', ''issues'' und ''prs'' verwendet wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes procurem repositórios do GitHub, código, problemas e PRs usando consultas e filtros específicos, como procurar por estrelas, idioma ou limite, utilizando o comando CLI do GitHub ''gh search'' com várias opções como ''repos'', ''code'', ''issues'' e ''prs''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью искать репозитории GitHub, код, проблемы и PR по конкретным запросам и фильтрам, таким как поиск по звездам, языку или ограничению, используя команду GitHub CLI ''gh search'' с различными опциями, такими как ''repos'', ''code'', ''issues'' и ''prs''.","ar":"تمكين العملاء من البحث في مستودعات غيت هاب، والشفرة، والقضايا، وطلبات السحب باستخدام استعلامات ومرشحات محددة، مثل البحث بواسطة نجوم، أو لغة، أو حدود، باستخدام أمر واجهة سطر أوامر غيت هاب ''gh search'' مع خيارات مختلفة مثل ''repos''، و ''code''، و ''issues''، و ''prs''."},"useCases":{"en":["Searching repositories by specific criteria like language or stars","Finding relevant code snippets within GitHub","Debugging issues by searching through GitHub issue trackers","Discovering open pull requests for collaboration or contribution"],"zh":["按特定标准搜索仓库，如语言或星级","在 GitHub 中找到相关代码片段","通过搜索 GitHub 问题跟踪器调试问题","发现开放式拉取请求以进行协作或贡献"],"ja":["言語やスターなどの特定の基準でリポジトリを検索する","GitHub 内で関連するコード スニペットを見つける","GitHub の問題トラッカーを検索して問題をデバッグする","コラボレーションまたはコントリビューションのためにオープンなプル リクエストを発見する"],"ko":["언어 또는 별 등 특정 기준으로 저장소를 검색하는 것","GitHub 내에서 관련 코드 스니펫을 찾는 것","GitHub 문제 추적기를 검색하여 문제를 디버깅하는 것","协作 또는 기여를 위해 열린 풀 요청을 발견하는 것"],"es":["Buscar repositorios por criterios específicos como idioma o estrellas","Encontrar fragmentos de código relevantes dentro de GitHub","Depurar problemas al buscar a través de los seguimientos de problemas de GitHub","Descubrir solicitudes de extracción abiertas para la colaboración o contribución"],"fr":["Rechercher des référentiels par des critères spécifiques comme la langue ou les étoiles","Trouver des extraits de code pertinents à l''intérieur de GitHub","Déboguer des problèmes en recherchant à travers les traceurs de problèmes GitHub","Découvrir des demandes de tirage ouvertes pour la collaboration ou la contribution"],"de":["Repositorys nach bestimmten Kriterien wie Sprache oder Sternen suchen","Relevante Code-Snippets innerhalb von GitHub finden","Probleme durch die Suche in den GitHub-Problemmeldungen debuggen","Offene Pull-Requests für die Zusammenarbeit oder den Beitrag entdecken"],"pt":["Procurar repositórios por critérios específicos, como idioma ou estrelas","Encontrar trechos de código relevantes dentro do GitHub","Depurar problemas procurando por rastreadores de problemas do GitHub","Descobrir solicitações de pull abertas para colaboração ou contribuição"],"ru":["Поиск репозиториев по конкретным критериям, таким как язык или звезды","Поиск релевантных фрагментов кода внутри GitHub","Отладка проблем путем поиска в отслеживателях проблем GitHub","Обнаружение открытых запросов на вытягивание для сотрудничества или вклада"],"ar":["البحث في مستودعات بواسطة معايير محددة مثل اللغة أو النجوم","العثور على شفرة مقتطفات ذات صلة داخل غيت هاب","تصحيح الأخطاء عن طريق البحث من خلال متتبع القضايا غيت هاب","اكتشاف طلبات السحب المفتوحة للتعاون أو المساهمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation and configuration","Limited to 30 results per query by default","Dependent on GitHub API and CLI version"],"zh":["需要 GitHub CLI 的安装和配置","默认情况下每个查询最多返回 30 个结果","依赖于 GitHub API 和 CLI 版本"],"ja":["GitHub CLI のインストールと構成が必要","デフォルトではクエリごとに最大 30 件の結果が返される","GitHub API と CLI バージョンに依存する"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치 및 구성이 필요함","기본적으로 쿼리당 최대 30개의 결과가 반환됨","GitHub API 및 CLI 버전에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de GitHub CLI","Limitado a 30 resultados por consulta de forma predeterminada","Dependiente de la API y la versión de GitHub CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de GitHub CLI","Limité à 30 résultats par requête par défaut","Dépendant de l''API et de la version de GitHub CLI"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von GitHub CLI","Standardmäßig auf 30 Ergebnisse pro Abfrage beschränkt","Abhängig von GitHub API und CLI-Version"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do GitHub CLI","Limitado a 30 resultados por consulta por padrão","Dependente da API e da versão do CLI do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки GitHub CLI","Ограничен 30 результатами на запрос по умолчанию","Зависит от версии API и CLI GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين واجهة سطر أوامر غيت هاب","محدود بـ 30 نتيجة لكل استعلام افتراضيًا","يعتمد على إصدار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وإصدار واجهة سطر أوامر غيت هاب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6bb106204adc91adfcf7e7e98263735ea30df9cbbbb599d1db32931ff91bb04b","qualityScore":45}');
