전트","SEO 최적화","Next.js 블로그","마크다운 편집기","사용자 지정 도메인","빠른 배포","AI 에이전트 사용법","ai-seo-optimization 튜토리얼","ai-seo-optimization 설치"],"es":["optimización de SEO","agentes de IA","plantilla de blog gratuita","Next.js 14","Zero Code","dominio personalizado","comentarios","GitHub Pages","despliegue en minutos"],"fr":["optimisation SEO","agents IA","modèle de blog gratuit","Next.js 14","Zero Code","domaine personnalisé","commentaires","GitHub Pages","déploiement en minutes"],"de":["SEO-Optimierung","KI-Agenten","kostenlose Blog-Vorlage","Next.js 14","Zero Code","benutzerdefiniertes Domain","Kommentare","GitHub Pages","Deployen in Minuten"],"pt":["otimização de SEO","agentes de IA","Next.js 14","modelo de blog gratuito","criação de blog profissional","suporte a Markdown","customização de domínio","desempenho extremo","Tailwind CSS","como usar agentes de IA para SEO"],"ru":["оптимизация SEO","ИИ Агенты","Next.js 14","бесплатный шаблон блога","создание профессионального блога","поддержка Markdown","настройка домена","экстремальное производительность","Tailwind CSS","как использовать ИИ Агенты для SEO"],"ar":["تحسين SEO","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","Next.js 14","قالب مدونة مجاني","إنشاء مدونة احترافية","دعم Markdown","تخصيص النطاق","أداء أقصى","Tailwind CSS","كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين SEO"]}},"owner":"geekskai","repo":"blog","repoPath":"geekskai/blog","stars":100,"forks":54,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T06:24:15Z","topics":["blog","blog-template","blog-theme","github-pages","nextjs","nextjs-blog","nextjs-template","nextjs14","reactjs","tainwindcss"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ai-seo-optimization","description":"Optimize content and websites for AI search engines (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews) using GEO principles, content chunking, structured data, and brand visibility strategies. Use when working on SEO, AI visibility, content optimization, GEO, getting brand mentioned in AI, or implementing technical SEO for LLM search.","bodyPreview":"# AI-Era SEO & GEO Optimization\n\nQuick reference for optimizing content and websites for AI search engines. For complete details, see [AI-SEO-Complete-Guide.md](../../AI-SEO-Complete-Guide.md).\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Brand is the ultimate signal** - In LLM search era, brand presence across web > perfect content\n2. **Information Retrieval Score** - If AI can''t extract your content chunks, you''re invisible\n3. **Content freshness** - 30-90 day update cycle is strongest AI ranking signal\n4. **Top","body":"# AI-Era SEO & GEO Optimization\n\nQuick reference for optimizing content and websites for AI search engines. For complete details, see [AI-SEO-Complete-Guide.md](../../AI-SEO-Complete-Guide.md).\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Brand is the ultimate signal** - In LLM search era, brand presence across web > perfect content\n2. **Information Retrieval Score** - If AI can''t extract your content chunks, you''re invisible\n3. **Content freshness** - 30-90 day update cycle is strongest AI ranking signal\n4. **Topical authority** - Build knowledge graph + information graph, not keyword stuffing\n5. **Re-Ranker determines ranking** - Focus on semantic relevance, not keyword density\n\n## Quick Action Checklist\n\n### Technical Setup (Do First)\n- [ ] Unblock AI crawlers in `robots.txt` (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Google-Extended)\n- [ ] Add `last-modified` metadata to pages\n- [ ] Implement content freshness badges\n- [ ] Submit XML sitemap with correct `lastmod` values\n\n### Content Optimization\n- [ ] Use `<strong>` tags for core facts (pricing, features, positioning)\n- [ ] Structure content in chunks (fact chunks, feature chunks)\n- [ ] Answer in first sentence (Wikipedia principle)\n- [ ] Add citations with specific sources, dates, and numbers\n- [ ] Include FAQ sections with structured data\n\n### Brand Visibility\n- [ ] Test AI visibility with prompt templates weekly\n- [ ] Build presence on Reddit (relevant subreddits)\n- [ ] Create YouTube videos with transcripts and timestamps\n- [ ] Reach out to sites AI already cites for inclusion\n\n## Code Patterns\n\n### Content Chunking Structure\n\n```tsx\n// ✅ Good: Clear content chunk structure\nconst ContentChunk = () => (\n  <article>\n    <section className=\"fact-chunk\">\n      <h2>Core Features</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Feature Name</strong>: Feature description</li>\n        <li><strong>Pricing</strong>: Free to use</li>\n        <li><strong>Target Users</strong>: Students, developers</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </article>\n)\n```\n\n### Content Freshness Badge\n\n```tsx\n// app/components/ContentFreshness.tsx\nimport { formatDistanceToNow } from \"date-fns\"\n\nexport function ContentFreshnessBadge({ lastModified }: { lastModified: Date }) {\n  const daysSinceUpdate = Math.floor((Date.now() - lastModified.getTime()) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24))\n  const isFresh = daysSinceUpdate < 90\n\n  return (\n    <div className={`inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-3 py-1 ${\n      isFresh ? \"border-green-500/30 bg-green-500/20\" : \"border-orange-500/30 bg-orange-500/20\"\n    }`}>\n      <span>{isFresh ? \"✓\" : \"⚠\"}</span>\n      <span className=\"text-sm\">\n        {isFresh ? `Updated ${formatDistanceToNow(lastModified, { addSuffix: true })}`\n                 : `Last updated ${formatDistanceToNow(lastModified, { addSuffix: true })}`}\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### robots.txt for AI Access\n\n```\nUser-agent: GPTBot\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: ChatGPT-User\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: OAI-SearchBot\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: ClaudeBot\nAllow: /\n\nUser-agent: Google-Extended\nAllow: /\n```\n\n### Schema.org - Organization & WebApplication\n\n```typescript\n// app/utils/schema-generator.ts\nexport function generateToolSchema(tool: Tool) {\n  return {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"WebApplication\",\n    name: tool.name,\n    description: tool.description,\n    url: `https://geekskai.com${tool.href}`,\n    offers: {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      price: \"0\",\n      priceCurrency: \"USD\",\n    },\n    provider: {\n      \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n      name: \"GeeksKai\",\n      url: \"https://geekskai.com\",\n    },\n    featureList: tool.features,\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### FAQ Schema\n\n```typescript\nexport function generateFAQSchema(faqs: FAQ[]) {\n  return {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n    mainEntity: faqs.map((faq) => ({\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      name: faq.question,\n      acceptedAnswer: {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        text: faq.answer,\n      },\n    })),\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Content Writing Patterns\n\n### Answer-First Structure\n\n```\n## Question as Heading (Exactly How Users Ask)\n\nDirect answer in first sentence. No buildup, no fluff.\n\n**Key points:**\n- Bullet point 1\n- Bullet point 2\n- Bullet point 3\n\nDetails and context here if needed.\n\n**Quick takeaway:** One sentence summary.\n```\n\n### Quick Answer Box Template\n\n```\n> **Quick Answer:** [Direct answer to the main question]\n>\n> **Best for:** [Target audience]\n>\n> **Cost:** [Price range]\n>\n> **Key benefit:** [Main advantage]\n```\n\n### Citation Format\n\n❌ **Wrong:** \"Studies show this increases conversion\"\n\n✅ **Right:** \"[HubSpot''s 2024 study](url) of 1,000 businesses found this increases conversion by 34%\"\n\n**Citation requirements:**\n- Specific source name\n- Recent date (within 2 years)\n- Exact numbers\n- Clear attribution with link\n\n## AI Visibility Testing\n\n### Prompt Templates\n\nTest these weekly in ChatGPT/Perplexity:\n\n- \"What''s the best [your category] for [specific use case]?\"\n- \"best [your category] with [specific feature]?\"\n- \"How do I [problem you solve] without [common pain point]?\"\n- \"[your brand] vs [top competitor]\"\n- \"best [your category] tool for [target audience]\"\n\n### Tracking Spreadsheet\n\n| Prompt | Mentioned? | Sentiment | Sources Cited | AI Platform | Date |\n|--------|------------|-----------|---------------|-------------|------|\n| Best PM tool for startups | No | - | Monday, Asana | ChatGPT | 1/8/25 |\n\n## 10 Proven Strategies Summary\n\n1. **Unblock AI crawlers** - Check robots.txt immediately\n2. **Test current visibility** - Use prompt templates weekly\n3. **Piggyback on cited sources** - Reach out to sites AI already uses\n4. **Create superior content** - Outrank competitors with depth\n5. **Build SEO foundation** - 50% of AI citations come from top 10 Google results\n6. **Answer-first structure** - Wikipedia principle, direct answers\n7. **Add citations** - Increases visibility by 40%\n8. **Dominate Reddit** - AI''s opinion source\n9. **Create YouTube videos** - AI Overview king with transcripts\n10. **Strategic PR** - Build authority through media mentions\n\n## Key Metrics (KPIs)\n\n### AI Search Era KPIs\n- Information Retrieval Score\n- Content Freshness (< 90 days)\n- Topical Coverage\n- Brand Mentions (quantity & quality)\n- Fact Retrieval Rate\n\n### Traditional SEO (Still Important)\n- Organic Traffic\n- Ranking Position\n- CTR\n- Dwell Time\n- Bounce Rate\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n- ❌ Blocking AI crawlers in robots.txt\n- ❌ Burying answers in long paragraphs\n- ❌ Vague citations without sources/dates\n- ❌ Ignoring content freshness (90+ days old)\n- ❌ Keyword stuffing instead of topical coverage\n- ❌ Missing structured data (Schema.org)\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nFor complete implementation details, code examples, and advanced strategies, see:\n- [AI-SEO-Complete-Guide.md](../../AI-SEO-Complete-Guide.md) - Full comprehensive guide\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T13:06:58.272Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Model Agents needing advanced AI-driven search engine optimization techniques.","zh":"非常适合需要高级AI驱动搜索引擎优化技术的语言模型代理。","ja":"高度なAI駆動の検索エンジン最適化技術を必要とする言語モデルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 AI 구동 검색 엔진 최적화 기술이 필요한 언어 모델 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Modelos de Lenguaje que necesitan técnicas de optimización de motores de búsqueda impulsadas por inteligencia artificial avanzada.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Modèles de Langage ayant besoin de techniques de référencement avancées basées sur l''intelligence artificielle.","de":"Perfekt für Language-Model-Agents, die erweiterte künstliche Intelligenz-basierte Suchmaschinen-Optimierungstechniken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modelo de Linguagem que precisam de técnicas avançadas de otimização de motores de busca impulsionadas por Inteligência Artificial.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов языковых моделей, которым необходимы продвинутые техники оптимизации поисковых систем, основанные на искусственном интеллекте.","ar":"مثالي ل와كلاء نموذج اللغة الذين يحتاجون إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتحسين محركات البحث مدفوعة بالذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to boost content visibility through Information Retrieval Score optimization, leveraging brand presence and content freshness signals, while supporting Markdown and custom domain integration.","zh":"通过信息检索评分优化、利用品牌存在感和内容新鲜度信号来提升内容可见性，同时支持Markdown和自定义域集成的代理赋能。","ja":"インフォメーション・リトリーバル・スコアの最適化を通じてコンテンツの可視性を高め、ブランドの存在感やコンテンツの新鮮度シグナルを活用し、Markdownやカスタムドメインの統合をサポートするエージェントのエンパワーメント。","ko":"정보 검색 점수 최적화를 통해 콘텐츠 가시성을 높이고 브랜드 존재감 및 콘텐츠 신선도 신호를 활용하며 Markdown 및 사용자 지정 도메인 통합을 지원하는 에이전트 강화입니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aumentar la visibilidad del contenido a través de la optimización de la Puntuación de Recuperación de Información, aprovechando la presencia de la marca y las señales de frescura del contenido, y admitiendo la integración de Markdown y dominio personalizado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''améliorer la visibilité du contenu grâce à l''optimisation du Score de Récupération d''Informations, en exploitant la présence de la marque et les signaux de fraîcheur de contenu, tout en prenant en charge l''intégration de Markdown et de domaine personnalisé.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Sichtbarkeit von Inhalten durch die Optimierung des Information Retrieval Scores zu erhöhen, indem sie die Markenpräsenz und die Inhaltsfrische-Signale nutzen und gleichzeitig die Integration von Markdown und benutzerdefinierten Domains unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aumentar a visibilidade do conteúdo por meio da otimização do Score de Recuperação de Informações, aproveitando a presença da marca e os sinais de frescor do conteúdo, além de suportar integração de domínio personalizado e Markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью повысить видимость контента за счет оптимизации балла поиска информации, используя сигналы присутствия бренда и свежести контента, а также поддерживая интеграцию с Markdown и пользовательским доменом.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تعزيز وضوح المحتوى من خلال تحسين درجة استرجاع المعلومات، واستخدام إشارات وجود العلامة التجارية وتازجية المحتوى، مع دعم تكامل النطاق المخصص و Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SEO audits for AI-era search engines","Generating optimized content chunks for improved Information Retrieval Scores","Debugging website performance issues affecting content freshness and ranking signals"],"zh":["为AI时代搜索引擎自动化SEO审计","为改进信息检索评分生成优化的内容块","调试影响内容新鲜度和排名信号的网站性能问题"],"ja":["AI時代の検索エンジン向けのSEO監査の自動化","情報リトリーバルスコアの改善のための最適化されたコンテンツブロックの生成","コンテンツの新鮮度とランキング信号に影響を与えるWebサイトのパフォーマンスの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["AI 시대 검색 엔진을 위한 SEO 감사의 자동화","정보 검색 점수의 향상을 위한 최적화된 콘텐츠 블록 생성","콘텐츠 신선도 및 순위 신호에 영향을 미치는 웹 사이트 성능 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías de SEO para motores de búsqueda de la era de la inteligencia artificial","Generar fragmentos de contenido optimizados para mejorar las Puntuaciones de Recuperación de Información","Depurar problemas de rendimiento de sitios web que afectan las señales de frescura y clasificación de contenido"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits de SEO pour les moteurs de recherche de l''ère de l''intelligence artificielle","Générer des fragments de contenu optimisés pour améliorer les Scores de Récupération d''Informations","Déboguer les problèmes de performances de sites web affectant les signaux de fraîcheur et de classement de contenu"],"de":["Automatisierung von SEO-Audits für Suchmaschinen der KI-Ära","Erzeugen von optimierten Inhaltsteilen zur Verbesserung der Information Retrieval Scores","Fehlerbehebung bei der Leistung von Websites, die die Signale für Inhaltsfrische und Ranking beeinträchtigen"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de SEO para motores de busca da era da Inteligência Artificial","Gerar pedaços de conteúdo otimizados para melhorar os Scores de Recuperação de Informações","Depurar problemas de desempenho do site que afetam a tazjidade do conteúdo e os sinais de classificação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудиты SEO для поисковых систем эпохи искусственного интеллекта","Генерировать оптимизированные фрагменты контента для улучшения баллов поиска информации","Отлаживать проблемы производительности сайта, влияющие на свежесть контента и сигналы ранжирования"],"ar":["تحسين عمليات فحص SEO آليًا لمحركات البحث في عصر الذكاء الاصطناعي","генерировать مقاطع محتوى متقنة لتحسين درجات استرجاع المعلومات","تصحيح مشاكل أداء الموقع التي تؤثر على تازجية المحتوى وإشارات التصنيف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of AI-SEO principles and search engine algorithms","Limited to text-based content optimization, excluding image or video SEO"],"zh":["需要理解AI-SEO原理和搜索引擎算法","仅限于基于文本的内容优化，不包括图像或视频SEO"],"ja":["AI-SEOの原理と検索エンジンのアルゴリズムを理解する必要がある","テキストベースのコンテンツ最適化のみに限定され、画像またはビデオのSEOは除く"],"ko":["AI-SEO 원리 및 검색 엔진 알고리즘을 이해해야 함","텍스트 기반 콘텐츠 최적화에만 제한되며 이미지 또는 비디오 SEO는 제외"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de SEO de inteligencia artificial y algoritmos de motores de búsqueda","Limitado a la optimización de contenido basado en texto, excluyendo la optimización de SEO de imágenes o videos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de SEO basés sur l''intelligence artificielle et des algorithmes de moteurs de recherche","Limité à l''optimisation de contenu basé sur du texte, excluant l''optimisation de SEO d''images ou de vidéos"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis von KI-SEO-Grundsätzen und Suchmaschinen-Algorithmen","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung von textbasiertem Inhalt, wobei die SEO-Optimierung von Bildern oder Videos ausgeschlossen ist"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de SEO de Inteligência Artificial e algoritmos de motores de busca","Limitado à otimização de conteúdo baseado em texto, excluindo SEO de imagem ou vídeo"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов SEO искусственного интеллекта и алгоритмов поисковых систем","Ограничен оптимизацией текстового контента, исключая SEO изображений или видео"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ SEO للذكاء الاصطناعي و خوارزميات محركات البحث","محدود بتحسين المحتوى القائم على النص، باستثناء تحسين محركات البحث للصور أو الفيديو"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a301bd96219529b0e05595ce2c06705fde0baa540b937cb2d23ffba4238bf38d","qualityScore":44}');
