Ferramentas C# para Microsoft Age...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: создайте с помощью инструментария C# для Micro...","ar":"إنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي باستخدام مجموعة أدوات C# لمايكرو...","en":"create-agent-provider"},"description":{"zh":"Create Agent Provider是一个基于Microsoft Agent Framework的C#工具包，简化开发流程","ja":"Create Agent ProviderはMicrosoft Agent Framework上のオピニオネートC# Toolkitです","ko":"Create Agent Provider는 Microsoft Agent Framework 위에 구축된 오피니어네이트 C# 툴킷입니다","es":"create-agent-provider es un kit de herramientas C# para Microsoft Agent Framework que facilita el desarrollo de agentes de IA","fr":"create-agent-provider est un kit d''outils C# pour Microsoft Agent Framework qui facilite la création d''agents IA","de":"create-agent-provider ist ein C#-Toolkit für Microsoft Agent Framework, das die Entwicklung von KI-Agentsen vereinfacht","pt":"O create-agent-provider é uma ferramenta C# que facilita o desenvolvimento de soluções de AI Agent com Microsoft Agent Framework.","ru":"ИИ Агенты: create-agent-provider - это инструментарий C#, который упрощает разработку решений на основе Microsoft Agent Framework.","ar":"إنشاء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي: create-agent-provider هو أداة C# تسهل إنشاء حلول وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام مايكروسوفت إطار العميل","en":"An opinionated C# Toolkit on top of Microsoft Agent Framework that makes life easier"},"definition":{"en":"An opinionated C# Toolkit on top of Microsoft Agent Framework that makes life easier"},"features":{"zh":["基于Microsoft Agent Framework","简化开发流程","提高开发效率","支持C#开发","易于集成"],"ja":["Microsoft Agent Frameworkベース","開発プロセスを簡素化","開発効率を向上","C#開発対応","簡単な統合"],"ko":["Microsoft Agent Framework 기반","개발 프로세스를 간소화","개발 효율을 향상","C# 개발 지원","쉽게 통합"],"es":["Kit de herramientas C# para Microsoft Agent Framework","Simplifica el desarrollo de agentes de IA","Integración con Microsoft Agent Framework","Código abierto y personalizable","Documentación y soporte técnico"],"fr":["Kit d''outils C# pour Microsoft Agent Framework","Facilite la création d''agents IA","Intégration avec Microsoft Agent Framework","Code ouvert et personnalisable","Documentation et support technique"],"de":["C#-Toolkit für Microsoft Agent Framework","Vereinfacht die Entwicklung von KI-Agentsen","Integration mit Microsoft Agent Framework","Open-Source-Code und anpassbar","Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de soluções de AI Agent com facilidade","Integração com Microsoft Agent Framework","Ferramentas C# para simplificar o desenvolvimento","Crie agentes personalizados com facilidade","Suporte a desenvolvedores com documentação completa"],"ru":["Разработка решений ИИ Агентов с легкостью","Интеграция с Microsoft Agent Framework","Инструментарий C# для упрощения разработки","Создайте индивидуальных агентов с легкостью","Поддержка разработчиков с полной документацией"],"ar":["إنشاء حلول وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي بسهولة","التكامل مع مايكروسوفت إطار العميل","مجموعة أدوات C# لتسهيل التطوير","قم بإنشاء وكلاء مخصصين بسهولة","دعم المطورين مع وثائق شاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Microsoft Agent Framework","C#工具包","开发效率","简化开发","Create Agent Provider","AI代理工具","Microsoft Agent Framework教程","C#开发指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Microsoft Agent Framework","C# Toolkit","開発効率","開発簡素化","Create Agent Provider","AIエージェントツール","Microsoft Agent Frameworkチュートリアル","C#開発ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Microsoft Agent Framework","C# 툴킷","개발 효율","개발 간소화","Create Agent Provider","AI 에이전트 툴","Microsoft Agent Framework 튜토리얼","C# 개발 가이드"],"es":["agentes de IA","herramientas de agentes de IA","create-agent-provider","Microsoft Agent Framework","desarrollo de agentes de IA","kit de herramientas C#","integración con Microsoft Agent Framework","código abierto","soporte técnico"],"fr":["agents IA","outils d''agents IA","create-agent-provider","Microsoft Agent Framework","création d''agents IA","kit d''outils C#","intégration avec Microsoft Agent Framework","code ouvert","support technique"],"de":["KI-Agentsen","KI-Agent-Tools","create-agent-provider","Microsoft Agent Framework","Entwicklung von KI-Agentsen","C#-Toolkit","Integration mit Microsoft Agent Framework","Open-Source-Code","technischer Support"],"pt":["como criar agentes de AI","o que é Microsoft Agent Framework","kit de ferramentas C# para AI Agent","create-agent-provider alternativa","instalar create-agent-provider","guia de configuração do create-agent-provider"],"ru":["как создать агентов ИИ","что такое Microsoft Agent Framework","инструментарий C# для ИИ Агентов","create-agent-provider альтернатива","установить create-agent-provider","руководство по настройке create-agent-provider"],"ar":["كيفية إنشاء وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو إطار عميل مايكروسوفت","مجموعة أدوات C# لوكيلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","create-agent-provider بديل","تثبيت create-agent-provider","دليل إعداد create-agent-provider"]}},"owner":"rwjdk","repo":"AgentFrameworkToolkit","repoPath":"rwjdk/AgentFrameworkToolkit","stars":53,"forks":5,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T20:30:08Z","topics":["microsoft-agent-framework"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-agent-provider","description":"Instructions for creating a new Agent Provider NuGet package for AgentFrameworkToolkit","bodyPreview":"# Create Agent Provider Package\n\nThis skill guides you through creating a new Agent Provider NuGet package for the AgentFrameworkToolkit. Agent Providers enable integration with different LLM services (e.g., Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, Mistral).\n\n## Quick Decision Guide\n\n**Choose implementation approach:**\n\n1. **OpenAI-Compatible Provider** - If the LLM service has an OpenAI-compatible API:\n   - Examples: OpenRouter, XAI (Grok), Cohere\n   - See: [OpenAI-Compatible Template](references/OpenAICompa","body":"# Create Agent Provider Package\n\nThis skill guides you through creating a new Agent Provider NuGet package for the AgentFrameworkToolkit. Agent Providers enable integration with different LLM services (e.g., Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, Mistral).\n\n## Quick Decision Guide\n\n**Choose implementation approach:**\n\n1. **OpenAI-Compatible Provider** - If the LLM service has an OpenAI-compatible API:\n   - Examples: OpenRouter, XAI (Grok), Cohere\n   - See: [OpenAI-Compatible Template](references/OpenAICompatibleTemplate.md)\n   - Faster implementation (reuses existing OpenAI code)\n\n2. **Custom Provider** - If the LLM service has a unique API:\n   - Examples: Anthropic (Claude), Google (Gemini), GitHub Models, Mistral\n   - See: [Custom Provider Template](references/CustomProviderTemplate.md)\n   - Full control, follows standard patterns\n\n## Core Provider Components\n\nMost provider packages include these components (OpenAI-compatible providers reuse `AgentFrameworkToolkit.OpenAI.AgentOptions`):\n\n### 1. Connection Class (`<Provider>Connection`)\n- Manages API credentials and configuration\n- Creates and configures the SDK client\n- Supports network timeout and custom endpoints (if applicable)\n- Provides raw HTTP call inspection hooks (if possible)\n\n### 2. Agent Factory (`<Provider>AgentFactory`)\n- Creates agent instances from options (or from simplified overloads)\n- Builds the inner `ChatClientAgent` (custom providers)\n- Applies middleware via `AgentFrameworkToolkit.MiddlewareHelper`\n\n### 3. Agent Options (`<Provider>AgentOptions`) (custom providers only)\n- Configuration for agent creation (model, instructions, tools, max tokens, etc.)\n- Provider-specific settings (e.g., thinking budget)\n- Middleware configuration (raw HTTP/tool inspection, tool-calling middleware, OpenTelemetry, logging)\n\n### 4. Agent Wrapper (`<Provider>Agent`)\n- Inherits from `AIAgent`\n- Delegates to an inner agent instance\n- Exposes an `InnerAgent` property\n\n### 5. Chat Models Constants (`<Provider>ChatModels`) (only if provider is specific. if it offers multiple LLMs don''t include such)\n- Constants for available model IDs\n- Makes model selection discoverable\n\n## Implementation Steps\n\n### Step 1: Project Setup\n\n```bash\nmkdir src/AgentFrameworkToolkit.<Provider>\n```\n\n**Important repo conventions (don’t fight the build system):**\n- `src/*` projects inherit defaults from `Directory.Build.props` (currently `net8.0`).\n- NuGet packaging defaults are imported via `nuget-package.props` in each `src/*` `.csproj`.\n- Central package versions are in `Directory.Packages.props` (no versions in `.csproj`).\n\n### Step 2: Implement Core Components\n\nFollow existing providers:\n- **OpenAI-compatible**: `src/AgentFrameworkToolkit.OpenRouter/`, `src/AgentFrameworkToolkit.XAI/`, `src/AgentFrameworkToolkit.Cohere/`\n- **Custom**: `src/AgentFrameworkToolkit.Anthropic/`, `src/AgentFrameworkToolkit.GitHub/`, `src/AgentFrameworkToolkit.Google/`, `src/AgentFrameworkToolkit.Mistral/`\n\n### Step 3: Add Service Extensions\n\nCreate `ServiceCollectionExtensions.cs` for dependency injection using the repo naming convention:\n- `Add<Provider>AgentFactory(this IServiceCollection services, string apiKey)`\n- `Add<Provider>AgentFactory(this IServiceCollection services, <Provider>Connection connection)`\n\n### Step 4: Write Tests (Integration Tests)\n\nProvider tests live in `development/Tests/` and make real API calls.\nSee [Testing Guide](references/TestingGuide.md) for the repo’s concrete pattern.\n\n**Quick checklist:**\n1. Add provider project references:\n   - `development/Tests/Tests.csproj`\n   - `development/Sandbox/Sandbox.csproj`\n2. Add provider to the shared test harness:\n   - Add a value to `AgentProvider` enum in `development/Tests/TestBase.cs`\n   - Add a `case` to `GetAgentForScenarioAsync(...)` in `development/Tests/TestBase.cs`\n3. Create `development/Tests/<Provider>Tests.cs`:\n   - Call the shared scenario tests (`SimpleAgentTestsAsync`, `NormalAgentTestsAsync`, etc.)\n   - Add DI tests for `Add<Provider>AgentFactory(...)`\n4. Add a sandbox runner in `development/Sandbox/Providers/<Provider>.cs` and optionally wire it in `development/Sandbox/Program.cs`\n5. Add your API key to user-secrets:\n   - Update `development/Secrets/Secrets.cs` and `development/Secrets/SecretsManager.cs`\n   - Set the secret using `dotnet user-secrets` for the `development/Secrets/Secrets.csproj` project\n\n### Step 5: Repository Integration\n\n1. Add the project to `AgentFrameworkToolkit.slnx` under `/Packages/`\n2. Add any new SDK package versions to `Directory.Packages.props`\n3. Update documentation:\n   - Main `README.md` provider table\n   - Provider-specific `src/AgentFrameworkToolkit.<Provider>/README.md`\n   - `CHANGELOG.md`\n\n### Step 6: Validation\n\n```bash\ndotnet build --configuration Release\n```\n\n## Key Architectural Patterns\n\n### Middleware Configuration (custom providers)\n\nUse the shared helper instead of re-implementing ordering rules:\n- `AgentFrameworkToolkit.MiddlewareHelper.ApplyMiddleware(...)`\n\n### Agent Factory Pattern (custom providers)\n\n```csharp\npublic class <Provider>AgentFactory\n{\n    public <Provider>Connection Connection { get; }\n\n    public <Provider>AgentFactory(string apiKey);\n    public <Provider>AgentFactory(<Provider>Connection connection);\n\n    public <Provider>Agent CreateAgent(<Provider>AgentOptions options)\n    {\n        // 1. Get SDK client from connection\n        // 2. Build IChatClient (or use SDK-provided one)\n        // 3. Create ChatClientAgent\n        // 4. Apply middleware via MiddlewareHelper\n        // 5. Wrap in provider-specific agent\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. Missing XML documentation (warnings are errors in this repo)\n2. Putting versions in `.csproj` instead of `Directory.Packages.props`\n3. Forgetting to update `AgentFrameworkToolkit.slnx` and `README.md`\n4. Forgetting to add provider to `development/Tests/TestBase.cs` test harness\n5. Hardcoding API keys instead of using user-secrets (`development/Secrets/SecretsManager.cs`)\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n- [OpenAI-Compatible Provider Template](references/OpenAICompatibleTemplate.md)\n- [Custom Provider Template](references/CustomProviderTemplate.md)\n- [Unit Testing Guide](references/TestingGuide.md)\n- [Provider Implementation Checklist](references/ProviderChecklist.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:15:36.560Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing seamless integration with various LLM services through the Microsoft Agent Framework","zh":"适用于像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agents，需要与各种 LLM 服务通过 Microsoft Agent Framework 实现无缝集成","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに適しており、Microsoft Agent Framework を通じて様々な LLM サービスとシームレスに統合する必要があります","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 Microsoft Agent Framework를 통해 다양한 LLM 서비스와 무결점 통합이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una integración sin problemas con varios servicios de LLM a través del Microsoft Agent Framework","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une intégration transparente avec différents services LLM via le Microsoft Agent Framework","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine nahtlose Integration mit verschiedenen LLM-Diensten über das Microsoft Agent Framework benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de integração sem problemas com vários serviços de LLM por meio do Microsoft Agent Framework","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих бесшовной интеграции с различными сервисами LLM через Microsoft Agent Framework","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى دمج متوافق مع خدمات LLM المختلفة من خلال إطار وكيل Microsoft"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate with different LLM services such as Anthropic, OpenAI, and Google using the AgentFrameworkToolkit, enabling the creation of custom Agent Provider NuGet packages for expanded functionality and compatibility with OpenAI-compatible APIs","zh":"能够让代理与 Anthropic、OpenAI 和 Google 等不同的 LLM 服务通过 AgentFrameworkToolkit 进行集成，实现自定义 Agent Provider NuGet 包的创建以扩展功能并与 OpenAI 兼容的 API 兼容","ja":"AgentFrameworkToolkit を使用して、Anthropic、OpenAI、Google などの異なる LLM サービスとエージェントを統合できるようにし、カスタム Agent Provider NuGet パッケージの作成を可能にし、OpenAI と互換性のある API との互換性を確保します","ko":"에이전트를 Anthropic, OpenAI, Google와 같은 다양한 LLM 서비스와 AgentFrameworkToolkit를 통해 통합할 수 있으며, 사용자 정의 에이전트 공급자 NuGet 패키지를 만들어서 기능을 확장하고 OpenAI와 호환되는 API와의 호환성을 보장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrarse con diferentes servicios de LLM como Anthropic, OpenAI y Google utilizando el AgentFrameworkToolkit, lo que permite la creación de paquetes de proveedores de Agentes personalizados de NuGet para una funcionalidad expandida y compatibilidad con APIs compatibles con OpenAI","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer différents services LLM tels qu''Anthropic, OpenAI et Google en utilisant l''AgentFrameworkToolkit, ce qui permet la création de packages de fournisseurs d''agents personnalisés NuGet pour une fonctionnalité étendue et une compatibilité avec les API compatibles OpenAI","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, sich mit verschiedenen LLM-Diensten wie Anthropic, OpenAI und Google über das AgentFrameworkToolkit zu integrieren, wodurch die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Agent-Anbieter-NuGet-Paketen für erweiterte Funktionalität und Kompatibilität mit OpenAI-kompatiblen APIs ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se integrarem a diferentes serviços de LLM, como Anthropic, OpenAI e Google, usando o AgentFrameworkToolkit, permitindo a criação de pacotes NuGet personalizados de provedor de agente para funcionalidade expandida e compatibilidade com APIs compatíveis com OpenAI","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрироваться с различными сервисами LLM, такими как Anthropic, OpenAI и Google, с помощью AgentFrameworkToolkit, что позволяет создавать пользовательские пакеты NuGet для провайдеров агентов для расширенной функциональности и совместимости с API, совместимыми с OpenAI","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التكامل مع خدمات LLM المختلفة مثل Anthropic و OpenAI و Google باستخدام AgentFrameworkToolkit، وتمكين إنشاء حزم NuGet مخصصة لمزود وكيل للوظائف الموسعة والتوافق مع واجهات برمجة التطبيقات المتوافقة مع OpenAI"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom Agent Providers for unsupported LLM services","Integrating OpenAI-compatible LLM services like OpenRouter and XAI with the AgentFrameworkToolkit","Developing NuGet packages for easy distribution and deployment of custom Agent Providers"],"zh":["为不支持的 LLM 服务创建自定义 Agent Providers","使用 AgentFrameworkToolkit 将 OpenAI 兼容的 LLM 服务（如 OpenRouter 和 XAI）与 Microsoft Agent Framework 集成","开发 NuGet 包以便于分发和部署自定义 Agent Providers"],"ja":["サポートされていない LLM サービス用のカスタム エージェント プロバイダーを作成する","AgentFrameworkToolkit を使用して OpenAI と互換性のある LLM サービス (OpenRouter や XAI など) を Microsoft Agent Framework と統合する","カスタム エージェント プロバイダーの配布と展開を容易にするために NuGet パッケージを開発する"],"ko":["지원되지 않는 LLM 서비스를 위한 사용자 정의 에이전트 공급자를 생성하는 것","AgentFrameworkToolkit를 사용하여 OpenAI와 호환되는 LLM 서비스(OpenRouter 및 XAI 등)를 Microsoft 에이전트 프레임워크와 통합하는 것","사용자 정의 에이전트 공급자의 배포 및 배치를 쉽게하기 위해 NuGet 패키지를 개발하는 것"],"es":["Creación de proveedores de Agentes personalizados para servicios de LLM no compatibles","Integración de servicios de LLM compatibles con OpenAI como OpenRouter y XAI con el AgentFrameworkToolkit","Desarrollo de paquetes NuGet para una distribución y implementación sencillas de proveedores de Agentes personalizados"],"fr":["Création de fournisseurs d''agents personnalisés pour les services LLM non pris en charge","Intégration de services LLM compatibles OpenAI tels que OpenRouter et XAI avec l''AgentFrameworkToolkit","Développement de packages NuGet pour une distribution et un déploiement faciles de fournisseurs d''agents personnalisés"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Agent-Anbietern für nicht unterstützte LLM-Dienste","Integration von OpenAI-kompatiblen LLM-Diensten wie OpenRouter und XAI mit dem AgentFrameworkToolkit","Entwicklung von NuGet-Paketen für eine einfache Verteilung und Bereitstellung von benutzerdefinierten Agent-Anbietern"],"pt":["Criar provedores de agente personalizados para serviços de LLM não suportados","Integrar serviços de LLM compatíveis com OpenAI, como OpenRouter e XAI, com o AgentFrameworkToolkit","Desenvolver pacotes NuGet para distribuição e implantação fáceis de provedores de agente personalizados"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских провайдеров агентов для неподдерживаемых сервисов LLM","Интеграция сервисов LLM, совместимых с OpenAI, таких как OpenRouter и XAI, с AgentFrameworkToolkit","Разработка пакетов NuGet для простой распространения и развертывания пользовательских провайдеров агентов"],"ar":["إنشاء مزودو وكيل مخصصون لخدمات LLM غير مدعومة","التكامل مع خدمات LLM المتوافقة مع OpenAI مثل OpenRouter و XAI مع AgentFrameworkToolkit","تطوير حزم NuGet لنشر وتنفيذ سهل لمزودي وكيل مخصصين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Microsoft Agent Framework and C# expertise","Limited to LLM services with OpenAI-compatible APIs or custom implementations"],"zh":["需要 Microsoft Agent Framework 和 C# 전문 지식","仅限于具有 OpenAI 兼容 API 或自定义实现的 LLM 服务"],"ja":["Microsoft Agent Framework と C# の専門知識が必要","OpenAI と互換性のある API またはカスタム実装を持つ LLM サービスに限定される"],"ko":["Microsoft 에이전트 프레임워크 및 C# 전문 지식이 필요합니다","OpenAI와 호환되는 API 또는 사용자 정의 구현을 갖춘 LLM 서비스로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere Microsoft Agent Framework y experiencia en C#","Limitado a servicios de LLM con APIs compatibles con OpenAI o implementaciones personalizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite le Microsoft Agent Framework et une expertise en C#","Limité aux services LLM avec des API compatibles OpenAI ou des implémentations personnalisées"],"de":["Benötigt Microsoft Agent Framework und C#-Expertise","Begrenzt auf LLM-Dienste mit OpenAI-kompatiblen APIs oder benutzerdefinierten Implementierungen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Microsoft Agent Framework e C#","Limitado a serviços de LLM com APIs compatíveis com OpenAI ou implementações personalizadas"],"ru":["Требует знаний Microsoft Agent Framework и C#","Ограничен сервисами LLM с API, совместимыми с OpenAI, или пользовательскими реализациями"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بإطار وكيل Microsoft و C#","محدود لخدمات LLM بواجهات برمجة التطبيقات المتوافقة مع OpenAI أو التطبيقات المخصصة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1af877d6f124656b51ce905e161daa2e16fccf6f61c29f4ed782ea469fa86efd","qualityScore":44}');
