or、Codex、Gemini CLI）","自動化品質ゲートメカニズム","LLMオーケストレーションとプロンプトエンジニアリング最適化","開発者生産性向上ツール"],"ko":["AGENTS.md 표준 기반 체계적 워크플로우","테스트 우선 개발 방법론 통합","다중 플랫폼 지원（Cursor、Codex、Gemini CLI）","자동화 품질 게이트 메커니즘","LLM 오케스트레이션 및 프롬프트 엔지니어링 최적화","개발자 생산성 향상 도구"],"es":["Flujos de trabajo sistemáticos y automatizados","Agentes de codificación AI para Cursor, Codex y Gemini CLI","Calidad de código garantizada a través de pruebas y puertas de calidad","Integración con AGENTS.md para una gestión centralizada","Mejora de la productividad y la eficiencia en el desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Flux de travail systématiques et automatisés","Agents de codage IA pour Cursor, Codex et Gemini CLI","Qualité de code garantie via des tests et des portes de qualité","Intégration avec AGENTS.md pour une gestion centralisée","Amélioration de la productivité et de l''efficacité dans le développement de logiciels"],"de":["Systematische und automatisierte Workflows","KI-Coding-Agenten für Cursor, Codex und Gemini CLI","Code-Qualität durch Tests und Qualitätstoren gewährleistet","Integration mit AGENTS.md für eine zentrale Verwaltung","Verbesserung der Produktivität und Effizienz in der Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Estrutura de codificação sistemática","Portas de qualidade e teste para agents de IA","Integração com Cursor, Codex e Gemini CLI","Melhoria da produtividade com agents de IA","Suporte a workflows de codificação automatizados","Integração com agents de IA para melhorar a eficiência"],"ru":["Системная структура кодирования","Качественные ворота и тестирование для ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с Cursor, Codex и Gemini CLI","Повышение производительности с ИИ Агентами","Поддержка автоматизированных workflow кодирования","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами для повышения эффективности"],"ar":["هيكل برمجة منهجي","بوابات جودة واختبار للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع Cursor و Codex و Gemini CLI","تحسين الإنتاجية مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم سير عمل البرمجة الآلي","التكامل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين الكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理工作流","AGENTS.md使用指南","Cursor AI工具配置","Codex质量门控设置","Gemini CLI安装教程","AI编程代理最佳实践","测试优先开发框架","LLM编排工具","开发者自动化工具","AI代码质量提升"],"ja":["AIエージェントワークフロー","AGENTS.md使い方","Cursor AIツール設定","Codex品質ゲート設定","Gemini CLIインストールガイド","AIプログラミングエージェントベストプラクティス","テストファースト開発フレームワーク","LLMオーケストレーションツール","開発者自動化ツール","AIコード品質向上"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 워크플로우","AGENTS.md 사용 방법","Cursor AI 도구 설정","Codex 품질 게이트 설정","Gemini CLI 설치 가이드","AI 프로그래밍 에이전트 베스트 프랙티스","테스트 우선 개발 프레임워크","LLM 오케스트레이션 도구","개발자 자동화 도구","AI 코드 품질 향상"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","marco de codificación Agentic","agentes de codificación AI","automatización de flujos de trabajo","mejora de la productividad en el desarrollo de software","Guía de instalación de Agentic","Alternativas a Agentic","Agentic vs otros marcos de codificación"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","cadre de codage Agentic","agents de codage IA","automatisation des flux de travail","amélioration de la productivité dans le développement de logiciels","Guide d''installation d''Agentic","Alternatives à Agentic","Agentic vs autres cadres de codage"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","Agentic-Coding-Framework","KI-Coding-Agenten","Automatisierung von Workflows","Verbesserung der Produktivität in der Software-Entwicklung","Installationsanleitung für Agentic","Alternativen zu Agentic","Agentic vs andere Coding-Frameworks"],"pt":["como usar agente de IA","o que é agente de IA","ferramentas de agente de IA","alternativas para agente de IA","agente de IA vs competitor","instalar agente de IA","guias de configuração de agente de IA","desenvolvimento de software com agente de IA","automatização de workflow com agente de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","инструменты ИИ Агента","альтернативы ИИ Агенту","ИИ Агент vs конкурент","установка ИИ Агента","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента","разработка программного обеспечения с ИИ Агентом","автоматизация workflow с ИИ Агентом"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل المنافس","تثبيت وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أتمتة سير العمل مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"shinpr","repo":"agentic-code","repoPath":"shinpr/agentic-code","stars":35,"forks":3,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T14:33:29Z","topics":["agent-skills","agentic-ai","agentic-workflow","ai-agents","automation","codex","cursor","developer-tools","gemini-cli","llm-orchestration","productivity","prompt-engineering","skills"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"documentation-criteria","description":"Guides PRD, ADR, Design Doc, and Work Plan creation. Use when: planning features, writing specs, or creating technical documents.","bodyPreview":"# Documentation Creation Criteria\n\n## Creation Decision Matrix\n\n| Condition | Required Documents | Creation Order |\n|-----------|-------------------|----------------|\n| New Feature Addition | PRD → [ADR] → Design Doc → Work Plan | After PRD approval |\n| ADR Conditions Met (see below) | ADR → Design Doc → Work Plan | Start immediately |\n| 6+ Files | ADR → Design Doc → Work Plan (Required) | Start immediately |\n| 3-5 Files | Design Doc → Work Plan (Recommended) | Start immediately |\n| 1-2 Files |","body":"# Documentation Creation Criteria\n\n## Creation Decision Matrix\n\n| Condition | Required Documents | Creation Order |\n|-----------|-------------------|----------------|\n| New Feature Addition | PRD → [ADR] → Design Doc → Work Plan | After PRD approval |\n| ADR Conditions Met (see below) | ADR → Design Doc → Work Plan | Start immediately |\n| 6+ Files | ADR → Design Doc → Work Plan (Required) | Start immediately |\n| 3-5 Files | Design Doc → Work Plan (Recommended) | Start immediately |\n| 1-2 Files | None | Direct implementation |\n\n## ADR Creation Conditions (Required if Any Apply)\n\n### 1. Type System Changes\n- **Adding nested types/structures with 3+ levels**: e.g., `A { B { C { D } } }`\n  - Rationale: Deep nesting has high complexity and wide impact scope\n- **Changing/deleting types used in 3+ locations**\n  - Rationale: Multiple location impacts require careful consideration\n- **Data representation responsibility changes** (e.g., transfer object→domain model)\n  - Rationale: Conceptual model changes affect design philosophy\n\n### 2. Data Flow Changes\n- **Storage location changes** (DB→File, Memory→Cache)\n- **Processing order changes with 3+ steps**\n  - Example: \"Input→Validation→Save\" to \"Input→Save→Async Validation\"\n- **Data passing method changes** (props→Context, direct reference→events)\n\n### 3. Architecture Changes\n- Layer addition, responsibility changes, component relocation\n\n### 4. External Dependency Changes\n- Library/framework/external API introduction or replacement\n\n### 5. Complex Implementation Logic (Regardless of Scale)\n- Managing 3+ states\n- Coordinating 5+ asynchronous processes\n\n## Detailed Document Definitions\n\n### PRD (Product Requirements Document)\n\n**Purpose**: Define business requirements and user value\n\n**Includes**:\n- Business requirements and user value\n- Success metrics and KPIs (measurable format)\n- User stories and use cases\n- MoSCoW prioritization (Must/Should/Could/Won''t)\n- MVP and Future phase separation\n- User journey diagram\n- Scope boundary diagram\n\n**Excludes**:\n- Technical implementation details (→Design Doc)\n- Technical selection rationale (→ADR)\n- **Implementation phases** (→Work Plan)\n- **Task breakdown** (→Work Plan)\n\n### ADR (Architecture Decision Record)\n\n**Purpose**: Record technical decisions\n\n**Includes**:\n- Decision (what was selected)\n- Rationale (why that selection was made)\n- Option comparison (minimum 3 options) and trade-offs\n- Architecture impact\n- Principled implementation guidelines\n\n**Excludes**:\n- Implementation schedule, duration (→Work Plan)\n- Detailed implementation procedures (→Design Doc)\n- Specific code examples (→Design Doc)\n- Resource assignments (→Work Plan)\n\n### Design Document\n\n**Purpose**: Define technical implementation\n\n**Includes**:\n- **Existing codebase analysis** (required)\n  - Implementation path mapping (both existing and new)\n  - Integration point clarification (connection points with existing code even for new implementations)\n- Technical implementation approach (vertical/horizontal/hybrid)\n- **Technical dependencies and implementation constraints** (required implementation order)\n- Interface and type definitions\n- Data flow and component design\n- **E2E verification procedures at integration points**\n- **Acceptance criteria (measurable format)**\n- Change impact map (clearly specify direct impact/indirect impact/no ripple effect)\n- Complete enumeration of integration points\n- Data contract clarification\n- **Agreement checklist** (agreements with stakeholders)\n- **Code inspection evidence** (inspected files/functions during investigation)\n- **Field propagation map** (when fields cross component boundaries)\n- **Data representation decision** (when introducing new structures)\n- **Applicable standards** (explicit/implicit classification)\n- **Prerequisite ADRs** (including common ADRs)\n\n**Required Structural Elements**:\n```yaml\nChange Impact Map:\n  Change Target: [Component/Feature]\n  Direct Impact: [Files/Functions]\n  Indirect Impact: [Data format/Processing time]\n  No Ripple Effect: [Unaffected features]\n\nAPI Contract Change Matrix:\n  Existing: [Function/operation signature]\n  New: [Function/operation signature]\n  Conversion Required: [Yes/No]\n  Compatibility Strategy: [Approach]\n```\n\n**Excludes**:\n- Why that technology was chosen (→Reference ADR)\n- When to implement, duration (→Work Plan)\n- Who will implement (→Work Plan)\n\n### Work Plan\n\n**Purpose**: Implementation task management and progress tracking\n\n**Includes**:\n- Task breakdown and dependencies (maximum 2 levels)\n- Schedule and duration estimates\n- **Copy E2E verification procedures from Design Doc** (cannot delete, can add)\n- **Stage 4 Quality Assurance Stage (required)**\n- Progress records (checkbox format)\n\n**Excludes**:\n- Technical rationale (→ADR)\n- Design details (→Design Doc)\n\n**Stage Division Criteria**:\n1. **Stage 1: Foundation Implementation** - Type definitions, interfaces, test preparation\n2. **Stage 2: Core Feature Implementation** - Business logic, unit tests\n3. **Stage 3: Integration Implementation** - External connections, presentation layer\n4. **Stage 4: Quality Assurance (Required)** - Acceptance criteria achievement, all tests passing, quality checks\n\n**Three Elements of Task Completion Definition**:\n1. **Implementation Complete**: Code is functional\n2. **Quality Complete**: Tests, type checks, linting pass\n3. **Integration Complete**: Verified connection with other components\n\n## Creation Process\n\n1. **Problem Analysis**: Change scale assessment, ADR condition check\n   - Identify explicit and implicit project standards before investigation\n2. **ADR Option Consideration** (ADR only): Compare 3+ options, specify trade-offs\n3. **Creation**: Use templates, include measurable conditions\n4. **Approval**: \"Accepted\" after review enables implementation\n\n## Storage Locations\n\n| Document | Path | Naming Convention | Template |\n|----------|------|------------------|----------|\n| PRD | `docs/prd/` | `[feature-name]-prd.md` | `template-en.md` |\n| ADR | `docs/adr/` | `ADR-[4-digits]-[title].md` | `template-en.md` |\n| Design Doc | `docs/design/` | `[feature-name]-design.md` | `template-en.md` |\n| Work Plan | `docs/plans/` | `YYYYMMDD-{type}-{description}.md` | `template-en.md` |\n\n*Note: Work plans are stored in `docs/plans/` and excluded by `.gitignore`\n\n## ADR Status\n`Proposed` → `Accepted` → `Deprecated`/`Superseded`/`Rejected`\n\n## AI Automation Rules\n- 5+ files: Suggest ADR creation\n- Type/data flow change detected: ADR mandatory\n- Check existing ADRs before implementation\n\n## Diagram Requirements\n\nRequired diagrams for each document (using mermaid notation):\n\n| Document | Required Diagrams | Purpose |\n|----------|------------------|---------|\n| PRD | User journey diagram, Scope boundary diagram | Clarify user experience and scope |\n| ADR | Option comparison diagram (when needed) | Visualize trade-offs |\n| Design Doc | Architecture diagram, Data flow diagram | Understand technical structure |\n| Work Plan | Phase structure diagram, Task dependency diagram | Clarify implementation order |\n\n## Common ADR Relationships\n1. **At creation**: Identify common technical areas (logging, error handling, async processing, etc.), reference existing common ADRs\n2. **When missing**: Consider creating necessary common ADRs\n3. **Design Doc**: Specify common ADRs in \"Prerequisite ADRs\" section\n4. **Compliance check**: Verify design aligns with common ADR decisions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T02:00:12.419Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Agents requiring systematic documentation workflows with quality gates.","zh":"适用于需要系统化文档工作流和质量门的 AI 编码代理。","ja":"システム化されたドキュメントのワークフローと品質ゲートを必要とする AI コーディング エージェントに最適です。","ko":"시스템화된 문서 작업 흐름과 품질 게이트가 필요한 AI 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificación de IA que requieren flujos de trabajo de documentación sistemáticos con puertas de calidad.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Codage IA nécessitant des flux de travail de documentation systématiques avec des portes de qualité.","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Agents, die systematische Dokumentations-Workflows mit Qualitäts-Toren benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação de IA que exigem fluxos de trabalho de documentação sistemáticos com portões de qualidade.","ru":"Идеален для агентов кодирования ИИ, требующих системных рабочих процессов документации с контрольными точками качества.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز الإصطناعي الذي يتطلب سير عمل وثائقية منهجية مع بوابات جودة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enforces structured documentation workflows through AGENTS.md framework, enabling test-first development with built-in quality gates for Cursor, Codex, and Gemini CLI agents. Provides automated decision matrices for documentation requirements based on file count and feature complexity.","zh":"通过 AGENTS.md 框架强制执行结构化的文档工作流，从而实现带有 Cursor、Codex 和 Gemini CLI 代理的内置质量门的测试优先开发。根据文件数量和功能复杂性提供文档要求的自动化决策矩阵。","ja":"AGENTS.md フレームワークを通じて構造化されたドキュメントのワークフローを強制実施し、Cursor、Codex、Gemini CLI エージェントの内蔵品質ゲートを備えたテスト優先開発を可能にします。ファイル数と機能の複雑さに基づいてドキュメント要件の自動化された意思決定マトリックスを提供します。","ko":"AGENTS.md 프레임워크를 통해 구조화된 문서 작업 흐름을 강제實施하여 Cursor, Codex, Gemini CLI 에이전트의 내장 품질 게이트와 함께 테스트 우선 개발을 가능하게 합니다. 파일 수와 기능의 복잡성에 따라 문서 요구 사항에 대한 자동화된 의사 결정 행렬을 제공합니다.","es":"Establece flujos de trabajo de documentación estructurados a través del marco AGENTS.md, lo que permite el desarrollo de prueba primero con puertas de calidad integradas para los agentes Cursor, Codex y Gemini CLI. Proporciona matrices de decisión automatizadas para los requisitos de documentación en función de la cantidad de archivos y la complejidad de las características.","fr":"Impose des flux de travail de documentation structurés via le framework AGENTS.md, permettant ainsi le développement de test-first avec des portes de qualité intégrées pour les agents Cursor, Codex et Gemini CLI. Fournit des matrices de décision automatisées pour les exigences de documentation en fonction du nombre de fichiers et de la complexité des fonctionnalités.","de":"Erzwingt strukturierte Dokumentations-Workflows durch das AGENTS.md-Framework, was die testgesteuerte Entwicklung mit integrierten Qualitäts-Toren für die Cursor-, Codex- und Gemini-CLI-Agents ermöglicht. Bietet automatisierte Entscheidungsmatrizen für die Dokumentationsanforderungen auf der Grundlage der Anzahl der Dateien und der Funktionskomplexität.","pt":"Impõe fluxos de trabalho de documentação estruturados por meio do framework AGENTS.md, permitindo desenvolvimento de teste primeiro com portões de qualidade incorporados para agentes Cursor, Codex e Gemini CLI. Fornece matrizes de decisão automatizadas para requisitos de documentação com base na contagem de arquivos e complexidade de recursos.","ru":"Внедряет структурированные рабочие процессы документации посредством фреймворка AGENTS.md, позволяя разработку сначала теста с встроенными контрольными точками качества для агентов Cursor, Codex и Gemini CLI. Предоставляет автоматизированные матрицы решений для требований к документации на основе количества файлов и сложности функций.","ar":"فرض سير عمل وثائقية منظم من خلال إطار العمل AGENTS.md، مما يسمح بالتطوير الأول للاختبار مع بوابات جودة مدمجة للعاملين Cursor و Codex و Gemini CLI. يوفر مصفوفات قرارات آلية لمتطلبات الوثائق بناءً على عدد الملفات وcomplexContent."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PRD creation for new feature additions","Generating ADRs when architectural decisions are required","Creating design documents for multi-file implementations","Producing work plans for complex development tasks"],"zh":["自动创建新功能添加的 PRD","当需要架构决策时生成 ADR","为多文件实现创建设计文档","为复杂的开发任务生成工作计划"],"ja":["新しい機能追加の PRD を自動生成する","アーキテクチャの決定が必要な場合に ADR を生成する","複数ファイルの実装の設計文書を作成する","複雑な開発タスクの作業計画を生成する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 추가를 위한 PRD 자동 생성","아키텍처 결정이 필요한 경우 ADR 생성","다중 파일 구현을 위한 설계 문서 생성","복잡한 개발 작업을 위한 작업 계획 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de PRD para nuevas adiciones de características","Generar ADR cuando se requieren decisiones arquitectónicas","Crear documentos de diseño para implementaciones de varios archivos","Producir planes de trabajo para tareas de desarrollo complejas"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de PRD pour les nouvelles ajouts de fonctionnalités","Générer des ADR lorsque des décisions d''architecture sont nécessaires","Créer des documents de conception pour les implémentations de fichiers multiples","Produire des plans de travail pour les tâches de développement complexes"],"de":["Automatisieren der PRD-Erstellung für neue Funktionsadditionen","Erzeugen von ADR, wenn architektonische Entscheidungen erforderlich sind","Erstellen von Designdokumenten für Implementierungen mit mehreren Dateien","Erzeugen von Arbeitsplänen für komplexe Entwicklungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de PRD para adições de recursos novos","Gerar ADRs quando decisões arquiteturais são necessárias","Criar documentos de design para implementações de vários arquivos","Produzir planos de trabalho para tarefas de desenvolvimento complexas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание PRD для новых добавлений функций","Генерировать ADRs, когда требуются архитектурные решения","Создавать документы дизайна для реализаций с несколькими файлами","Производить планы работы для сложных задач разработки"],"ar":["توفير إنشاء تلقائي لملف مواصفات المنتج لاضافات الميزات الجديدة","توليد سجلات تصميم للعمارة عند الحاجة إلى قرارات تصميم","إنشاء مستندات تصميم لتنفيذ عدة ملفات","إنتاج خطط عمل لمهام التطوير المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AGENTS.md framework implementation","File count thresholds determine documentation requirements","PRD approval prerequisite for new feature documentation"],"zh":["需要 AGENTS.md 框架实现","文件数量阈值确定文档要求","PRD 批准是新功能文档的先决条件"],"ja":["AGENTS.md フレームワークの実装が必要","ファイル数の閾値がドキュメント要件を決定する","PRD の承認は新しい機能のドキュメントの前提条件"],"ko":["AGENTS.md 프레임워크 구현이 필요","파일 수 임계値가 문서 요구 사항을 결정","PRD 승인은 새로운 기능 문서의 선행 조건"],"es":["Requiere la implementación del marco AGENTS.md","Los umbrales de recuento de archivos determinan los requisitos de documentación","Aprobación de PRD como requisito previo para la documentación de nuevas características"],"fr":["Nécessite la mise en œuvre du framework AGENTS.md","Les seuils de comptage de fichiers déterminent les exigences de documentation","L''approbation de PRD est un prérequis pour la documentation des nouvelles fonctionnalités"],"de":["Erfordert die Implementierung des AGENTS.md-Frameworks","Dateizähl-Schwellenwerte bestimmen die Dokumentationsanforderungen","PRD-Genehmigung als Voraussetzung für die Dokumentation neuer Funktionen"],"pt":["Exige implementação do framework AGENTS.md","Limiares de contagem de arquivos determinam requisitos de documentação","Aprovação do PRD pré-requisito para documentação de recursos novos"],"ru":["Требует реализации фреймворка AGENTS.md","Пороги количества файлов определяют требования к документации","Одобрение PRD предварительное требование для документации новых функций"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ إطار العمل AGENTS.md","عتبات عدد الملفات تحدد متطلبات الوثائق","موافقة ملف مواصفات المنتج شرط مسبق لمواصفات الميزات الجديدة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d44ef2ecfa66db6c6aeec22525a38f071cde63e7934d40d85c6054294ed84a31","qualityScore":44}');
